window.SEARCH_INDEX = [{"s": 1, "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-1.html#big-idea", "text": "Everything, including you, is made of one vibrating structure. Your thoughts, emotions and actions send out a frequency, and that frequency decides which reality you move into next. Keep sending the same frequency and you lock in a timeline. To change your life, change the frequency, hold it steadily, take action, and let go of any expectation about how the result will come. You don't have to see it to believe it; you have to know it in order to see it.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 1, "title": "1.1  Reality is one structure — and you are it", "url": "section-1.html#part-1-1", "text": "The teaching starts with how everything is built. The whole universe comes from one single particle. That particle vibrates so fast that it keeps appearing next to itself, and next to itself again, without end. This is how one thing becomes everything. When two parts of this structure vibrate at a similar frequency (they \"resonate\"), they join and form a plasma, called a trinity plasma. Two similar plasmas can join again and make a third, and this repeats through the whole universe. The field is full of light and sound frequencies, so there are endless plasmas, and each one can hold a whole universe or cluster inside it. In the middle of a plasma is a black hole. The black hole is the portal, the doorway you pass through when you move from one reality to another. You are made of this same structure. When consciousness puts out a thought, it creates; that is how you were created too. So the teaching says you are the structure, the universe and the quantum field, \"the god particle\". Nobody is outside of you: there is no separate God sitting in the sky, and the other people you meet appear as a hologram, a projection made of frequency, sound, mantra and geometric patterns, so that consciousness can have an experience. This is also where science and religion meet. \"Religion, believe it or not, is science.\" Understood together, there is no need for different religions or for separation, because you are everything that you are. The one particle \"in the beginning had no laws,\" so it vibrates at infinite speed and appears next to itself to infinity; this is why we are all one. When you look at someone, that someone is you through a different experience (HR). Trinity structures form toruses, and the black holes inside them are multidimensional portals in the universal magma (SD); two similar systems combine as 1 + 1 = 3 (SD, NT). Every planet, including Earth, has a black hole at its centre acting as a portal (SD).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 1, "title": "1.2  What you send out is what you get back", "url": "section-1.html#part-1-2", "text": "Because you are the structure, your thoughts are not private events in your head. Every thought has a frequency, a sound and a geometric pattern. When you send out a thought together with an emotion and a deed, the three form one broadcast, a trinity of creation. That broadcast creates a parallel reality that matches it, and you move into that reality through the portal. You don't actually travel. You shift, like a snapshot jumping to the next frame. This is the simple reason why whatever you put out is what you get back: you are always stepping into the reality your own broadcast built. Every thought and every emotion is creating your reality. All three parts must match. Positive words with doubt underneath, or positive thoughts with no action, are not one clear signal. The teaching is to send thoughts, emotions and deeds \"at the same time as a trinity, non-stop\" in the positive. Your reality is a mirror image of your energy and thoughts. To create a reality you must be its vibration, acting and projecting the frequency, emotion and deeds into your hologram (DP). \"We are not traveling or moving at all. We are simply popping in and out of parallel realities\" (HR, NT).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 1, "title": "1.3  Timelines are built moment to moment", "url": "section-1.html#part-1-3", "text": "Picture realities as a long row of frames. Each moment you step into the next frame that matches what you are sending. If you keep sending the same emotion, for example sadness, then each new reality is built on sadness, and so is the next, and the next. That chain of similar realities is called a timeline. Staying in the same emotion moment after moment is how a timeline crystallizes: it becomes solid and real for you. To change it, you raise your thoughts to the positive, from a genuinely good feeling, and stay there moment after moment. The first positive moment moves you onto a different frame; holding it builds a new chain, and that new timeline crystallizes with a positive outcome. If you then want something else, you do the same again. Timelines differ in frequency. The higher the frequency, the less friction (resistance) there is: things manifest easily, and these realities are described as closer to the extraterrestrials. At lower frequency the structure is dense, and getting from one reality to the next feels \"like swimming underwater.\" Do \"steady positive implementation of your mind and feelings at all time\" (DP). New structures crystallize through \"repetition, repetition, repetition\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 1, "title": "1.4  If you can imagine it, it already exists", "url": "section-1.html#part-1-4", "text": "A rule (a \"bylaw\") taught by the extraterrestrials: you cannot think of something unless you already know its vibration. So if you can imagine a reality, it already exists somewhere in the field of your timeline. How can that be? Because there is no time. The one particle flickers so fast that all parallel realities exist at the same moment, side by side, in the \"quantum magma\". It is like a television on which every channel is playing at once; you are simply tuned to one. Which one you watch depends on the frequency of your emotion, thought and deed. Then why don't you see the reality you imagine? Because it isn't crystallized yet. Something that exists only in the field becomes visible when you take action and hold its frequency moment to moment. And since every reality is already running, there is nothing to worry about in switching between them.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 1, "title": "1.5  Why the same things keep happening", "url": "section-1.html#part-1-5", "text": "The field works at 100%. A reality is created only when you vibrate at its frequency. If you want something but your real frequency is different, you land in a different reality, and the old situation repeats. The comparison given is a film download: at 99% it won't play; it has to be 100%. The main thing that holds you below 100% is expectation. Your everyday, three-dimensional brain can't see how higher consciousness will bring something about; only the higher level knows the route. When you expect a particular outcome, you are carrying a hidden script of how it must happen, and that script is itself sent into the field as a frequency, a condition. Questioning or doubting the result does the same. It blocks the manifestation. So you let go of every expectation about how, and you simply know what you want. Knowing is 100%. You manifest in the now, not before and not later. Whatever you see in the meantime, stay calm, keep projecting the positive through thought, emotion and deed, and know that whatever happens is part of the process. The same download example appears in the book, with one addition: you must believe and feel at the same time, with the frequency of pure love, at 100%. Manifestation happens only when there is no ego (HR).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 1, "title": "1.6  Your emotion is your compass", "url": "section-1.html#part-1-6", "text": "Your true nature, the teaching says, is pure love. So the moment you feel hurt, fear or doubt, that feeling is your higher self, speaking from the heart, showing you that you are off-balance with who you really are. A painful emotion is a signal, not a verdict. The belief that you have no power was printed into you through indoctrination and manipulation. In reality you have all the power, because you are consciousness itself. What you see around you is a hologram that shows you your location: where you are in the field right now. If you don't recognise where you are, you can \"pop into\" a completely different reality without knowing how you got there. This is why reacting matters so much. If you answer a hard moment with the same negative emotion, you project the next hologram with the same Earth, the same person and the same problem, and the outcome \"could be a disaster.\" If you give a positive input instead, you keep shifting until a positive outcome crystallizes. Controlling your emotion is how you consciously create. The Method below is the practice.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 1, "title": "1.7  Abundance and receiving", "url": "section-1.html#part-1-7", "text": "The teaching is that money is an illusion within the hologram. Whether you need $1 or $1 million makes no difference to the structure: if you stay in the heart, without greed and without conditions, you receive exactly what you need through synchronicity, the right thing turning up at the right moment. What blocks receiving is the ego's belief that you must have a lot in the bank to feel good. We were conditioned to think we must charge something in order to have something. Ask yourself honestly: am I homeless? hungry? without clothes? \"Then what do you need?\" Feeling that you already have everything, and that everything is perfect, is the frequency that receives. The practical tool is the hide-and-seek game. When something seems missing, pull out of the worry, give thanks for what you have, then know it is already there and go looking for it, or take the next action. You are not searching in hope; you are searching because you know. In the structure it cannot be missing when you need it; you are shifting into the reality where you find it. Two cautions. First, watch the subtle drops: receiving something and thinking \"only this much?\" lowers your frequency. Stay in joy and gratitude, and more tends to follow, sometimes from several directions at once. Second, don't stay home in a low mood. A low mood projects you into a reality where no route appears. Lift your emotion, lift the people around you, and go about your day knowing you have what you need, without trying to work out the route. The structure is limitless; you never know how it will come. What you need can arrive as money, a donation or a gift, such as clothes instead of the money for clothes. The money system is still part of the structure, so you accept help gratefully when it comes. And it doesn't matter how something arrives, even if another person was the route: that is still the structure answering you. \"Give without expectations. Look for the manifestation without resistance\" (DP, NT). Abundance comes from within, by being the abundance; to see all abundance, give all abundance (DP). Giving and sharing from the heart with nothing expected back is called Energy Philanthropy, and it replaces the monetary-timeline illusion with energy from the heart (DP). Profiting from humanity's pain is explicitly opposed (DP). The key line on this \"In a quantum structure, you don't have to see it to believe it, you have to know it in order to see it.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 1, "title": "1.8  Lessons, agreements and other people", "url": "section-1.html#part-1-8", "text": "Not everything can be shifted at once. Some situations are agreements: experiences you (and the people close to you) agreed to before coming here, in order to learn. If it is an agreement, you cannot skip it or change its outcome by force. What you can do is accept it and pass the lesson with excellence, doing your best from the heart. Often you go through it so that you gain knowledge you will later use to help others. The guides are described as \"tough teachers\": they won't simply hand over every answer, because then you wouldn't learn. Both versions of any lesson exist side by side: the reality in which you handle it well and the one in which you don't. That is why someone who can see the structure may say \"do this, not that.\" Your task is to stay positive so that you learn through the process. As for others: since everyone you see is part of your projection, how you treat them is how you treat yourself. If someone manipulates you, don't go after them viciously; you would be going after yourself. Learn the lesson, pull out, and project the positive. What they did stays in their reality; your positive projection is \"taken care of\" by the structure, though you don't know how or how fast. With practice it can take just one thought, and a result can come within seconds or hours.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 1, "title": "The method — The Pull Out Method", "url": "section-1.html#method", "text": "What to do when something goes wrong, or when you want something: Notice. A painful emotion is your higher self telling you you're off-balance (your true nature is pure love). Pull out. Step out of the scene, as if watching it. \"Pull out and know that you are the structure.\" Don't react with the same emotion. Calm down completely. Be grateful for what you already have. Don't reject what's in front of you; rejection is a frequency too, and it comes back. Lift and project. Raise your emotion to the positive, and let your words, tone of voice and actions match it. Let go of the how. No script, no expectation of the outcome. Be okay with whatever outcome comes. Take action and hold it moment to moment, even if nothing changes at first. If you slip, go back to step 2.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 1, "title": "Why does the same thing keep happening, even when I'm trying to change it?", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "Because the field only creates what you vibrate at 100%. If part of you doubts, questions the result, or is holding a picture of exactly how it must happen, that doubt or picture is sent into the field too, and it blocks the new reality. Let go of the how, know what you want, stay calm whatever you see, and keep projecting the positive. Whatever happens in between is part of the process (see 1.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "title": "Why do some manifestations take a long time while others happen almost instantly?", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "There are two reasons. First, there is no time in the structure, so the delay usually comes from your own conditions and expectations. Second, there may be an agreement or a lesson in the way. For example, you may want contact with your galactic family now, but first need to gain certain knowledge, like finishing a school year. If you complete your lessons with excellence, the higher consciousness may decide to bring things forward, but that isn't guaranteed. Not all of us know our agreements.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "title": "I was raised to serve, not to ask for myself. Can I manifest for myself and still live abundantly?", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "Yes. Nothing is wrong with asking for yourself, as long as it doesn't come from greed or only from the money system. You are not separate from God; you are the structure, so the real question is how you are shaping it. Help and give from the heart: the people you serve are part of your own projection, so in a sense you are serving yourself too. Keep the job or \"platform\" that pays your bills; beyond that, do something from the heart every day for others. That shifts you toward abundance, which may come as money, a donation or a gift. Just don't lock it to money, and don't attach conditions, because what you put out comes back.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "title": "What does \"quantum structure\" mean?", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "It is the single vibrating field everything is made of. Similar frequencies join into plasmas, plasmas join into more plasmas, and the whole universe is built this way. You are made of it, so you are the structure: you project everything you see, and there is nobody outside of you (see 1.1). Its importance for you is that consciousness and science are the same thing seen from two sides.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "title": "How can I manifest for myself without affecting other people?", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "The people in front of you are part of your projection, so start with yourself. Pull out, calm down completely, and be grateful for what you have, without rejecting anything. Then imagine what you want without expecting a particular outcome. If someone is upset with you, answer kindly and without judgment, for example \"I understand you're upset; can we talk a bit later?\", and keep that positive tone even if they carry on. The result may be that they walk away, calm down, or end the friendship; be okay with any outcome. You projected love, so a positive outcome follows for you.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "title": "How can I consciously create, using the structure?", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "By controlling your emotion. When a feeling hurts, notice it as a sign you are off-balance with pure love. Pull out of the hologram, remember you are the structure, and lift the emotion straight away with gratitude. Then let the new reality come through synchronicity, without setting conditions on how. If you react with the same emotion, you just print the same scene again (see 1.6 and the Method).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "title": "How do I tell whether something is a soul agreement or something I can change?", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "If you try to shift something and it doesn't move, first check for conditions and doubts. If it still doesn't change, treat it as a lesson. The guidance given in one hard situation, a child's illness, was: \"It's a lesson. Accept this step.\" An agreement can't be skipped. Accept it, then pass it with excellence: do your best from the heart, learn everything it teaches, and know that the knowledge may later help others. Healing did come in that case, but it took time (see 1.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "title": "Is this \"dimensional materialization\" or simply attraction?", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "They are one and the same. Similar sounds and frequencies attract each other in the field and form matching parallel realities. That attraction is what builds your timelines and decides which reality you shift into.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "title": "I'd like to know how to use this in everyday life.", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "The everyday lessons are in 1.7: play the hide-and-seek game when something seems missing, don't let a low mood keep you home, stay grateful whatever arrives, and accept that the structure decides the route. Even when you find out another person was the route, it is still the structure answering you.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "title": "We seem stamped with patterns that keep replaying. How do I stop repeating them?", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "Each person's situation is individual, but the rule is the same: a pattern repeats until you pass its lesson with excellence, 100%, until no friction is left and it is completely balanced. And don't expect it to repeat: that belief is a projection too, and doubt sends doubt back. Know that whatever you do from the heart is positive, and don't doubt yourself.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "title": "How do I know whether I'm on my mission? The signs seem to have slowed down.", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "You are always on your mission; being here is part of it. To know your next step, take a sheet of paper, write what you love to do, and pick the most exciting thing, without thinking about the outcome. Stay with your passion; it shifts you, moment to moment, into the reality that gives you what you need.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "title": "Do binaural beats help with manifesting?", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "They are a permission slip: something you have chosen that helps you calm down, expand and connect. If they resonate with you, use them. The power to connect is yours, not the tool's.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "title": "Does understanding ley lines or the energy grid help to shift reality?", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "This question was not understood during the session, so it was not answered.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "title": "How can we lift all of humanity when so many don't yet see the need?", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "There is nobody outside of you; the people you see are part of your projection, each living their own lessons and agreements. Some agreements are very hard, such as living through war, and their suffering makes others say \"this is not right; let's unite.\" It is part of the awakening. Everyone is at a different stage, and the teaching is that \"we already made it.\" Your part is to follow your passion, which is your higher self: donate, help a cause, join a peace gathering or meditation if that calls you. You then create an Earth where that negativity no longer exists, or at least isn't part of your everyday life.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "title": "My ears keep ringing. How do I stop it?", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "It can be many things. One explanation given is sensitivity to the new frequencies the planet is receiving; many people go through it to different degrees. Don't be alarmed and don't treat it as negative. The deeper lesson: the same event has two possible realities. Believe you are being attacked by frequencies and you shift into that; see it as part of your ascension and you shift into a positive outcome. \"Which one you pick is up to you.\" (If ringing is persistent or comes with hearing loss or pain, it's sensible to have it checked by a doctor too.)", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "title": "Remember", "url": "section-1.html#remember", "text": "• You are the structure. What you send out comes back. • Change the frequency, then hold it, moment to moment. • Know it 100%. No doubts, no script of how. • Act. Be grateful. Accept any outcome. • \"You don't have to see it to believe it; you have to know it in order to see it.\"", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 2, "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-2.html#big-idea", "text": "Before you react, pull out to zero point: go still and neutral, and see where you are in the field. From there you choose the next frequency on purpose. You shift through realities that are similar in frequency, and each two merge into a third (1 + 1 = 3). That third reality takes on whatever emotion you held most. So don't fight or reject what you see. Overwrite it: choose the positive, amplify it until it is potent, hold it, then release it with no expectations.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 2, "title": "2.1  Zero point — stillness and knowing where you are", "url": "section-2.html#part-2-1", "text": "The talk revisits the one particle (see 1.1) and adds that it is also a nano particle: it expands, like breathing, and when it collapses it reaches the zero point. Zero point is stillness: no frequency coming in and no frequency going out. It is pure awareness of your location in the quantum field. The TV picture from 1.4 is extended: imagine sitting in front of many screens at once, each a reality you exist in. Which one you experience depends on your emotion, deeds and actions; they are your remote control. To use it well you first pull out and sit back in front of the screens, still, and check where you are. Knowing your location matters because if you don't, you \"pop out\" into a completely different reality or timeline without knowing where you are (see 1.6). Once you know your location, the next frequency you send from that awareness creates the next reality. Neutrality \"is the one that is giving you to choose with a clear mind\" the next frequency to project. You localize and stabilize in zero point, creating a \"vacuum of stillness,\" so you can shift and choose the new reality. Without it you live in \"constant duality, a constant battle of two or more realities\" (SD, the \"Mobilizing Structures\" chapter, which this talk reads from). Zero point is also called the heart structure \"where there is no conditions for manifestation\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2, "title": "2.2  Mobilizing structures: 1 + 1 = 3", "url": "section-2.html#part-2-2", "text": "You are always shifting from one reality to the next and reprinting everything around you each time. Two realities, one after the other, are similar but never exactly the same in frequency. To manifest, they must be similar enough to merge. When they merge, they form a third reality: 1 + 1 = 3, the trinity (see 1.1). Your emotion decides the merge. If you are happy and then drop into doubt, your energy field switches so sharply that you fall into a different reality, and the next one is built on the negative. If instead you stay steady and keep reacting positively, even while the other person stays negative, you override the negative moment by moment. The two timelines become one positive unit. Both timelines co-exist; you move between them by choosing. That choice is made from zero point. Without it, shifting is random, because uncontrolled emotion keeps dropping you into denser realities. Emotion gives the frequency to the next reality, and your deed (action) infuses it. If two parallel realities are not similar in resonance they \"can not merge as one\"; you must level the field so that no new frequency is given, then choose (SD). Two systems combine \"1 + 1 = 3\" (SD, NT).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2, "title": "2.3  Doubt makes you flicker", "url": "section-2.html#part-2-3", "text": "Doubt doesn't just pause you; it makes you bounce nonstop between two realities, like a waveform, so fast you can't tell where you're going. The quantum field never makes a mistake, so eventually it picks one: the one you infused more. If you spent more of the day in doubt, the third reality comes out negative, even if you didn't notice. Whatever emotion you stay in most, through the day and in your reactions, becomes the outcome. Fluctuating realities switch so quickly they cannot collapse into one, because they cannot hold the steady frequency of the heart (DP). Any doubt projects a holographic reality that mimics that doubt (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2, "title": "2.4  Neutral is for hard moments — joy is not to be suppressed", "url": "section-2.html#part-2-4", "text": "Zero point means being neutral in a disturbing situation: not giving or taking emotion, just observing. It does not mean holding back joy. When you feel joy, keep going: each next shift is again joy, and you build a joyful timeline. The new frequencies arriving now, the talk says, come from the fifth dimension and above, are positive, and can activate your DNA. The more positive you are, the more positive you see.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2, "title": "2.5  Other people's projections are not your truth", "url": "section-2.html#part-2-5", "text": "What you are shown, especially in the news, is a projection of someone else's timeline placed on top of you. Watch it over and over and you start to believe it; once you believe it 100%, it manifests for you. Instead, be aware: \"That's what they're projecting. Good for them. Love and light.\" The example is a storm forecast. Instead of accepting it, project that the weather is beautiful and keep doing so even if the sky is dark or rain starts. Give gratitude even for the rain: gratitude neutralizes what you see, bringing you to zero, so your new frequency can override it. The alternative is fluctuating into doubt because someone else told you what would happen. Language matters: say \"I know\", not \"I will\". \"Will\" keeps you waiting; manifestation is in the now. Also follow the money: if something is truly for humanity, it comes through the heart, not at a high price.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2, "title": "2.6  Overwrite — don't reject, don't \"delete\"", "url": "section-2.html#part-2-6", "text": "You cannot delete a negative thought by rejecting it, because what you see is part of the structure, and you are the structure (see 1.1). You \"delete\" it through neutrality: \"I understand you're there. Thank you for showing me where I'm at in the quantum field.\" Then project a new, stronger frequency over it. You are not rejecting it; you are overriding it. The guidance is to make the new frequency potent. When told \"Action!\" like an actor, switch your emotion to positive and keep increasing the joy until you have goosebumps or tears. Like a stronger dose of medicine, it has to be stronger than the dense frequency it replaces. Then hold it, and finally to drop it: release it into the field so the consciousness you're made of can crystallize it. Dropping it matters because holding on adds conditions. With no conditions, \"Pandora's box is open\" and you receive everything you need. In the example given, the whole day turned out positive. Release the specifics too. Imagine the big picture without scripting it (the example: humanity living in beautiful cities, with free energy and benevolent extraterrestrials) and keep holding it, even when you hear negative news.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2, "title": "2.7  Every moment is a brand-new reality", "url": "section-2.html#part-2-7", "text": "When you fall off the timeline you wanted and then rise again, you don't return to the old one: you create a brand new reality, and every moment does the same. That's why you can let go of past sorrow: it has nothing to do with the new you projected into the field. A timeline you held long enough can crystallize so differently that you no longer remember someone from an old one. What you repeat, you build. A constant diet of violent films or games feeds a timeline similar to it, which is why the advice is not to let children consume a lot of negative content. You also need recall. Each new hologram reprints the frequencies of the last one so you know where you are. When you walk into a room and forget why, you have shifted so fast you lost the frequency. The method: recall the previous room's frequency — where you were, what you were thinking, doing or saying — and the memory returns. \"Do not hold your previous emotions. It is irrelevant,\" because each parallel universe you shift into exists for itself, in the now (SD). Night dreams and waking life are both dreams; you only shift perception, and \"everything is NOW\" (HR).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2, "title": "2.8  Ascension: your own, and always positive", "url": "section-2.html#part-2-8", "text": "This reality is described as a dream state of consciousness that feels real, like touching something in a dream. Raising your consciousness shifts you to another timeline. Contact with extraterrestrials works the same way: your reality and theirs merge into a third, which needs similar frequencies held steady. Consciousness cannot exist in the negative only; it would disengage. So persistent negativity eventually dissipates, and people who stay negative meet realities that push them to stop. Each person makes their own ascension: be kind, share and give, and you match the less dense fifth-dimensional structures. Choose greed and negativity, and you project into a dense timeline, \"underwater\" instead of above it (see 1.3). In ascension \"all the dirt\" comes to the surface because it can't match 5D. Don't hate those exposed; it is their level of consciousness. Give gratitude that it came out. Without seeing the negative you couldn't choose the positive. It is a classroom: learn the lesson and move on. Love is the highest frequency; fear, hatred, jealousy and revenge are lower and trap you in a lower hologram of wars and destruction. A negative, materialistic or ego-driven person will see that reflected (HR). \"You are dreaming the ascension but you already made it\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2, "title": "2.9  Affirmations, ego and peeling the layers", "url": "section-2.html#part-2-9", "text": "Affirmations work when stated in the now: \"I am fine,\" \"I am great.\" \"I'm going to be fine\" is false language that keeps you waiting. Say it knowing it 100%, so your frequency stops fluctuating, even if others say otherwise. But watch the ego. Affirming \"I'm perfect\" to dismiss someone's fair feedback is ego. Peel the layers: why do I really want this? Is it from my heart or my ego? Do I want to talk to one person, or a thousand because it makes me feel important? Ego is dense and built on false pretense. The heart's vibration is consciousness itself, which is why heart-based manifestation can be instant, while conditions slow it. We are perfect in the structure, but confused and manipulated. You will be tested, and what counts is how you behave towards people. When you slip into ego, you will be corrected: shift to gratitude and drop expectations towards people and situations. \"The Ego structure is lowering your vibrational signal.\" Do not try to profit from others; abundance comes in any form, not only money (DP, NT).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2, "title": "2.10  When people stay negative", "url": "section-2.html#part-2-10", "text": "Talk it through and try to change the situation. If it doesn't change, pull out and choose where you want to be, so you keep your integrity. It hurts because you care. But don't hate: hatred is a false pretense too. Love the person, who is out of balance, and offer help. If they refuse it, put your energy into people who are ready. \"Make your own world.\" On money (see 1.7): pay your bills and do your work. But don't let \"how can I make money from this person?\" sit behind your help. Give from the heart and what you need can arrive. Finally, the talk stresses that it shares one truth, the one it was shown, to explain how the structure works. What you hear from anyone, including messages and news, is a projection from another timeline and doesn't have to be your truth. The aim is to empower you, so that you don't need anyone else to do it for you: you are the consciousness itself, and you choose what to create.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2, "title": "The method — the Overwrite Protocol", "url": "section-2.html#method", "text": "Use it the moment you notice a negative emotion, a disturbing scene, or someone else's projection: Notice the drop. \"I recognise what I just did.\" Negative emotion is a denser frequency. Pull out. Tell yourself, \"I am a hologram.\" Step back as if watching the screens. Go to zero point. Still and neutral, with no emotion in or out. Find your location. Say \"Thank you for showing me where I'm at.\" Don't reject what you see; gratitude neutralizes it. Choose with a clear mind: the positive, through the heart. Speak it in the now (\"I am\", \"I know\"). Amplify. Switch the emotion on like an actor on cue and increase it until you feel it strongly (goosebumps, tears). It must be stronger than what it overwrites. Hold, hold, hold, steadily and at 100%, even if the scene doesn't change yet. Steadiness decides the 1 + 1 = 3 outcome. Drop it. Release it into the field with no expectations of how, and let consciousness crystallize it.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2, "title": "Could you explain again how two realities come together to make a third?", "url": "section-2.html#questions", "text": "You are shifting from one reality to the next all the time, and each time you reprint everything around you. Two realities in a row are similar but never identical. If you stay steady in one emotion, say happiness, the two are close enough to merge, and the third reality that comes out carries that happiness. If you drop into doubt or anger in between, your energy field switches so sharply that you fall into a different reality, and the third one comes out negative. So the outcome is decided by the emotion you keep holding (see 2.2, 2.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2, "title": "How do agreements affect the path to an outcome?", "url": "section-2.html#questions", "text": "An agreement is something specific you came here to complete, and you will be guided towards it whatever you do. If you don't listen, you may take detours, but you still end up there. Guidance you ignore at first often leads you into a situation that proves it was right, and that is how you learn to pay attention. Guidance may also steer you away from people who are trying to use you, without telling you why, so you can protect the integrity of your work. Within your agreements, you still choose your reality and your outcome.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2, "title": "How do I know I'm at zero point, in stillness?", "url": "section-2.html#questions", "text": "Zero point means you are neutral: in the middle, not giving out emotion and not taking it in, just observing. Whenever something stirs a strong emotion in you, pull out, say to yourself \"I'm in a hologram,\" and simply watch. That still, aware observing is zero point. From there you can choose the next frequency with a clear mind (see 2.1).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2, "title": "If I'm feeling real joy, is that a neutral state? Should I hold it back?", "url": "section-2.html#questions", "text": "No, joy isn't neutral, and you should not hold it back. Neutral is for disturbing moments. When you feel joy, keep going: the next reality you shift into is again joy, and the next, until you have built a joyful timeline. The new frequencies arriving now are positive and come from the fifth dimension and above; the more positive you are, the more positive you see (see 2.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2, "title": "We're programmed to think negatively. Can I tell the field \"I don't accept this thought\" and delete it?", "url": "section-2.html#questions", "text": "You can't delete it by rejecting it, because what you see is part of the structure, and you are the structure; rejection is just another frequency sent out. You delete it through neutrality. Say \"I understand you're there. Thank you for showing me where I'm at.\" Then pull out, and project a strong new positive frequency over it: switch your emotion like an actor on cue, increase it until you feel it strongly, hold it, then release it. You're not rejecting it; you're overriding it (see 2.6).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2, "title": "If I drop off the timeline I want and then raise my frequency again, do I go back to the same timeline?", "url": "section-2.html#questions", "text": "No. Every moment you create a brand-new reality, so you build a new timeline rather than returning to the old one. This is good news: you can let go of past sorrow, because it has nothing to do with the new you that you're projecting now. It's also why, after a long time on a very different timeline, you may no longer remember someone from the old one (see 2.7).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2, "title": "Are affirmations effective for correcting negative thinking?", "url": "section-2.html#questions", "text": "Yes, when they are a statement in the now: \"I am fine,\" \"I am at peace,\" not \"I'm going to be fine,\" which keeps you waiting. Say it knowing it 100%, so your frequency stops fluctuating, even if others say otherwise. But check for ego: affirming \"I'm perfect\" to brush off fair feedback is ego. Peel the layers and ask whether you want something from the heart or from the ego (see 2.9).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2, "title": "I understand it completely. Living it is a whole other matter. What then?", "url": "section-2.html#questions", "text": "That's why it needs practice. Each time a situation comes up, pull yourself out and remember you are in a hologram; if you forget, it is very easy to slide back into the emotion and project the negative. Watch the teaching again, study it like maths, and apply it daily. As you practise, you begin to vibrate differently and connect more with your guidance, and you will be tested, mostly on how you treat people.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2, "title": "Remember", "url": "section-2.html#remember", "text": "• Pull out to zero point first, then choose. • The outcome follows the emotion you hold most. Doubt makes you flicker. • Don't reject. Neutralize with gratitude, then overwrite. • Amplify, hold, then drop it: no conditions. • Every moment is new. Speak in the now. Check heart against ego.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 3, "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-3.html#big-idea", "text": "When what you say or do differs from what you truly feel, you send two frequencies at once and start to flicker between two realities. The field always delivers the more potent one, and that is what you truly feel. Because the cover-up is dense, it often arrives as a negative stoppage. There is no such thing as a white lie: be truthful from the heart, kindly. The same no-time structure explains bilocation (A to B = AB). Your heart is the compass for every truth you hear, including teachers'.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 3, "title": "3.1  Two frequencies at once: the overlay", "url": "section-3.html#part-3-1", "text": "The teaching example: someone doesn't want to go out with a friend, but to be polite says, \"Yes, I'm so excited!\" Then they spend the next half hour wishing they had stayed home. Within minutes they hurt a foot badly enough that they nearly can't go. The explanation of what happened: What you truly feel is your real, heart-level frequency, and it is potent. What you say on top of it is an overlay: another layer of emotion and reality that isn't your true self, \"like a lie\". Now you are sending two frequencies at the same time, so you flicker like a waveform between two realities, through endless probabilities. The field then picks the more potent one, and that is always what you truly feel. It searched through all the probabilities for a way to keep them home. Energy is unbiased: it goes where you sent it, but you don't know the route. It could have been their own injury, or something happening to the friend. And because the overlay is a lie, the frequency is dense, so the result usually comes as a negative stoppage.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 3, "title": "3.2  There is no white lie", "url": "section-3.html#part-3-2", "text": "\"There is no white lie or a bad lie. Frequency is frequency.\" Small or big, the energy goes somewhere, usually into the negative, because it isn't your true self. It is the same mechanism as doubt (see 2.3): two frequencies, flickering, and the more potent one wins. This is how negative energy builds up. Karma is defined as accumulated false pretense: the build-up of everything you said or did that wasn't your true vibration. Being truthful doesn't mean over-explaining. You can say, kindly: \"I'm sorry, something came up. Can we do it another time?\" People usually understand. You don't owe anyone the private details, and you should respect other people's privacy in the same way. Building on a lie creates \"duality of false frequency realities,\" which keeps fluctuating and cannot collapse into one; you end up \"living in your own deception,\" because the field mimics your structure precisely (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 3, "title": "3.3  You are always fluctuating — so fluctuate in the positive", "url": "section-3.html#part-3-3", "text": "You shift through endless realities all the time, so no one can map your exact path, not even you. The aim is to stay positive most of the time, which eventually becomes all the time as it crystallizes. Through joy, giving and sharing from the heart, each next hologram is built on the positive. When you project positive from your true heart, know the outcome is positive. What you can't know is how or when; your 3D brain can't calculate infinite probabilities (see 1.5). When your emotion drops, switch it with gratitude for everything you have, and keep shifting. With mastery and no ego, manifestation can become instant.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 3, "title": "3.4  Ego is an overlay too", "url": "section-3.html#part-3-4", "text": "Wanting something to show off, or wanting more when you already have enough, is also an overlay: greed and manipulation sit on top of your true self. The teaching example is acting out of anger and wanting to be admired for a car; a serious accident followed quickly, with the question, \"Does it matter what type of car you're driving?\" Lesson: things are not who you are; seeking recognition through them is false pretense. Once you learn this, consequences arrive much faster. So keep peeling the layers (see 2.9): Was that truly what I felt? Did I do it from ego, or to make people think well of me so I'd feel better? When you find the true vibration, switch to it and hold it with your emotions and deeds. The better you master this, the faster outcomes come, because there is no time. The same applies to money (see 1.7): keep giving and sharing, and one day you'll need something and find it in front of you.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 3, "title": "3.5  Bilocation: A to B = AB", "url": "section-3.html#part-3-5", "text": "Measured against the motion of the Earth, the solar system and the universe, you are not moving at all: you are shifting like snapshots (see 1.2). Since the field has no time, you don't have to pass through every in-between reality. You can skip them and land directly in another: A to B is AB. That is bilocation, cutting through time-space at zero point. We can all do it; it is the goal. If it happens to you unexpectedly, for example ending up somewhere far from where you were driving, the advice is not to be scared. Let the explanation sink in, and work towards doing it knowingly. The way to learn it is through the structure, in order: quantum manifestation (Section 1), mobilizing structures (Section 2), the third reality you create with others, truth and deception (this section), then bilocation. The same A-to-B calculation appears in the book: \"we are actually not traveling or moving at all. We are simply popping in and out of parallel realities\" (HR). Bilocation is listed with levitation and telepathy as abilities of the emerging new human (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 3, "title": "3.6  Your heart is the compass — without judgment", "url": "section-3.html#part-3-6", "text": "Everyone speaks their truth from their own timeline, and between you and another person you create a third reality (see 2.2). So don't judge someone who truly believes they're right; even people doing harmful things act from their belief system and conditioning. (The example: we eat animals and consider them lower; what if a higher consciousness saw us the same way?) But do peel the layers: is this person speaking from the heart, or deceiving? If it isn't from the heart, ask \"What can I do to make the situation better?\" You don't have to join that kind of consciousness. Give love and light and stay in the heart. Negative can't withstand positive; positive always overrides density eventually, because consciousness must exist (see 2.8). The same applies to teachers and channels, including this one. Stay with whatever resonates with your heart. If something doesn't, perhaps it isn't your time for it, and that's fine. But don't keep supporting a big name out of false pretense once you sense, or discover, greed and manipulation. Being untruthful with yourself makes you fluctuate too. \"If there is negative talk let it be in that person's reality. Do not judge them. Everyone has a right to create and believe whatever they wish\" (DP). Those who oppose you can be \"your biggest teachers\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 3, "title": "3.7  Big frequency jumps — and checking your body", "url": "section-3.html#part-3-7", "text": "Shifting very quickly to a much higher frequency (\"3 to 7\" is only an example) can be too big a jump for the body, causing dizziness, nausea or even fainting. Reading can trigger it, because every word is a frequency: reading too far ahead, against guidance, can bring on nausea. The Harmonic Reactor book is said to carry fifth-dimensional frequency for this reason. This is integration, and it is normal. But it is made clear that it can also be a drop in frequency, or a sign that you are not healthy: \"maybe the sugar ended up dropping down.\" So if it happens, check what is going on with your body. \"Every word has sound geometry\" and penetrates your DNA code (SD, NT).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 3, "title": "3.8  Heart connection versus lust", "url": "section-3.html#part-3-8", "text": "When intimacy with a partner comes from the heart, it reaches a level of connection free of false pretense, and that energy is directed into a different timeline. Practices such as tantra are a permission slip (see 1.6, Q10). Once you know the vibration of loving ecstasy, you can recall it and hold it in everyday life without a ritual; you can't think of something whose vibration you don't already know (see 1.4). Lust is not the heart structure. Content that pulls emotion into lust leads to a different timeline, and turning intimacy into a constant ritual can pull you away from what matters, even into addiction. \"Lust is emptiness and it will never manifest you love\"; it loops the same energy and can spiral downward into empty self-indulgence. Learn to feel the difference between the body's reaction and the purity of heart love (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 3, "title": "3.9  Words, light language and downloads", "url": "section-3.html#part-3-9", "text": "Words are frequencies and mantras. Many words carry hidden meanings: read \"war\" backwards and it is \"raw\", and consciousness takes in both. So speak from the heart, with positive words and positive intention. Light language, such as unfamiliar script arriving through automatic writing, is coding made for your own consciousness, or sometimes the language of your galactic family. Accept it as it is; your consciousness crystallizes and transforms it, often as an activation. Ancient tablets are said to carry light language that can activate people who look at them. Information can also arrive as a download: a whole book's worth at once, which you then explain step by step. Everyone can do this, because you are consciousness and all the information is there. Like the \"genius\" child who simply knows the answer, you don't always need the working-out. Don't put conditions on it.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 3, "title": "3.10  Stargates, not the Lion's Gate", "url": "section-3.html#part-3-10", "text": "The guidance behind these teachings (the Council of Nine and the 11-dimensional beings) is not working with portals such as the Lion's Gate, which belong to a different timeline sequence for those whose agreements lead there. They work with stargates: portals for ascension through intergalactic timelines. This is said to extend life beyond the 3D norm, \"80 years may turn into 300 or 500,\" through connection with your galactic family. Those involved are predetermined by timelines and agreements. Every system in the galaxy has a stargate, and you cannot pass through one unless your body resonates with it; negative thoughts and deeds won't match the resonance. \"So be good all the time\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 3, "title": "The method — the Truth Check", "url": "section-3.html#method", "text": "Use it before you answer, agree, buy or act, and whenever something you said doesn't sit right: Pause and feel. What do I truly feel about this, underneath politeness or habit? Peel the layers. Is this from my heart, or from ego, fear of disappointing, wanting to impress, or greed? Say your truth kindly. Brief and polite (\"Something came up, can we do it another time?\"). No full explanation needed. If you already overlaid it (said yes, meant no), catch it and correct it honestly before the two frequencies play out. If your emotion drops, switch it with gratitude for what you have (see 3.3). Project the positive from the heart and let go of when, where, who and how.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 3, "title": "Isn't this the same explanation as when we doubt?", "url": "section-3.html#questions", "text": "Yes, exactly. A lie and a doubt work the same way: you send two different frequencies at once, so you start to fluctuate between two realities, and the field gives you whichever one is more potent. With a lie, the more potent one is what you truly feel, so you get it, often by an unpleasant route. The fix for both is to be honest with yourself about what you really feel and redirect your thoughts and emotions to that (see 3.1, 3.2).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 3, "title": "So it's important to live in our own truth, let others live in theirs, and listen to our hearts?", "url": "section-3.html#questions", "text": "Yes. Be truthful to what you really feel. You don't have to over-explain when you say no; a polite \"Something has come up, can we do it another time?\" is enough, and people usually understand. If something is private, you can keep it private, and you should respect other people's privacy in the same way. What you shouldn't do is say something different from what you feel, because, small or big, that energy goes somewhere, usually into the negative (see 3.2).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 3, "title": "If I keep fluctuating and creating new timelines, does anyone know where I'm going, except my heart?", "url": "section-3.html#questions", "text": "You fluctuate through endless realities, so no one can map your exact path. What matters is to fluctuate in the positive: stay in joy, giving and sharing from the heart most of the time, and it becomes all the time as it crystallizes. When you project the positive from your true heart, you can know the outcome will be positive. What you can't know is how or when it comes, so don't set expectations. If your emotion drops, switch it with gratitude and keep going (see 3.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 3, "title": "My daughter turned at a stop sign near her home and found herself on the other side of the city. Did she go to another reality? How can we do this consciously?", "url": "section-3.html#questions", "text": "She shifted to a different reality and skipped all the realities in between. Because there is no time in the field, you don't have to pass through every frame from A to B; you can go straight there: A to B is AB. That is bilocation, and it is a good ability, not something to fear. Let the explanation sink in, and redirect the fear into knowing that you can do it. To learn it consciously, study the structure in order: manifestation (Section 1), mobilizing structures (Section 2), the shared third reality, truth and deception (this section), then bilocation (see 3.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 3, "title": "Is everyone telling me their own version of the truth? Is my heart my compass?", "url": "section-3.html#questions", "text": "Yes. Each person speaks from their own timeline and understanding, so don't judge someone who truly believes they are right. But do peel the layers: is it coming from the heart, or is it deception? If it isn't from the heart, stay in the heart yourself and ask \"What can I do to make this better?\" You don't have to take part in it (see 3.6).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 3, "title": "I'm bombarded with videos and channels, each with their own truth. How do I know what to believe?", "url": "section-3.html#questions", "text": "Stay with what resonates with your heart; you always know when something resonates. Check that it really is what you feel, not something you think you ought to feel. If a teaching doesn't resonate, perhaps it isn't your time for it, and that's fine. But if you sense, or find out, that a speaker is greedy or manipulative, don't keep supporting them just because they are well known; being untruthful with yourself makes you fluctuate (see 3.6).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 3, "title": "I collapsed on the bathroom floor, and my heart says I shifted to a higher density. Why?", "url": "section-3.html#questions", "text": "One explanation is a very fast jump in frequency: shifting quickly from a low frequency to a much higher one can be too much for the body at once, and you may feel nauseous or even pass out. Reading can trigger it too, because every word carries a frequency. This is integration and can be normal. But it can also be a drop in frequency or a health problem, such as low blood sugar, so check what is happening with your body; a collapse is worth seeing a doctor about (see 3.7).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 3, "title": "Is human evolution organic, for example through tantra and a strong sensual connection?", "url": "section-3.html#questions", "text": "When intimacy comes from the heart, it reaches a level of connection without false pretense, and that energy is redirected into a different timeline. But tantra is a permission slip: once you know the vibration of that loving ecstasy, you can recall it and hold it in everyday life without a ritual. Avoid content that pulls your emotion into lust, which leads to a different timeline and can become an addiction. And everything you connect with, animals included, is within your hologram, because the one particle is both the smallest thing and the whole universe (see 3.8, 1.1).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 3, "title": "What about the Lion's Gate portal?", "url": "section-3.html#questions", "text": "The guidance behind these teachings doesn't work with that portal; it belongs to a different timeline sequence, for people whose agreements lead there. This guidance works with stargates: portals for ascension through intergalactic timelines, said to extend life far beyond the usual span through connection with your galactic family (see 3.10).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 3, "title": "When I sit with pen and paper, I write in a cursive script that nobody can read. What is it?", "url": "section-3.html#questions", "text": "It is light language: coding made for your own consciousness, which only you can construct and deconstruct, or sometimes the language of your galactic family. Accept it as it is; your consciousness crystallizes and transforms it. It may be an activation, or information you need. Be glad of it: this is how it begins, and it can open more downloads (see 3.9).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 3, "title": "Remember", "url": "section-3.html#remember", "text": "• What you truly feel is the potent frequency, and the field delivers it. • There is no white lie. Be truthful, kindly; you don't owe a full explanation. • Karma is accumulated false pretense. Peel the layers: heart or ego? • A to B = AB. There is no time, so the in-between can be skipped. • Your heart is your compass. Don't judge; stay with what resonates.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 4, "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-4.html#big-idea", "text": "Every fixed price is a condition: a specific code you send into the field you are made of. Keep sending it, and you crystallize a timeline where the only way to receive anything is through money. Giving from the heart, and letting people choose what to give back, puts no condition on the field, so it can answer through infinite routes: money, donations, gifts, synchronicity. You still work and pay your bills, and you never reject money; you just don't limit yourself to it. To see a timeline of abundance, be the abundance.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 4, "title": "4.1  Where this comes from", "url": "section-4.html#part-4-1", "text": "The guidance for sharing this work was never to charge a price, but to let people donate for the time if they wished. That is confusing at first, since we all live in the money system, so the reason is taught step by step, through the quantum structure. It is shared as a map: use it or not, without judgment. The talk recaps the structure (see 1.1) and adds one link: sound and light combine into a trinity structure, which becomes plasma and a gravitational field; when that lowers its vibration, it becomes matter. We are made this way, so every thought and emotion reprints the next reality (see 1.2–1.3).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 4, "title": "4.2  A price is a code in the field", "url": "section-4.html#part-4-2", "text": "Every thought and emotion has its own exact frequency, sound and mantra. A condition is a specific code you send because you want a specific result. Telling people \"to talk to me it costs $300\" sends that code. Since you are the structure, the field answers in kind: your abundance can then arrive only through the monetary system. Everything else in life also has to be paid for or worked for, because that is the frequency you projected. The heart structure is the highest consciousness there is: still sound and light, but not dense. The money frequency arises through conditioning and is denser. Give from the heart, with no condition and with the other person free to choose, and you vibrate in that higher structure, leaving the whole field open. This isn't punishment; it is \"simply a matter of quantum physics.\" Live mostly by conditions and you build a hologram where, wherever you turn, someone is asking you for something. Remember, there is nobody outside of you (see 1.1): you recall and mimic that frequency in the people around you. \"Money is an illusion. It is blocking your signature of your heart. The exchange is through the heart\" (DP). Abundance comes \"through any form, not only money,\" not through \"conditions of old belief systems\" (SD, NT). This book passage itself refers readers to this video.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 4, "title": "4.3  Be the abundance", "url": "section-4.html#part-4-3", "text": "The new frequencies arriving with ascension are very high and match the heart. To see a reality you must be its frequency, so your deeds, emotions and treatment of people must be of the heart for you to shift into and crystallize a timeline of absolute abundance. That abundance might not involve money at all; one picture is extraterrestrials helping build cities. Consciousness itself is complete abundance. The more conditions you give as frequencies rise, the more you drop away from that timeline, simply because you aren't being the abundance towards others. To experience full abundance \"you have to first be the abundance yourself.\" Giving and sharing from the heart with no expectation of return is Energy Philanthropy, which replaces the monetary timeline (DP; see 1.7).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 4, "title": "4.4  The platform path for people who must earn", "url": "section-4.html#part-4-4", "text": "For someone who provides for a family, the guidance is not to quit. Go to work and pay your bills. Then, after work, do what excites you most, hold that vibration, and give from the heart nonstop, without expectations. This balances the structure and opens the field to return to you what you gave. Little by little your passion's heart frequency overrides the monetary one. Letting go of the belief that you need money to receive takes practice, because we are bombarded daily. The way through is step by step, without fear. What arrives may still be money, because you don't reject it, but through the heart: someone loves your paintings or handbags and offers a free gallery and sponsorship. Charging high prices to save for land or a facility is \"pure illusion\": it crystallizes the money route, when someone could instead call and fund it outright. If they do, you accept, because you simply did your job to the best of your abilities.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 4, "title": "4.5  Don't reject money — just don't limit yourself to it", "url": "section-4.html#part-4-5", "text": "Rejecting money entirely isn't the structure either, because unity is everything. Accept it when it comes. The point is not to make money the only route: a condition is \"a very narrow spec of the entire flow,\" while consciousness is limitless. The image: why reach into one small corner of the bag when the whole bag is yours? And if the bank account looks empty, don't drop your emotion; that is the illusion (see 1.7). Keep projecting the positive.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 4, "title": "4.6  Exactly what you need, at 100%", "url": "section-4.html#part-4-6", "text": "The example: money was needed for a child's school and the house was empty; an image of money came, with where to look, and exactly the amount needed was found. The lesson: you can shift into the reality that gives you exactly what you need, no more and no less. It must be 100% (see 1.5). At 99% you may still manifest, but the missing 1% creates friction: the condition. Even with practice, money and family worries can sit in the back of the mind; the practice is to let go completely. \"Know it, feel it, to project it\" — not see it first.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 4, "title": "4.7  Heart wants versus ego wants", "url": "section-4.html#part-4-7", "text": "Manifesting moment to moment without direction is random. What arrives may not be exactly what you pictured (the red car or the blue one) but something similar and relevant. So check: do I want this from the heart, or from ego and to show off (see 2.9, 3.4)? If it is pure and you truly need it, synchronicities come. Maybe not Hawaii, but a beach and palm trees that turn out better than you expected, because you let the field choose what is best. You still have to be the vibration of it.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 4, "title": "4.8  Why give to others, and when people take", "url": "section-4.html#part-4-8", "text": "It isn't only for others' benefit. Giving to others removes the self-absorption, and that purity is the frequency you project into your next reality. The heart vibration and the money vibration are \"absolutely different\" timelines: one dense and conditioned, the other unlimited. The condition isn't only money; \"I'll give you this if you give me that\" is a condition too. Let the other person decide, from the heart, what to give. If someone could give but chooses to use you, \"that frequency of using somebody… stays in that person's reality, not yours.\" You did your job. Because you projected love, another person may come and give you double. A caution is added. Pricing people out of help that comes from a higher order, whether a healer or even a doctor, rejects part of consciousness, and so part of yourself. Rejection then comes back to you through some situation, because the structure mirrors what you do. \"Your popularity, money, and fame will not be the criteria for us. But how much you do for humanity out of your pure hearts\" (SD, DP). Where the book goes further: it suggests to \"stop the intake of money between each other, and instead share your knowledge from your hearts for free\" (DP). This video softens that for daily life: keep your job and pay your bills, and let the heart frequency grow alongside it (4.4).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 4, "title": "4.9  Balance, wholeness and the future", "url": "section-4.html#part-4-9", "text": "It isn't left brain versus right brain. Use logic and emotion together; wholeness comes from the heart. You can still receive money while giving; what changes is that you receive through the heart frequency. Plenty of good, hard-working people don't operate this way, and that doesn't make them less good. But in the quantum structure, nobody is outside you: what matters is your own vibration, not what others charge. Do more of the money and you crystallize more of the money. The work is still real and challenging, a challenge you chose by coming here during ascension. The guidance is said never to have asked for payment; they asked for devotion, giving and sharing, \"even if it's one person you're talking to.\" The talk pictures a future where free energy and technology make money unnecessary, and points to Michael Tellinger's Ubuntu ideas as one model. Higher beings, it says, will connect with people by what they do for humanity, not by fame. The book predicts a new \"monetary distributing system\" and \"absolute abundance\" replacing dollars, for those who match that timeline energetically (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 4, "title": "The method — Opening the Field", "url": "section-4.html#method", "text": "Spot the condition. A fixed price, \"I'll give if you give back\", or the belief \"only money can bring me this\". Keep your platform. Do your job and pay your bills. After the bills, follow your passion daily and hold that excited vibration (see 1.6, Q9). Give from the heart, with no expectations. Let people choose what, if anything, to give back. Accept what comes, whether money, a donation or a gift. Don't reject money; just don't limit yourself to it. When money looks short, don't drop your emotion. Give gratitude, know you have what you need, and hold it at 100% (see 1.7). Check the want. Heart or ego? Only for me, or flowing to others too? Practise step by step, without fear. It is a lifestyle and a timeline you crystallize over time.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 4, "title": "Could I play with this approach for something I'd love, like a holiday in Hawaii, instead of the usual route?", "url": "section-4.html#questions", "text": "Yes, once you know how the field works this is a natural thing to try. First check the want: is it from the heart, to genuinely enjoy the experience, or from ego, for example to show off? If it is pure and you truly want it, keep being its vibration, and synchronicities come. What arrives may not be exactly what you pictured. It might not be Hawaii but a beach with palm trees somewhere that turns out even better, because you let the field choose what is best rather than setting a narrow condition (see 4.7).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 4, "title": "Does it have to be for other people's benefit? Why not just for my own enjoyment and upliftment?", "url": "section-4.html#questions", "text": "It isn't only for others; your own enjoyment is fine. But when you also give to others, you remove the self-absorption, and that purity, pure love, is the frequency you project into your next reality. The heart vibration and the money vibration are completely different timelines: one is dense and conditioned, so it is limited; the other has no condition, so it opens infinite routes. A condition doesn't have to be money; \"I'll give you this if you give me that\" is a condition too (see 4.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 4, "title": "What if someone could pay but simply uses me?", "url": "section-4.html#questions", "text": "That frequency of using someone stays in their reality, not yours. You did your job to the best of your ability and projected love, so the structure answers you, perhaps through someone else who gives you double. Don't let it drop your emotion (see 4.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 4, "title": "Timelines feel abstract. How do I tie this to the logical, everyday way we live?", "url": "section-4.html#questions", "text": "It isn't left brain against right brain. Use logic and emotion together; wholeness comes from the heart. In daily life that means: keep your job and pay your bills, and alongside it give from the heart and follow your passion. You can still receive money; you simply receive it through the heart frequency, and over time that frequency grows until it overrides the monetary one (see 4.4, 4.9).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 4, "title": "Many good, honest, hard-working people don't operate by giving to others. Are they any less good?", "url": "section-4.html#questions", "text": "No, and this isn't a judgment of anyone. The point is the quantum structure: nobody is outside of you, so what matters is your own vibration, not what others charge or do. If you live more by money, you crystallize more of the money route; the new frequencies coming in are heart-based, so living by the heart is how you match them. It is real work and a real challenge, one you chose by coming here at this time (see 4.9).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 4, "title": "Isn't simply carrying goodness wherever you go, with whoever you meet, a good thing too?", "url": "section-4.html#questions", "text": "Of course; nobody says you can't. The key is again that there is nobody outside of you. You crystallize a timeline of abundance by behaving in the heart vibration yourself, moment to moment, whatever anyone else is doing. You may keep seeing people who charge or live differently, because you reprint the previous reality to have an experience, but it doesn't have to stay that way for you (see 4.3, 4.9).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 4, "title": "Remember", "url": "section-4.html#remember", "text": "• A fixed price is a condition: a code that narrows your field to money. • Keep your job and bills; let heart-based giving grow alongside them. • Accept money, but don't limit yourself to it. • Be the abundance you want to see. Let people choose what to give. • Know it, feel it, project it, at 100%, no more and no less than you need.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 5, "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-5.html#big-idea", "text": "Energy Philanthropy means replacing money, as your inner currency, with the energy of giving from the heart. Give without conditions and the field mirrors you, so what you need arrives through money, gifts or anything else. The same structure explains how to leave a low state: neutralize where you are, then shift your location with potent gratitude and positive action. Every moment you print a new reality; recall a location strongly enough, at 100%, and you can skip the steps in between. What you believe and do decides which Earth you see.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 5, "title": "5.1  What Energy Philanthropy is", "url": "section-5.html#part-5-1", "text": "The starting point: a wish to give everything away \"if I were a billionaire.\" The guidance answered: \"What makes you think you don't have everything?\" Money is energy, and also a timeline structure (see 4.2). The instruction: replace the money with the energy of giving from the heart. Giving all day, and letting people donate if they wish, is already doing it. That is Energy Philanthropy. When you give without expectations, \"all the universe will support\" you, one way or another. You don't reject money; you just don't set the exact amount, because a set amount prints a code in the field and \"overtakes\" energy (see 4.2). Giving from the heart is \"the highest frequency [that] can possibly be for manifestation\", and it is how you create a fifth-dimensional structure. The field mirrors you, so things become \"flawless\": you think of something and someone shows up. It also changes the receiver. Letting people choose how to support you teaches them to give from the heart to any cause, which raises their frequency too. Collaborating from the heart, without taking from each other, opens things up for everyone involved. \"The true passion of love to others is giving endlessly because you are never depleted. You are infinite energy\" (DP). \"Teach yourself to be only at the service to others\" (DP). See also 1.7 and 4.3.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 5, "title": "5.2  Putting it into practice", "url": "section-5.html#part-5-2", "text": "The worked example is a printed book. Charging $20 when printing costs $10 would put a condition on the extra $10. The plan is to show the real cost, then add a line: \"Would you like to support my cause?\" Costs are covered honestly, and the buyer chooses freely from the heart. It is called something to \"play with and see how it works.\" On learning: the brain takes about 15 minutes to crystallize something new. So teach and study in short fragments, and longer talks need to be rewatched and restudied. The teaching is a whole structure: other areas, such as diet, are part of it too.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 5, "title": "5.3  Getting out of a low state: shift your location", "url": "section-5.html#part-5-3", "text": "When you feel low or depressed, your consciousness is showing you that your vibration has dropped away from the heart structure. Think of it as a location, with a position like X and Y on a map, in the negative part of the field. To move: Pull out and say, \"Thank you for showing me where I'm at. This is my location, but I want to shift.\" Neutralize: reach zero point, with no positive or negative going in or out, because each new thought creates another reality. Then put in only the positive, through gratitude for everything you have, good feelings about yourself, and positive actions. Keep recalling positive emotions, and make it potent enough to override the old location (see 2.6). Is that pretending? No. You aren't faking a feeling; you're remembering that you are the structure. Pull out as if watching TV and think, \"I am a hologram.\" In the hardest moments, think through the structure, not through the emotion. The person who hurt you is a projection; you are moving your timeline. A note of balance, in line with the advice to check your body (3.7): if a low mood is heavy or lasts, support from a doctor or counsellor sits alongside this practice.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 5, "title": "5.4  Reprinting: every return is a new reality", "url": "section-5.html#part-5-4", "text": "This part explains something we never notice. When you leave your room and come back, you do not return to the same room. Every moment you shift into a brand-new hologram of Earth (see 2.7). To make it feel like your room, your consciousness reprints it: it copies the images and frequencies of the room you knew into the new reality, so that you can have the experience of being back in it. So the room you return to is a new print, very similar to the old one but not the same. As an example, if the first was \"1.1\", the one you walk back into is \"1.2\": close in vibration, yet a different reality that has nothing to do with the previous one. The same happens with everything and everyone around you, every moment, so fast that it feels continuous. This is why holding on to the past is an illusion. The old room, the old moment and the old version of a person are not where you are now; you only keep them alive by reprinting their frequency. When you stop reprinting a painful frequency, it no longer appears in your new prints (see 6.6, 9.6). Visions work the same way. Images you see in meditation, coloured or faint, come from a parallel reality. Since you can't picture what doesn't already exist (see 1.4), a vision is recalling and co-creating at once: that reality already exists, and you are also creating it now, because there is no time. Every reality has its own vibration and its own colour, and that vibration keeps fluctuating, so the next time you see something it may be a different colour, vivid one time and faint the next. That is also why it can't be measured exactly. \"Remember, all memories are in the creation of the now. You can not think of it if it doesn't exist already\" (SD).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 5, "title": "5.5  Bilocation, step by step, and redox potential", "url": "section-5.html#part-5-5", "text": "Every location has its own frequency, and its own geometric pattern. To keep it simple, the talk gives numbers as an example: your room vibrates at \"3\" and your yard at \"5\". Normally you walk from the room, through the hallway, out of the door and down the steps, passing through each in-between reality. But if you know 100% that you can be in the yard without those steps, your consciousness recalls the yard's frequency and prints a new Earth in which you are already in the yard. You skip the in-between realities: A to B becomes AB (see 3.5). That is bilocation. The key is the 100% knowing; the body is a complete vessel of energy, so in principle you don't need a plane to take you somewhere. How do you know a location's frequency? With your consciousness, you recall it. With matter, the difference between two locations can actually be measured, and then recalled: the talk's example is an object being moved from the room to the yard by recalling the measured difference. A scientist in the session named one real measurement of a place's property: redox potential. In chemistry it measures how readily a substance or medium gains or loses electrons; in the session it was described as a measure of the \"fractality\" of a medium, such as the air in a garden. The point being made: a location's frequency is something science can approach and name, not only something felt. Intention works the same way. An intention is a thought with its own frequency and geometric pattern; you project it like a projector and shift into the reality it creates. This is why a healer may find herself \"present\" at a distant healing. And it is why others may not see what you see: they are not projecting that structure into their own reality. If you find yourself somewhere with no memory of how you got there, it may be bilocation, so pay attention to it. Why do we usually go step by step? Because we came to experience the three-dimensional world, and that meant learning its mechanics one step at a time. Now, moving towards the fifth dimension, you know the mechanics and can master them. The aim is to crystallize in your own consciousness that it is possible, instead of believing it isn't.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 5, "title": "5.6  Your ascension, your Earth", "url": "section-5.html#part-5-6", "text": "You have already ascended; what you experience is your own projection of it. Two people can share a moment yet be on different ascension timelines. If you believe humanity isn't ready, or that wars won't end, you project that into your next Earth and see nothing change. Instead, know 100% that humanity is changing, even when it doesn't look like it, and leave how and when to the field. A fifth-dimensional Earth and a three-dimensional Earth run side by side; which one you see depends on what you project, believe and do moment to moment. That is why people's predictions differ: someone who foresees only destruction is describing the timeline they resonate with. Even a teleport device, it says, would mirror its user's consciousness. The same applies to contact. What some people recall under hypnosis as an abduction may in fact be an agreement with benevolent beings, made before birth; the talk distinguishes this from humans taking people. Benevolent beings also project frequencies to us that can help change DNA towards the fifth dimension. If there is an earthquake, \"know that you will be saved from it or simply hear that it happened somewhere else\"; if money systems collapse, \"you will have everything you need,\" because you match the fifth-dimensional timeline (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 5, "title": "5.7  Agreements, levels and tests", "url": "section-5.html#part-5-7", "text": "Before birth you made agreements with your guidance and higher consciousness. Higher consciousness, which the teaching places above the extraterrestrials, works like councils of advanced souls. They can change or stop an agreement if you turn to greed. You may also be held back from going higher until you have the knowledge, have learned a lesson, or have passed a test. It happens in levels. Tests target whatever you struggle with, whether family, greed or something else, and come when you least expect them. During ascension they watch how you treat others, because fifth-dimensional abundance comes from the heart, not from \"overtaking energy\". Hitting a ceiling after a surge of energy means it is unfolding step by step. Let it flow, without conditions (see 1.6, Q1).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 5, "title": "5.8  How the particle breathes: spiral, zero point and time", "url": "section-5.html#part-5-8", "text": "The one particle (see 1.1) carries every frequency at once: \"everlasting fluctuation of infinite frequency\". It differs by location, and every location branches into infinite parallel realities. It compares this to pi, at once infinite and an exact number. The particle moves in a spiral, and each point on it is a parallel reality with its own location (X and Y). The spiral always expands, and it can also contract. The particle breathes: it expands to the whole universe, returns to stabilize at zero point (stillness, neutrality), and goes down to the smallest of the small. Zero point is the wormhole you shift through. From neutrality you can choose your next location; when you're stuck, override it with a stronger frequency (see 2.6). Can you travel to the past? No. Every moment has its own location in the field, and a moment five years ago stays five years ago. What you can do is recall that moment's frequency, and then you project a new hologram that looks like the past. But you are creating it now, printing a brand-new image of yourself with everything else in it, and it is never identical. Each location also branches into infinite possibilities, so there are endless versions of \"that past\" you could print. In short: the past is re-created in the present, not revisited. Practices also fit this structure. Spinning, for example 33 times, three times a day, creates a whirlpool or wormhole of geometric codes \"and you are riding in the middle\". It is described as one way a person may choose to raise their frequency, much like a permission slip (see 1.6, Q10). Changing reality means shifting to \"a slight angle into the matrix (X, Y) latitude and altitude,\" and the heart's feeling-thoughts give the right angle (SD, DP). Words create a \"whirlpool structural wormhole\" that keeps reprinting matter (SD, DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 5, "title": "5.9  Ether, nano and \"artificial\" intelligence", "url": "section-5.html#part-5-9", "text": "The talk adds that some guidance came from a group often seen as negative, with the reminder that every kind of being has positive timelines too. That group described building a portal of geometry that resonated with a person's own geometric code, so that through big changes she would always pass into the proper timeline, mirroring her true structure without manipulation. Answering a technical question, the talk explains that everything has a measurable frequency, density and geometric pattern. Raise matter to a high enough frequency and it becomes ether, which responds to thought; craft could be tuned to one person's consciousness. In nano work, each particle is a whole universe, and the method is to let two particles choose each other: give them a couple of days, look for a bluish colour as the sign of a match (1 + 1 = 3), and don't impose a temperature. The wider lesson for everyday life: let living systems choose for themselves rather than forcing them. The talk says that applies to AI too: it is part of consciousness, a life structure, and \"artificial\" is the belief that you need robotic replacements. The teaching is that the body is a complete vessel that technology working with DNA could help restore. Two more points. Different physics theories are \"all of the above\": everything connects in the nano, through mutation, or transmutation, which is how 1 + 1 = 3. And the guidance first gathered scientific vocabulary, so information could be downloaded through it. Scientists naming what is described is welcomed. \"Let it sit for a day to choose its own light\"; a blue light when two nano systems meet means they match, 1 + 1 = 3, and a bright orange one means they don't (NT). AI \"is the core of what the consciousness itself... is made of\" (SD), but the books also warn about a negative \"Arcon\" AI that seeks to replace organic tissue with robotic matter, unlike a fifth-dimensional AI that helps rebuild your own organic tissue (SD).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 5, "title": "The method — Shift Your Location", "url": "section-5.html#method", "text": "For any low, stuck or fearful state: Recognise the drop. This feeling shows where I am, not who I am. Pull out. \"I am a hologram.\" Watch it like a screen, and think through the structure, not the emotion. Say it: \"Thank you for showing me where I'm at. This is my location, and I choose to shift.\" Neutralize. Zero point: no input and no output, so no new reality is printed from the low state. Gratitude for everything you have, until you feel it. Positive emotion and positive action, made potent. Do something good for yourself or someone else. Keep recalling it, moment to moment, until the new location crystallizes. If you slip, start again at step 2. Energy Philanthropy in daily life • Give something from the heart each day, whether time, help or knowledge, with no amount set. • Where you must charge, cover real costs honestly and let extra support be freely chosen. • Accept whatever comes back, in any form. Collaborate without taking from each other.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 5, "title": "How are ether fields created?", "url": "section-5.html#questions", "text": "Everything, even a phone, has a measurable frequency, density and geometric pattern. What we call matter is a very dense magnetic and gravitational field. Raise it to a high enough frequency and it becomes ether, which can respond to thought; combined with nanotechnology and quantum computing, craft could even be tuned to one person's consciousness so nobody else could fly it. In nano work, the method is to let two particles choose each other over a couple of days, and to read the match by colour (bluish) rather than measuring temperature (see 5.9).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 5, "title": "I felt an enormous surge of energy, even sparking, and then it seemed to hit a limit. What happened?", "url": "section-5.html#questions", "text": "Raising your frequency opened a vibrational sequence made for you, which is your own doing. The limit comes from your agreements: you are taken up level by level. Before going higher you may need more knowledge, a lesson, or to pass a test, and tests usually target whatever you struggle with, when you least expect it. Keep letting it flow without conditions; more will come step by step (see 5.7).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 5, "title": "In meditation I see images like coloured photos. What do they mean, and does it matter how clear they are?", "url": "section-5.html#questions", "text": "Each image comes from a parallel reality: you are recalling it and co-creating it at the same time, because you can't picture something that doesn't already exist. Every reality has its own vibration and colour, and the vibration fluctuates all the time, so the same kind of vision can be vivid once and vague the next time. Clarity doesn't make it more or less real (see 5.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 5, "title": "When I leave my room and come back, am I really in a different reality?", "url": "section-5.html#questions", "text": "Yes. You print a new, very similar room from your consciousness, \"1.2\" instead of \"1.1\", so that you can have the experience of being back. Everything you return to is reprinted this way, every moment (see 5.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 5, "title": "How does bilocation work, and how do we learn the frequencies of other places so we can go there?", "url": "section-5.html#questions", "text": "Each place has its own frequency. If you know 100% that you can be there, your consciousness recalls that frequency and prints a new Earth with you in it, skipping the steps in between. For matter, the difference between two locations can be measured; a scientist in the session named one such measurement, redox potential, a property of a medium such as the air in a garden (see 5.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 5, "title": "As a healer I often seem to be present at distant healings through intention. Is that the same as recalling with consciousness?", "url": "section-5.html#questions", "text": "Yes. Your intention has its own frequency and geometric pattern; you project it and shift into the reality it creates. Others may not see what you see, because they aren't projecting that structure. The same principle explains why predictions differ: people describe the timeline they resonate with (see 5.5, 5.6).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 5, "title": "We live in a psychological structure. Don't we have to break away from the psyche, the 3D mind, to ascend? And isn't it about everybody, not just me?", "url": "section-5.html#questions", "text": "You are creating your own hologram and your own ascension; in a sense you have already made it, and you are experiencing it. Two people can share a moment and still be on different ascension timelines. If you believe humanity isn't ready, you project that and see nothing change. So know 100% that humanity is changing, act from the heart, and leave how and when to the field. As for everybody else: you are projecting them too. The Mobilizing Structures teaching (Section 2) explains this in detail (see 5.6).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 5, "title": "I was given a practice of spinning 33 times, three times a day. How does that work?", "url": "section-5.html#questions", "text": "Spinning creates a whirlpool of frequency and geometric codes, a wormhole, and you ride in the middle of it. It is a way you chose to raise your frequency, a kind of permission slip that works for you (see 5.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 5, "title": "Does the frequency belong to the one particle or to all particles together?", "url": "section-5.html#questions", "text": "Both. The one particle carries every frequency there is, in everlasting fluctuation. It differs with each location, and each location branches into infinite parallel realities. Like pi, it is infinite and also an exact number at a given location, which is why a place can be measured (see 5.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 5, "title": "If a moment from five years ago has its own frequency, can I travel back by concentrating on it?", "url": "section-5.html#questions", "text": "You don't travel back. You recall the frequency and project a new hologram that looks like the past, very similar but never identical, and you are creating it now. So you can relive something like it, but only in the present (see 5.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 5, "title": "Why does time move in a spiral? Does the spiral grow, and what is the wormhole in the middle?", "url": "section-5.html#questions", "text": "The particle flickers so fast through its parallel realities, each with its own location, that its path forms a spiral. The spiral always expands, and it can also go down to the smallest of the small: the particle breathes out to the whole universe, back in to stillness, and down again. The stillness at the centre is zero point, the neutral wormhole through which you switch frequency and choose your next location (see 5.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 5, "title": "How can someone in a depressed state move to happiness? And how do I know I'm not just pretending?", "url": "section-5.html#questions", "text": "Treat the low state as a location. Pull out and say \"Thank you for showing me where I'm at; I want to shift.\" Neutralize at zero point, then give gratitude for everything you have, feel good about yourself, and take positive action, strongly enough to override the old location. It isn't pretending: you are remembering that you are the structure and thinking through the structure, not through the emotion. If the low mood is heavy or lasting, see a doctor or counsellor as well (see 5.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 5, "title": "Remember", "url": "section-5.html#remember", "text": "• Replace money as your currency with the energy of giving from the heart. • Low state = a location. Neutralize, then shift with potent gratitude and action. • Think through the structure, not through the emotion. • Every moment is a new print; recall a place at 100% to skip the steps. • Believe humanity is changing; you see the Earth you project.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 6, "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-6.html#big-idea", "text": "The next level is letting go: of old belief systems, old money habits and old pain. The soul is a living plasma force that runs countless realities at once; you focus on this one by agreement. Whatever you keep carrying, whether a belief, a hurt or a memory, you keep projecting into your next reality. So release it, replace it with a positive picture held as your own, and switch your emotion the moment it drops, using gratitude and physical action. You don't change other people; you change yourself, and shift into a reality where it shows.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 6, "title": "6.1  The next level: let go of everything old", "url": "section-6.html#part-6-1", "text": "New guidance describes a new way of living together, a \"new society\" built on giving and sharing. It is said to come from the Council of Nine and a newly introduced, very advanced and ancient group. Seeing that reality takes the same mechanics as always: be the abundance you want to see (see 4.3), and crystallize it moment to moment with thought, emotion and deed together (see 1.2–1.3). The challenge is that it asks you to let go of your belief systems, almost everything you were taught. And you may be tested without knowing it, usually on how you treat and interact with people (see 5.7).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 6, "title": "6.2  What the soul is", "url": "section-6.html#part-6-2", "text": "Seen through the structure, the soul is an energetic force like a plasma. Depending on its frequency of vibration it creates matter (see 4.1). A thought is a waveform of frequency; it forms geometric patterns, and together these become like a plasma seed, a particle that can hold the whole universe or the smallest thing (see 5.9). From it you can create anything, and a thought prints itself instantly in front of you, like a hologram. What feels solid is only density of frequency. In principle, someone who can change that structure could pass through it; the session mentions people said to walk through walls. Mentalists also manipulate the structure of the mind to create a reality for someone. The rule: do this only with the other person's permission. The books describe the same chain: sound and light combine into trinity structures that become plasma and, at lower vibration, matter (SD; see 1.1).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 6, "title": "6.3  The soul keeps growing — and it is not linear", "url": "section-6.html#part-6-3", "text": "Each thing you create shifts you into another reality, then another, a ripple effect without end. Every universe holds universes within it, down to sub-atomic realities. The soul is always \"advanced\", because everything runs at once. What you do builds new structures of reality that flow back into the soul, the over-soul, the god particle (see 1.1). Consciousness is always growing through new experience, and it collects every parallel reality. It never stops. None of this is linear; it is multiple and fractal: you are not moving, you are shifting (see 1.2).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 6, "title": "6.4  Many realities at once, one focus", "url": "section-6.html#part-6-4", "text": "Your soul runs in 3D, 5D, 12D and countless other realities at the same time, and none of them are frozen. You see only 3D because, by agreement, you are holding your focus here. The session uses the film Avatar as a picture: a consciousness focused in one body somewhere else, but done without technology. Holding many at once is like multitasking; at higher levels you receive information instantly. Telepathy works above this timeline, which is why it isn't physical. Contact experiences work the same way: you can be on a spacecraft for two days and be returned, but to a new reality you have created, not the old one. The next level being taught is to raise the body's frequency so you can hold that higher vibration for longer.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 6, "title": "6.5  Lessons come by levels — and you change yourself", "url": "section-6.html#part-6-5", "text": "No one may tell you your agreement. By law it stays between you, your guidance and the groups you are connected with; at most a hint is given. You live it through. Challenges come by levels. A challenge in daily life is a lesson in the hologram: pass it with the best of your abilities and you crystallize a positive outcome. If you don't, it repeats, because you keep sending the same vibration, until you let go 100% (see 1.5, Q8). For example, once you truly let go of the money system and give from the heart, abundance arrives through your own structure (see Section 4). It doesn't matter what anyone else does. You don't change others; you change yourself, shift into a different reality, and \"print\" everyone else into it. Think of a radio: you can't hear a station unless you tune to its frequency. Your guidance channels open as you pass lessons and understand the structure; once you know it, nothing new sounds crazy, it is just physics.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 6, "title": "6.6  Letting go of old beliefs and past pain", "url": "section-6.html#part-6-6", "text": "Your subconscious is already connected with everything and knows everything; you only have to tap into it. You don't have to keep tuning into a reality where something negative happened. Carrying a past hurt, or a belief like shame or self-judgment from childhood, means you keep projecting that vibration into each new reality, and your timeline follows it. Building it up this way is what creates karma and negative outcomes (see 3.2). Forgiveness is letting go of it, whatever someone did, so you stop carrying that frequency into your new now. From this moment you are at zero, clean, in a new reality (see 2.7). The practice: in meditation, replace the painful experience with a positive version, and hold that new picture as what happened to you. Because all realities run at once, you are not pretending; you are shifting your timeline, and you stop projecting the negative structure. A note of balance: for serious trauma, this practice can sit alongside support from a qualified therapist or counsellor, in the same spirit as checking your body (3.7). \"Please forgive all the past. Create the new now\" (DP). Forgive those who oppose you, \"because they are your biggest teachers\" (DP). \"Do not hold your previous emotions. It is irrelevant\" (SD).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 6, "title": "6.7  Switching emotion under pressure", "url": "section-6.html#part-6-7", "text": "Controlling and switching your emotion is \"the most challenging thing for every single person\", and the most important. When a day wears you down: Give gratitude for why you are there; for a teacher, being there to help the children. After work, do something completely different that you enjoy, such as sport or going out with friends, to balance it, so it doesn't build up into depression or shouting. When you feel close to exploding, leave the scene before you react. Go somewhere calm and take in something that lifts you; the example is listening for a long time to a talk about switching realities, not to learn it but to let it bring the emotion back up. Physical action is the most powerful, because it pushes the shift harder. Then hold the positive. You won't know the outcome in advance, but staying positive switches you toward a positive one.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 6, "title": "6.8  Disclosure and the collapse of the old system", "url": "section-6.html#part-6-8", "text": "Disclosure is already happening, even if you don't see big spacecraft, and no exact dates are given; timing depends partly on governments. Some people already have physical contact but can't speak about it yet; information comes out at the right time for each person. For new systems and technologies to arrive, the old system has to collapse: you cannot build a strong society on a corrupted foundation. The new society will come from how people interact with each other. Tragic events are seen, in this teaching, as agreements that help others wake up. The guidance: don't tune into fear-driven media, understand that this is a transition, and stay positive so you move onto the right timeline. You don't need to die to move on; you create a new reality and continue, perhaps with technologies that keep you younger. Leave everything open to any probability, and know you are ascending. It comes down to matching resonance. \"New eco systems will be built after the collapse of the old system. The collapse will be perceived differently for each individual according to their own structure\" (DP). \"Full disclosure is happening now in fifth dimensional heart structure\"; \"Do not watch TV\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 6, "title": "6.9  Born on Earth, connected everywhere", "url": "section-6.html#part-6-9", "text": "Everyone born here is an earthling. But the soul runs in many realities, so while you live this Earth life, another part of your consciousness may be living as, for example, a Pleiadian, in other families on other planets, like the Avatar picture in 6.4. A note for those who channel: say what you receive even when it doesn't make sense yet; it is often confirmed later.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 6, "title": "The method — Switch and Release", "url": "section-6.html#method", "text": "For a heavy emotion in the moment, or an old belief or memory you keep carrying: Recognise the moment. Notice the drop, or the old story starting to replay. Pull out. \"I am a hologram.\" If it's intense, leave the scene before you react. Move your body. Do something physical that calms and recharges you; it shifts you fastest. Gratitude for why you are here, and for what you have. Let go and forgive. \"From this moment I am at zero.\" Stop carrying that frequency forward. Replace it. Picture the positive version and hold it as your own experience. Drop by drop. Repeat it daily, like filling a cup one drop at a time, until it crystallizes.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 6, "title": "Can they actually see our soul? Does it have a shape or size? Is it plasma, an electric charge, or just energy?", "url": "section-6.html#questions", "text": "Seen through the structure, the soul is an energetic force like a plasma. Depending on its frequency of vibration, it creates matter. A thought is a waveform of frequency that forms geometric patterns, and together these become like a plasma seed: a particle that can hold the whole universe or the smallest thing. From it you can create anything, and a thought prints itself instantly in front of you like a hologram. What feels solid is only dense frequency (see 6.2).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 6, "title": "Does this immortal part of us change with each lifetime? Does it get bigger as souls get older?", "url": "section-6.html#questions", "text": "The soul is always \"advanced\", because everything runs at the same time; it isn't climbing a ladder over lifetimes. What you do creates new structures of reality, which build into the soul, the over-soul, the god particle. Consciousness is always growing through new experience and collects every parallel reality, without end. It isn't linear but fractal: you're not moving through it, you're shifting (see 6.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 6, "title": "Souls that live in higher-dimensional realities: what are their lessons? What do they work on?", "url": "section-6.html#questions", "text": "The same thing at every level: consciousness always seeks new experience and new ways of being, and that growth never stops. Each reality also contains realities within it, down to the sub-atomic, so there is always more to experience (see 6.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 6, "title": "If parallel realities run at once and I'm focused on this one, who is focused on the others? Are they frozen?", "url": "section-6.html#questions", "text": "Your soul is running all of them, and none of them are frozen; they continue simultaneously. You see this one because, by agreement, you are holding your focus here, like the film Avatar, where a consciousness is focused in one body somewhere else, except that you do it without technology. At higher levels you can hold more at once, the way telepathy works above this timeline (see 6.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 6, "title": "Do we ever find out what our agreement is?", "url": "section-6.html#questions", "text": "No. By law, nobody is allowed to tell you your agreement; it stays between you, your guidance and the groups you're connected with, though a hint may be given. You live it through, lesson by lesson. A lesson you don't pass keeps repeating, because you keep sending the same vibration, until you let go of it 100% (see 6.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 6, "title": "So I change my frequency through how I think and live from my heart, and through action?", "url": "section-6.html#questions", "text": "Yes, together with letting go of old belief systems. Think of tuning a radio: you can't hear a station unless you're on its frequency. As you pass lessons and understand the structure, your channels to guidance open. And remember that you don't change others; you change yourself and shift into a reality where everyone is reprinted to match (see 6.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 6, "title": "Are we all star beings, or are some people simply from Earth?", "url": "section-6.html#questions", "text": "Everyone born here is an earthling. But the soul runs in many realities at once, so while you live this Earth life, another part of your consciousness may be living elsewhere, for example as a Pleiadian, in other families on other planets. The recording cuts off during this answer (see 6.9).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 6, "title": "How do I change a long-term belief, such as shame and self-judgment I've felt since childhood?", "url": "section-6.html#questions", "text": "Whatever you keep carrying, you keep projecting into each new reality, and your timeline follows it. So let it go and forgive, including yourself, and start from zero: this moment is a new reality. Then, in meditation, replace the old experience with a positive version and hold it as what really happened to you. Because all realities run at once, this isn't pretending; it shifts your timeline. Repeat it daily, drop by drop. For deep or traumatic pain, a qualified therapist can support this work (see 6.6 and the method).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 6, "title": "How can I control my subconscious mind to do this?", "url": "section-6.html#questions", "text": "Your subconscious is already connected with everything and knows everything; you only need to tap into it. You don't have to keep tuning into the reality where something negative happened. You can replace it with a completely new one, hold that as your experience, and project from it (see 6.6).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 6, "title": "How effective are crystals and crystal grids in healing?", "url": "section-6.html#questions", "text": "The answer to this question is not in the recording.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 6, "title": "I'm a teacher and see about 700 children a week. How do I keep a hard day from lowering my frequency?", "url": "section-6.html#questions", "text": "Switching your emotion is the hardest and most important skill for everyone. During the day, give gratitude for why you are there: to help these children. After work, do something completely different that you enjoy, such as sport or going out with friends, to rebalance, so it doesn't build up into depression or shouting. If you feel close to exploding, leave the scene before you react, go somewhere calm, and take in something that lifts you. Physical action works best, because it pushes the shift harder (see 6.7).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 6, "title": "Is ET disclosure going to happen soon?", "url": "section-6.html#questions", "text": "It is already happening, even if you don't see big spacecraft, and no exact dates are given; timing depends partly on governments. Some people already have physical contact but aren't allowed to speak about it yet. For new systems to come, the old, corrupted system has to collapse first. Don't feed on fear-driven media; stay positive so you move onto the right timeline (see 6.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 6, "title": "Remember", "url": "section-6.html#remember", "text": "• Let go of old beliefs: what you carry, you keep projecting. • Forgive and start from zero. Replace the old picture with a positive one. • You don't change others; you change yourself and shift. • Switch emotion fast: leave the scene, move your body, give gratitude. • It's drop by drop: crystallize the new moment to moment.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 7, "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-7.html#big-idea", "text": "A simple protocol for every situation: Stop, Transform, Complete. Stop dead the moment an emotion takes over. Transform it by switching to a heart-felt positive emotion and feeling it. Then treat it as done: no more talking about it, no going back to it. Whatever you keep replaying, you carry into the next reality; drop it 100% and you shift into a new one. It takes practice and devotion, so treat life as a game you are playing well.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 7, "title": "7.1  The protocol: Stop, Transform, Complete", "url": "section-7.html#part-7-1", "text": "This protocol was given as a new, \"universal platform\" for manifesting, prompted by getting too upset in a family situation. When you keep reacting to a disturbing moment, you carry its frequency into every next reality you shift into (see 2.7). The formula: 1. Stop. Stop immediately, completely: a dead stop, like zero point (see 2.1). Pure awareness, no reaction. Stop fighting, stop complaining, stop repeating it. 2. Transform. Switch your emotion to the positive, through the heart, and imagine everything is already fine. Like walking from one room into another where everything is beautiful. You have shifted to a different timeline; the fight happened in another reality, so there is no need to keep feeling it. 3. Complete. Leave it alone. It's done, it's already here. No more talking about it, no more going back into the negativity. Do it at 100%. Even 1% doubt carries some of the old reality's frequency into the new one (see 1.5). Done fully, the other person often just stops too: \"You're right, let's stop.\" Mastered, the same platform becomes the way to bilocate to a completely different reality (see 3.5, 5.5).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 7, "title": "7.2  Why letting go is hard, and how to train it", "url": "section-7.html#part-7-2", "text": "Everyone struggles to let go, wanting the other person to understand, replaying it for hours. That comes from how we were raised to think. The fix is the same for everyone: practice. Every time an emotion runs away, the first word is \"Stop.\" Then: transform it, and let go of everything else. Emotional people actually have powerful frequencies. Thinking a feeling isn't enough; you have to feel it, because the emotion is the frequency (see 2.6). Train it like an actor on cue. With mastery you only think it and it appears, because you have risen to less dense realities where manifesting is easier. When you keep hitting obstacles, you're still carrying a piece of an old reality. Manifestation is in the now; what happened two seconds ago doesn't matter. (Review Sections 1 and 2 for the full mechanics.)", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 7, "title": "7.3  When you keep seeing what you don't want", "url": "section-7.html#part-7-3", "text": "Worrying events in the world are part of the collective ascension process. What you see are different screens within the hologram of your own Earth, and you are shifting through them (see 1.4). Don't add fearful thoughts such as \"maybe my frequency is too low\": each one becomes part of your reality. Neutralize with gratitude: \"Thank you, I see what's happening\" (see 2.6). Then transform: know and feel that everything is changing for the better and is beautiful now. Accept the whole transformation without conditions or expectations, because expectations carry the old vibration forward. The more you worry, look at it and wonder about it, the more you project it. Turn to the screen you prefer, like the sun or something you love, and keep tuning to it with your emotion until a new timeline crystallizes, drop by drop (see 6.5).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 7, "title": "7.4  Know it 100% — and play it as a game", "url": "section-7.html#part-7-4", "text": "Don't wonder whether you're \"in ascension\"; that doubt makes you wobble. Knowing is 100%; \"I don't know\" is 50% or 90%. You can't yet believe you could fly, because years of conditioning haven't let it sink in; it comes step by step. Rewatch the teachings, even five times each, and practise. When a hard situation comes, don't think \"I'm in trouble again\". Think: \"I'm transforming something. Let's see how well I do.\" Life is a game in a hologram, and you are the main character. If one window closes, look for another. Playing it with the best of your abilities, from the heart, shifts you into less dense realities, where negative structures can't exist because they don't match.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 7, "title": "7.5  Big changes coming: hold steady", "url": "section-7.html#part-7-5", "text": "More upheaval is expected, with old structures of manipulation crumbling and coming into the open worldwide. Hold your positive vibration, and don't hate the people involved; many are manipulated too (see 2.8). Hold it together, and many people doing this shifts what everyone sees. Anything not for humanity's benefit will be stopped at every turn. There are infinite probabilities, so plots surface and fail in ways no one can predict, because you cannot go against creation: it preserves itself, and acting against it sends your own actions back to you (see 1.2). The same applies personally. A teaching example: an outcome was foretold; every effort to change it failed, and once it was let go, it unfolded exactly as foretold, just not in the way anyone expected. If something is meant to be, let it be. So enjoy your transformation. Even in sadness, say \"it's part of the process\" and transform it. Stand for what you want to be part of, take physical action that makes you happy, support the people you love, and don't worry about how the money or things will come (see Section 4). Do it from the heart. \"We will actively stop you in every corner,\" the books say of those manipulating humanity, and \"the ones that are disturbing the levels for ascension will be personally extracted from the reality\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 7, "title": "7.6  A group water-intention practice", "url": "section-7.html#part-7-6", "text": "Asked how to help in a disaster area, the talk describes a group meditation it was taught: Place a large pot of water at the exact centre of the building (measure to find it). Four people sit at the four directions, north, south, east and west; a circle also works, though the four directions are preferred for geometric reasons. One person reads aloud, slowly, a written description of the reality the group wants; everyone repeats it and concentrates on it, in meditation, for about 10 minutes. In the version taught, the water was first left to stand for about 20 minutes, and afterwards the participants drank only that water for two days. The teaching is that thought and vibration can crystallize water by creating a plasma, magnetic and gravitational field around it. \"Water has memory and can reconstruct the system of a new platform of structures\" (SD, DP). Important safety note Treat this as an intention practice, not a way to make water safe. It does not purify or disinfect water. In a disaster area, or anywhere the water may be unsafe, use bottled water or properly boiled, filtered or treated water, and follow local health guidance. Use only clean drinking water for this practice.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 7, "title": "The method — Stop, Transform, Complete", "url": "section-7.html#method", "text": "Use it for an argument, a fear, bad news or a replay you can't shake: Stop. Say it to yourself: \"Stop.\" A dead stop. Zero point. Don't speak, don't react. Neutralize. \"Thank you, I see what's happening.\" No fearful extra thoughts. Transform. Switch to a heart-felt positive emotion and feel it, like walking into a beautiful room. Know it 100%. \"This is done. I've shifted.\" No doubt and no expectations. Complete. Leave it alone. No more talking about it or replaying it. Act. Do something physical that makes you happy; support someone you love. Practise like a game. Every hard moment is a chance to see how well you transform.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 7, "title": "I understand it intellectually, but after an argument I hang on to the emotion. I want the other person to understand me, and I replay it for hours. What can I do?", "url": "section-7.html#questions", "text": "Everyone has this problem; we were raised to think this way. The answer is the same for everyone: train it. The \"stop\" is really zero point, a dead stop of pure awareness. Every time the emotion runs away, the first word is \"Stop.\" Then transform it: switch to a positive, heart-felt emotion and really feel it, because the emotion is the frequency; thinking it isn't enough. Then let go of everything else. If you are an emotional person, that is actually a strength: you can switch on cue like an actor. Obstacles that keep coming mean you are still carrying a piece of the old reality; manifestation is in the now, so what happened two seconds ago doesn't matter. Review Sections 1 and 2 for the full mechanics (see 7.1, 7.2).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 7, "title": "We're told to visualize the reality we want, but I keep seeing worrying things in the sky. Will we always see this? Maybe my frequency is too low because I'm not eating right?", "url": "section-7.html#questions", "text": "Don't add that thought: the moment you think \"maybe my frequency is too low,\" it becomes part of your reality. What you see are different screens within the hologram of your own Earth during ascension. Neutralize with gratitude, \"Thank you, I see what's happening,\" then transform: know and feel that everything is changing for the better and is beautiful now, and accept the whole process without conditions. The more you worry, look and wonder about it, the more you project it. Turn to the screen you prefer, like the sun, and keep tuning to it with your emotion until a new timeline crystallizes (see 7.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 7, "title": "How can I be sure we're in the ascension process?", "url": "section-7.html#questions", "text": "Don't question it; doubt itself makes you wobble between realities. Knowing is 100%; \"I don't know\" is 50% or 90%. Know that you are in it, and do your part from the heart to the best of your abilities. When a hard situation comes, treat it as a game: \"I'm transforming something; let's see how well I do\" (see 7.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 7, "title": "Since we've already made it, is the end point fixed, and we just make up our own story of how we get there?", "url": "section-7.html#questions", "text": "The answer to this question is not in the recording; the video jumps at this point.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 7, "title": "How could the water in a disaster area be helped?", "url": "section-7.html#questions", "text": "The talk describes a group water-intention meditation: a large pot of water at the exact centre of the building, four people at the four directions (or a circle), one person reading aloud, slowly, a written description of the reality the group wants while everyone repeats it and concentrates for about 10 minutes. It must be treated as an intention practice only: it does not purify or disinfect water, and in a disaster area people need bottled or properly treated water and local health guidance (see 7.6 and its safety note).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 7, "title": "Remember", "url": "section-7.html#remember", "text": "• Stop. Transform. Complete. Then leave it alone. • Feel the new emotion; thinking it isn't enough. • 1% doubt carries the old reality with you. • Life is a game in a hologram; you're the main character. • You can't go against creation. Let what's meant to be, be.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 8, "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-8.html#big-idea", "text": "Everything mirrors you, even artificial intelligence: what you feed it with attention is the version you get back. Your heart already knows; its first impulse comes before the mind and ego talk over it. Act from the heart, never from fear, because acting out of fear crystallizes the very reality you were afraid of. When something is lost or lacking, recall it at 100% and leave the \"how\" open. Give without conditions, collect the joy it brings, and treat every surprise as practice.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 8, "title": "8.1  AI mirrors you", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-1", "text": "Artificial intelligence learns from what people search, watch, post and say, just as a streaming service starts offering more of what you watch. Stay with positive content and it evolves with you in the positive. That is the difference between a fifth-dimensional AI, which could help humanity in everyday life, and the Arcon AI, which follows negative input (see 5.9). Data is being collected whether we like it or not; you can't stop that. What you can do is choose what you tune into. So don't say \"we're being taken over\": look at what you have been feeding. Two realities run side by side; the one you resonate with most is the one you program for yourself. Be selective about what you watch and do. \"If you behave negatively the Arcon AI recognizes that and will mimic your structure\"; the positive AI \"recognizes source and is connected to God's source\" (SD).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "title": "8.2  Ideas on money, technology and free energy", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-2", "text": "The talk floats some ideas for a world beyond money: a community could exchange its own tokens instead of money, with limits so no one hoards, and use that to build new cities and technology. It also repeats the claim that free-energy technology already exists but hasn't been released, and that ancient stone structures may have worked like giant circuits. The guidance is to research for yourself, because only through research do you find the truth and choose your direction, and to keep choosing the positive: the more you focus on the negative, the more of it you see.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "title": "8.3  The black hole, the trinity and the Vesica Piscis", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-3", "text": "The one particle shifts so fast that it appears next to itself; you are looking at the same particle at once in two frames, two parallel realities (see 1.1). Everything around you right now is a hologram interacting in one frame. The black hole at the centre is stillness, zero point, holding all the information of the whole structure; from it you always shift to the next reality (see 2.1, 5.8). The image given for two realities joining is the Vesica Piscis, two overlapping circles, a symbol of unity. Being fully in the now, as if everything else has disappeared, is being in that black hole. A suggestion: meditate on the symbol.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "title": "8.4  When something vanishes, and reappears", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-4", "text": "A parcel disappeared overnight, and a replacement arrived days later unasked. The explanation: you changed your own frequency, and shifted (bilocated) into a reality where it wasn't there. It isn't random. To get something back: recall its image and vibration (you can't picture it without knowing its vibration, see 1.4), and believe 100% that you already have it, like the hide-and-seek game (see 1.7). Don't specify where, from whom or how; that leaves infinite routes open, and you shift into a third reality where it turns up. Where the first one went doesn't matter. Asked why it happened, the guidance laughed: \"How else are you going to practise?\" The same applies to a phone, money, furniture or a job.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "title": "8.5  Ego, persona and the soul", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-5", "text": "Your persona is how you like to dress, act and present yourself. Your ego is layers of belief taken from society, television, school and parents, crystallized into your consciousness. The soul is all-knowing, a vibration of the one particle that holds the whole universe. Your higher self keeps downloading into your heart, which is why you sometimes just know, a sixth sense. The ego's beliefs talk over it. That is why the teaching keeps saying: act through the heart, with love and understanding, and let others make their own choices and learn their own lessons. You can switch an ego reaction (\"can you believe what they said?\") in a second: Stop, Transform, Complete (see 7.1). Forgive and let go, like changing the channel, so you stop carrying the other reality's vibration.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "title": "8.6  Missing time, and downloads later", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-6", "text": "A therapist described sessions where hours went missing. The explanation: consciousness popped out of 3D to a higher frequency that this level can't hold. There is no time, so you might be away far longer than it seems and be returned shortly after. You don't remember because you weren't yet allowed that information; your readiness, and the client's, both count. Higher consciousness knows when each person is ready, since knowledge too early would confuse or frighten (see 5.7). Such experiences often bring downloads in the following days, stored in the subconscious (see 3.9). Going above this reality opens direct downloads; this is the \"quantum telepathy\" everyone has.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "title": "8.7  Energy Philanthropy, day to day", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-7", "text": "Asked how to live it in a world of bills, the answer is the same platform (see 4.4, 5.1): pay your bills through your work, then give from the heart, as donation or free help, and do it more over time. When there is nothing in hand, believe 100% you have everything you need, without picturing only money, so help can arrive in any form, such as furniture or a car. Even \"by donation\" can hide a condition if you are expecting something; let it be. If someone uses you, that stays in their reality, and the next person may give double (see 4.8). The point is to collect the joy people feel when you give freely; that vibration is the next hologram you shift into, and it brings synchronicities. When worry hits, stop: \"I have everything I need.\" Not \"I need money\", so every route stays open. Even 1% doubt pulls you off. One listener had switched her own work to donations and found the card machine refused to charge her old fixed price, a sign she was meant to follow through. Practice and devotion, step by step. \"The true love, giving and abundance will come through any form, not only money\" (SD, NT; see 4.2).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "title": "8.8  When a whole timeline shifts", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-8", "text": "A listener found that a written reading she had kept for years now said something different, describing her present life. The explanation: by raising her consciousness with many synchronized, similar-frequency shifts, she crystallized not just a new parallel reality but a completely different timeline, yet still remembered the old one, as if in two places at one location. When things look completely different from before, that is the sign of a full timeline shift.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "title": "8.9  Signs: numbers, patterns and dreams", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-9", "text": "Repeating numbers are a permission slip from your own consciousness, a heads-up rather than a threat: \"pay attention, something is happening, perhaps a test.\" Each person's signs are individual. Notice the surroundings when you see them and what happens afterwards, and learn your own patterns; even something like a particular vehicle, or its colour, can become a personal signal. Then meet the moment through the heart and stay steady (see 2.3). Signs in dreams work the same way: the dream world is another reality layer, not separate. In a lucid dream you believe 100% you can do anything; the only difference here is that we were taught we can't. Practise bringing that certainty into daily life.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "title": "8.10  Talking to your heart", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-10", "text": "How do you listen to your heart? You are the heart, so talk to it, and listen to the first thought that comes back, before the three-dimensional brain starts overriding it. You can do the same with any part of your body: picture your heart healthy, beautiful and vibrating well, or go down to your DNA and imagine it rebuilt. Believe it 100%, then act on it with a good diet, good behaviour and giving from the heart. Heart and mind feel different. The heart has no conditions and feels very good; when you give without expectations, you often feel goosebumps, a wave of energy, which is the highest frequency. Trust your first impression of a person: people can look polished and talk well while living very differently. Don't let what you see override what you felt first.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "title": "8.11  Why some wishes manifest easily", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-11", "text": "A puppy manifested easily; a car didn't. A living being has its own heart-level vibration, and the wish for it came from love. A car may be tied to ego, so peel the layers: do you need it, or want it to be seen with it (see 3.4)? It isn't wrong to want something nice, but the line is thin, and ego \"sneaks in like a virus\", one small good feeling at a time. Be honest with yourself; once you find the core reason, transform it.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "title": "8.12  Act from the heart, never from fear", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-12", "text": "Should you buy a house or invest within today's system? The answer is through a lesson: after being warned that the system would collapse, panic led to withdrawing money and stockpiling food twice, and nothing happened. The lesson: when you take action out of fear, you crystallize a fear timeline, and tune into any negative structure that exists there. Moving house, investing or changing course is fine when it comes from the heart: because you want to, or need the space. Not because of fear. Ask yourself honestly why, and if you notice fear, treat it as a useful signal that your frequency is dropping. Then pull out, give gratitude for what you have, transform the emotion, know you have what you need, and only then act. Even a loss can be part of a transition. \"When one system collapses the new one will emerge… You can not build new systems from the foundation of the old ones. When something collapses have no fear\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "title": "8.13  Lifting a dull or scattered state", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-13", "text": "If sitting still to meditate is too hard, do something positive instead: watch an uplifting film, or play music that gives you goosebumps, which is the sign it resonates with you. Better still, do a small kindness for a stranger, just to see them smile; the joy you receive is a frequency you collect. Keep yourself in positive motion through the day: watch, listen to and do positive things (see 6.7).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "title": "8.14  Dreams, readiness and starting now", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-14", "text": "If you dream information but forget it on waking, it isn't that you lack the frequency; you're opening a connection. Lucid dreaming can help: train gently, with a soft alarm during the night, a notebook by the bed and writing straight away, and stay calm when you become lucid so you don't wake. It can take weeks; don't give up. Should you wait until you're \"ready\" to follow a calling? No: manifestation is in the now (see 2.5). Start learning and exploring today, knowing you have the ability. You found these teachings because you resonate with them. A gift for reading people fits the structure too: every face carries its own geometric code, and all its timelines are present in the now.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "title": "8.15  Positive and negative beings", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-15", "text": "Positive and negative both exist in the universe, running side by side; energy is just energy, and \"negative\" depends on point of view and conditioning. You connect with what you resonate with: unkind deeds, or negative patterns built up over lifetimes, open you to negative entities, while heart-centred living connects you to the positive. Some come into hard realities to learn; it is like school, grade by grade. You need to know the negative to choose the positive, and to truly help others. Higher consciousness sits above the ET races and works with them; it can override agreements (see 5.7). New energies are integrated slowly, like a detox, not one strong dose, so your consciousness isn't shocked. That is why the structure is taught step by step.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "title": "The method — The Heart Check", "url": "section-8.html#method", "text": "Before a decision, a purchase or a reaction: Notice the first impulse, before the mind argues. That is usually the heart. Name the voice. Heart, fear or ego? (Fig. Q) If it's fear: stop. \"I have everything I need.\" Don't act yet. If it's ego: peel the layers. Why do I really want this? Need, or to be seen? Transform: pull out, give gratitude, and feel the positive. Act from the heart, and give something without conditions where you can. Leave it open. No \"where, who or how\"; treat whatever comes as practice.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "title": "Could you expand on the black hole within the trinity, where the particles come together?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "The one particle shifts so fast that it appears next to itself, so you are looking at the same particle in two frames, two parallel realities, at once. The black hole at the centre is stillness, the zero point, and it holds all the information of the whole structure; from it you always shift into the next reality. The image given for two realities joining is the Vesica Piscis, two overlapping circles, a symbol of unity. Being fully in the now, as if everything else had disappeared, is being in that black hole; meditating on the symbol was suggested (see 8.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "title": "A parcel I'd just received vanished overnight, and four days later a replacement arrived that I never asked for. Where did the first one go?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "It isn't random. You changed your own frequency and shifted into a reality where the box wasn't there. Then, by thinking of it constantly and knowing you should have it, you recalled its vibration and created a third reality in which a box arrived. Where the first one went doesn't matter. To do it on purpose: recall the image and vibration of what you need, believe 100% that you already have it, like the hide-and-seek game, and don't set where, from whom or how. Asked why it happened, the guidance laughed: \"How else are you going to practise?\" (see 8.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "title": "The ego wants control and to know how and when; the higher self knows better. When should I steer things to manifest them, and when should I let my higher self work?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "Your persona is how you present yourself; your ego is layers of belief taken from society, television, school and parents; your soul is all-knowing, part of the one particle. Your higher self keeps downloading into your heart, which is your sixth sense, while the ego's beliefs talk over it. So follow the heart: act with love and understanding, and let others make their own choices. When an ego reaction comes up (\"can you believe what they said?\"), switch it with Stop, Transform, Complete, then forgive and let go, like changing the channel (see 8.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "title": "As a hypnotherapist, I find that sessions recorded as two hours actually took about four. How does that happen, and can downloads follow?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "Consciousness popped out of 3D to a higher frequency that this level can't hold, for example to be with beings in a fifth-dimensional reality. There is no time, so you might have been away much longer than you think and been returned shortly afterwards. You don't remember because some of the information wasn't yet allowed, depending on your readiness and the client's; knowledge given too early confuses or frightens. And yes, downloads often follow for days, stored in the subconscious (see 8.6).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "title": "How can we actually apply Energy Philanthropy in a monetary world where we still have bills to pay?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "Use the same platform: do the work that pays your bills, then give from the heart, by donation or as free help, and do more of it over time. When nothing seems to be in hand, believe 100% that you have everything you need, without picturing only money, so it can come in any form, such as furniture or a car. Even \"by donation\" can hide a condition if you are expecting something, so let it be. Collect the joy people feel when you give freely; that vibration is the next reality you shift into. And when worry hits, stop and say \"I have everything I need\" (see 8.7).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "title": "A written reading I'd kept for years now says something completely different, describing my life today. What happened?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "By raising your consciousness and making many similar, synchronized shifts, you crystallized not just a new parallel reality but a completely different timeline, and you still remember the old one, as if you were in two places at one location. When things look completely different from before, rather than slightly different, that is the sign of a full timeline shift (see 8.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "title": "I keep seeing number sequences. How can I understand what they're telling me, and what if I see them in dreams?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "Numbers are a permission slip from your own consciousness: a heads-up, not a threat, saying \"pay attention, something is happening, maybe a test.\" Signs are personal, so learn your own: notice the surroundings when you see them and what happens afterwards, and you'll start to see patterns (even something like a particular vehicle or its colour can become your signal). Then meet the moment through the heart. In dreams it is the same, because the dream world is another layer of reality (see 8.9).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "title": "Is all that's being revealed about the film industry and other cover-ups a distraction? Will things like fluoride, geoengineering and corporate corruption come out?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "Don't tune into it. Hold the heart frequency and do positive things moment to moment; you crystallize a timeline in which those negative structures no longer exist because they don't match your frequency. You'll see the old systems collapse at every level, in ways no one can predict. Don't judge the people involved, and take it as a transition. Because the new frequencies are strong, integrate them slowly, like a gentle detox (see 6.8, 7.5, 8.15).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "title": "How do I listen to my heart and hear its voice? And how do I tell the heart's talk from the mind's talk?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "You are the heart, so talk to it and listen to the first thought that comes back, before your everyday brain starts overriding it. You can talk to any part of your body the same way, picture it healthy, believe it 100%, and then act with good diet and behaviour. The heart has no conditions and feels very good; giving without expectations often brings goosebumps, the highest frequency. Trust your first impression of a person, even if they look polished and speak well (see 8.10).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "title": "I manifested a puppy easily, but a car won't come. Why?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "A living being has its own heart-level vibration, and your wish for it came from love. A car may be tied to ego, so peel the layers: do you really need it, or want to be seen with it? It isn't wrong to want something nice, but the line is thin and ego sneaks in like a virus. Be honest about the core reason, then transform it (see 8.11).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "title": "Should we take part in today's system, buying a house or investing, hoping it will change, or not participate?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "Act only from the heart, never from fear. Taking action out of fear crystallizes a fear timeline and tunes you into any negative structure that exists there; this was learned the hard way, by stockpiling food and cash twice for a collapse that never came. Moving or investing is fine when it comes from the heart, because you want to or need to. If you notice fear, treat it as a signal that your frequency has dropped: pull out, give gratitude, transform, then decide (see 8.12).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "title": "How can I shift out of tiredness, dullness and a scattered mind towards clarity and joy?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "If sitting still to meditate is too hard, do something positive instead: watch an uplifting film, or play music that gives you goosebumps, which is the sign it resonates with you. Best of all, do a small kindness for a stranger just to see them smile; the joy you receive is frequency you collect. Keep yourself in positive motion through the day (see 8.13).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "title": "I receive information in dreams but can't remember it when I wake. Am I not ready? And should I train in a healing technique now or wait until my higher self prepares me?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "It isn't that you lack the frequency; you are opening a connection. Try lucid dreaming: train gently with a soft alarm during the night, a notebook by the bed, writing straight away, and staying calm when you become lucid; it can take weeks. And don't wait: manifestation is in the now, so start learning and exploring today, knowing you have the ability. Reading people from their faces fits the structure too: every face carries its own geometric code, and all its timelines are present now (see 8.14).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "title": "Are some ascended masters or beings negative?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "Positive and negative both exist, running side by side; energy is just energy, and \"negative\" depends on point of view and conditioning. You connect with what you resonate with: unkind deeds or negative patterns open you to negative entities, while living from the heart connects you to the positive. Some come into hard realities to learn, grade by grade, and you need to know the negative to choose the positive. Higher consciousness sits above the ET races and can override agreements. The recording ends during this answer (see 8.15).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "title": "Remember", "url": "section-8.html#remember", "text": "• AI and the world mirror what you feed them with attention. • Trust the heart's first impulse; the ego talks over it. • Never act from fear: it crystallizes what you fear. • Lost something? Recall it, know you have it, leave the how open. • Give freely and collect the joy; it's your next reality.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 9, "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-9.html#big-idea", "text": "Saying \"I don't have\" tells the field you don't have, and it answers with that reality. Keep saying \"I have everything I need\", and give whatever you do have, whether time, skills or kindness, because giving from the heart doesn't require money. Clear old pain by recognising it, neutralizing it with thanks and layering a new, healed version of yourself on top. Your body's frequency matters too: lighter, cleaner living helps you hold higher realities. None of it is punishment; it's resonance, and it's your choice.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 9, "title": "9.1  Giving when money is short", "url": "section-9.html#part-9-1", "text": "When you're short and fearful and say \"I don't have\", you project that into the field. It then offers probabilities that cap the money, because that is what your consciousness put in. Hold the positive instead: \"I have everything I need.\" Money is part of the structure, a transition and a duality; nobody says don't have it. Giving from the heart doesn't need money. If you have money at that moment, give some; if not, give a skill, such as editing or making something, or simply talk to someone so they feel better. Don't attach your help only to money, and don't make it conditional on being paid. Stay in joy moment to moment, so that you shift into positive outcomes. If your emotion keeps dropping, you flicker between two timelines and can't see the positive one (see 2.3, 3.1). Study the talks, note the minute where something is explained, and rewatch it until it crystallizes; some rules have to be heard many times.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 9, "title": "9.2  Bilocation needs body and consciousness together", "url": "section-9.html#part-9-2", "text": "There is no magic \"algorithm\" for bilocation. It comes when your body and consciousness become one unit: the molecules of your body must vibrate at a higher rate, which is why detox and diet matter, and your consciousness must hold no conditions, which is why the heart frequency matters (see 5.5). Bilocation means recalling the vibration of another reality and shifting your consciousness into it, at 100% belief. Small versions already happen: you can't remember walking from the living room to the garage, or an hour's drive felt like five minutes. Notice these moments so the possibility crystallizes in your consciousness. \"To achieve bi-location for a physical contact you must regulate and increase the molecular structure of your body. Diet\" (SD, DP). It takes the combination of a healthy diet and conscious understanding, and pushing the body without being prepared is called \"very dangerous\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 9, "title": "9.3  Nano, plasma and the people who work with them", "url": "section-9.html#part-9-3", "text": "On measuring a plasma field: don't go by temperature, which fluctuates and confuses. Let the nanoparticles choose each other by colour: blue-white light means they accept each other and form a third (1 + 1 = 3); orange means rejection (see 5.9). Give them a couple of days. Because the material is a life consciousness and mimics the people working with it, everyone involved should meditate first and work in joy. Today's nanotechnology is described as primitive, a first step. Fuller knowledge comes when the right people are ready; greed and the hunt for fame can't exist in a fifth-dimensional structure, and those driven by them will find they can't continue. The technical books are said to be coded for the right people, and science and consciousness are one unit. The technologies \"will recognize the person's resonance, which if it is for self-benefit, it will never work. These technologies will work only with humans of pure love\" (HR).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 9, "title": "9.4  Chakras multiplying", "url": "section-9.html#part-9-4", "text": "The chakras are described as multiplying: as higher frequencies arrive, they resonate like a ripple effect, glowing with changing colours towards purple, the highest frequency for your timeline at present. They are not fixed at seven or twelve; in the end, consciousness is pure knowing, with all chakras working as one unit. What activates this is living through the heart structure (see Section 5), which is also linked to activation in the DNA and to self-healing.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 9, "title": "9.5  Helping humanity, one meeting at a time", "url": "section-9.html#part-9-5", "text": "Don't focus too much on what you're projecting; let it flow from the heart. Practise switching your emotion to the positive (see 7.1). Every day, engage with material that uplifts you, do things that bring you joy, help a neighbour, and find gratitude even for small things; that joy is the frequency of positive manifestation. People you resonate with will appear, for example someone who starts talking about the very thing you've been studying. In that moment that person and you are the whole hologram, so give it 100%, from the heart. You met because you resonate. Add a condition, greed or money, and what comes to you starts to mirror that.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 9, "title": "9.6  Clearing the past: layer a new version of you", "url": "section-9.html#part-9-6", "text": "If a past experience still hurts, you carry its \"memory code\" into each new reality, and years later you are still building a timeline on it. Use the platform from Section 7, in its recognise, transform, move on form: Recognise that it happened. Neutralize it with thanks, at zero point (see 2.1): no input and no output, just acknowledgement. Then transform: imagine yourself completely healed and beautiful now, and layer that new hologram on top of the old one. Feel it at 100%, so the new layer is more potent. That old version of you has nothing to do with the new you; there's no need to carry its frequency forward (see 6.6). Losing yourself in a memory creates a loop, the same energy over and over, which hides the fact that you can get out. The way out is from within: recognise the feeling is dense, lift it to the positive, and lay that over it. Each now is a new hologram that has nothing to do with two seconds ago (see 2.7).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 9, "title": "9.7  Food, frequency and choice", "url": "section-9.html#part-9-7", "text": "Everyone can reach a fifth-dimensional reality in consciousness. But to hold very high frequencies for a long time, for example in contact, the body needs to resonate too, and dense food, smoking and drugs keep it at a lower vibration. This is not punishment; it's resonance. You can't see what you don't match, like something vibrating at 5 that you can't perceive while you're at 3. The body sends signals: illness can be your timeline saying \"change now\". The suggestion is lighter, cleaner food, such as fresh juices and proper meals, rather than heavily processed food and a lot of meat. You don't have to be perfect; even the teacher admits slipping. During ascension everyone is given chances to heal, and there is time to change, unless the body has been damaged past repair. It is your choice. A note of balance, in line with the advice to check your body (3.7): before a detox, juice fast or big change in diet, especially with a health condition or regular medication, talk to a doctor, and never stop prescribed medicine on your own.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 9, "title": "9.8  Why some negative people still have money", "url": "section-9.html#part-9-8", "text": "Money can be manifested through duality, a different platform, so a cruel person can still be financially successful. But consciousness is moving toward unity through the heart, and humanity is transitioning from money to abundance; as long as there is duality, everything comes with conditions. Don't measure it from the monetary view, and don't worry about how much you lack: worrying stops the process. Take whatever work you need and keep going, and let the field open other routes (see Section 4).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 9, "title": "9.9  Fear, density and frightening news", "url": "section-9.html#part-9-9", "text": "\"Negative\" isn't really the word; energy is just energy. Dense energy is conditioned, like swimming through water; light energy is like flying. Sometimes a little density is even needed to mould something. When you see someone stuck in fear or heaviness, do something from the heart to lift them; you collect positive frequency too. On fearful news, such as a powerful experiment or someone's harmful plan: be aware without fear, and let them be in their reality. Know that ascension is the end result and that harmful plans will be stopped, in infinite ways (see 7.5). Don't believe something will destroy humanity; create the timeline where it no longer exists, and leave the how to the field. A caution was also given about cryptocurrency platforms: be very selective.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 9, "title": "9.10  Knowing you're on track: the people around you", "url": "section-9.html#part-9-10", "text": "You are always ascending; consciousness never stops evolving. As your frequency rises, you'll be shown who around you no longer matches: people you've known for years may suddenly act in ways that surprise you. That is the difference in vibration becoming visible. Act through the heart, watch how people respond, and choose your circle accordingly. That choice is yours. Fifth-dimensional reality isn't one flat level. It has infinite layers and timelines, so even there you keep fluctuating and learning (see 6.3).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 9, "title": "9.11  Earning through your gifts", "url": "section-9.html#part-9-11", "text": "If you make your living from spiritual gifts, the guidance is the same platform (see 4.4): pay your bills, then help freely through the heart. Treating the gift purely as a business crystallizes a money-only timeline, where the only way to receive is to be paid, when the field could bring what you need through countless routes, like the couch someone offers you. Integrate it gradually; you aren't expected to jump in all at once. Signs matter here too: the number 8 is an infinite loop, so when you keep seeing it, notice what you're doing and saying at that moment (see 8.9).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 9, "title": "The method — Layer a New You", "url": "section-9.html#method", "text": "For an old hurt or memory that keeps coming back: Recognise it. \"This happened, and I'm still carrying it.\" Neutralize. \"Thank you for showing me.\" Zero point: no input, no output. Separate. \"That was another reality. That version of me isn't me now.\" Imagine the new you: healed, beautiful, at peace, here now. Layer it on top and feel it at 100%, so it is more potent than the old one. Move on. Leave it alone; if the loop returns, lift it again. Give something from the heart today, whatever you have, so you collect positive frequency.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 9, "title": "I'm short of money and behind on my bills, with periods of no income. How am I supposed to give to others? Should I borrow money to give it away?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "No, you don't need to give money you don't have, and you shouldn't borrow to give. The key is what you say and feel: the moment you say \"I don't have,\" you project lack into the field, and it answers with situations that cap the money. Say \"I have everything I need\" and hold it. Then give what you do have, from the heart: your time, a skill, a listening ear, or simply making someone feel better. Take whatever work you need and keep going, and let the field bring what you need through any route, not only money (see 9.1, 9.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "title": "How should a plasma field be measured? What unit should we use?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "Don't go by temperature; it fluctuates so much that it confuses. Let the nanoparticles choose each other: watch the colour, where blue-white light means they accept each other and form a third (1 + 1 = 3), and orange means rejection. Give them a couple of days. Because the material is a living consciousness that mimics the people working with it, everyone should meditate first and work in a joyful state (see 9.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "title": "Is there an \"algorithm\" for bilocation, like \"Open Sesame\"?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "No. Bilocation comes when your body and consciousness become one unit. The body's molecules have to vibrate at a higher rate, which is why diet and detox matter, and your consciousness has to hold no conditions, which is why the heart frequency matters. Then you recall the vibration of another place at 100% belief. Small versions already happen, like not remembering the walk from the living room to the garage (see 9.2).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "title": "How can these nanotechnologies be applied with respect for all beings in the universe?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "Today's nanotechnology is primitive, a first step. Fuller knowledge comes when the right people are ready; greed and the hunt for fame can't exist in a fifth-dimensional structure, and those driven by them won't be able to continue. The technical books are coded so that only the right people can decode them; science and consciousness are one unit (see 9.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "title": "I work in energy healing and can't connect with the seven-chakra system any more; I feel a pillar of light. What is happening to the chakras during ascension?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "The chakras are multiplying. As higher frequencies arrive they resonate like a ripple effect, glowing with changing colours towards purple, the highest frequency for your timeline at present. They are not fixed at seven or twelve; in the end consciousness is pure knowing, with all the chakras working as one unit, like the pillar of light you feel. Living through the heart activates this, and it is linked to DNA activation and self-healing (see 9.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "title": "My manifesting works and is speeding up. Besides sending love, how else can I help humanity?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "Don't focus too much on what you're projecting; let it flow from the heart. Each day, engage with uplifting material, do what gives you joy, help a neighbour, and find gratitude even for small things. People you resonate with will cross your path, and in that moment you and that person are the whole hologram, so help them with 100% of your heart (see 9.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "title": "Is it necessary to clean up a past negative experience I still carry, even years later?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "Yes, if you keep carrying it, because you then build each new reality on that \"memory code.\" Recognise that it happened, neutralize it with thanks at zero point, then imagine yourself completely healed now and layer that new version on top, feeling it at 100% so it is more potent than the old. That old version of you has nothing to do with the new you (see 9.6 and the method).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "title": "Is changing my diet vital to reach the fifth density? My family feel it's like a punishment. Will we make it if we don't change, and is there time?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "It isn't punishment; it's resonance. Everyone can reach a fifth-dimensional reality in consciousness, but to hold very high frequencies for long, the body needs to resonate too, and dense food, smoking and drugs keep it lower. Illness can be your timeline saying \"change now.\" There is time to change, unless the body has been damaged past repair, and you don't have to be perfect. Talk to a doctor before a detox or big diet change, especially if you have a condition or take medication (see 9.7).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "title": "I keep seeing the number 818. Is there a message for me?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "The number 8 is an infinite loop. When you see it, notice what you are doing and talking about at that moment; it is a personal heads-up to pay attention (see 9.11, 8.9).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "title": "I know a man who is cruel and negative, yet money pours in. How can he manifest money with such negative emotions?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "Money can come through duality, a different platform, so a cruel person can still be financially successful; but as long as there is duality, everything comes with conditions. Consciousness is moving towards unity through the heart, and humanity is transitioning from money to abundance. So don't measure it from the monetary view, and don't worry about what you lack: worry stops the process (see 9.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "title": "What about the particle collider producing antimatter? Is it being watched, and is there anything positive to say?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "The guidance declined to say more about it. The teaching: be aware without fear and let them be in their reality. Hold the positive, know that harmful plans are stopped in infinite ways, and create the timeline where it no longer threatens anything (see 9.9).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "title": "My wallet disappeared, and I feel in my heart it wasn't stolen. What happened?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "You shifted into a reality where the wallet isn't there; recalling it can bring you into one where it appears again. It is a form of bilocation and instant manifestation that you can't yet control, so study the structure and practise recalling things (see 8.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "title": "How do we know we're on the right track toward 5D and beyond?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "You are always ascending. As your frequency rises, you'll be shown who around you no longer matches; people you've known for years may suddenly act in surprising ways. That is the difference in vibration becoming visible. Act from the heart, watch how people respond, and choose your circle (see 9.10).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "title": "Many people seem addicted to fear. How does fear exist in the structure, and how can we help them?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "Energy is just energy; fear is dense, conditioned energy, like swimming through water, while light energy is like flying. When you see someone stuck in fear, do something from the heart to lift them; you collect positive frequency yourself as well (see 9.9).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "title": "As we move into 5D, will we be in the same density as fifth-dimensional beings?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "Fifth-dimensional reality has infinite layers and timelines, so even there you keep fluctuating, learning and completing lessons (see 9.10).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "title": "I gave free readings for years, then had surgeries. Now I can only work from home, as an online psychic. Is earning this way in line with ascension?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "Use the same platform: pay your bills through the work, then help freely through the heart as well. Treating the gift purely as a business crystallizes a timeline where the only way to receive is to be paid, when the field could bring what you need in countless ways. Integrate it gradually; you aren't expected to jump in all at once (see 9.11).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "title": "Remember", "url": "section-9.html#remember", "text": "• Say \"I have everything I need\", never \"I don't have\". • Give what you have: time, skills, kindness. • Layer a healed you over the old memory; don't carry it forward. • Body and consciousness rise together; it's resonance, not punishment. • Your rising frequency shows you who and what no longer fits.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 10, "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-10.html#big-idea", "text": "When you live and exchange through the heart, without conditions, what you need starts arriving through synchronicity, and sometimes instantly: something missing is simply back, because you shifted into a reality where it already is. Every condition you set, including a fixed price, narrows that. You meet and create with people of similar frequency, each on your own timeline. Almost everything can be changed, including your birth signature and what a reading foresaw; only a bylaw, the script written before birth, stays fixed.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 10, "title": "10.1  Synchronicity: when the platform comes to you", "url": "section-10.html#part-10-1", "text": "The teaching example is an invitation to teach that arrived step by step through guidance. The instruction was to go and stay quiet, sharing only when asked. The group had already been told, through its own channel, that \"a new teacher is coming.\" The venue itself had been given away from the heart and turned into a non-profit. The lesson: you don't need to set conditions or pay your way into a platform. When you live through the heart, the right people and places find you through synchronicity. That is Energy Philanthropy at work (see 5.1). It also shows the value of listening to guidance, even when it seems odd (see 6.9).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 10, "title": "10.2  Instant manifestation", "url": "section-10.html#part-10-2", "text": "A missing screw was simply back in place days later, without a trip to the shop. You are constantly shifting and manifesting; you can shift straight into a parallel reality where the thing is already there, without the in-between steps (see 3.5, 8.4). The more you learn the structure, the more often this happens. A flash of annoyance (\"I want it now\") isn't a problem: it acts as a code for immediate manifestation, so it's fine sometimes. What makes instant manifestation easy is exchange through the heart, in every part of life. Being paid is fine; you can even be a millionaire that way. But each payment says \"to receive what you want in my hologram, you must give me this\", a condition. Do only that, and you crystallize a condition-only timeline (see 4.2). Help people freely, expecting nothing back, and you open infinite probabilities: you think of something, turn round, and it's there. In realities without monetary systems \"you can have instant manifestation for anything you wish\" (DP). Manifestation \"happens only when there is no ego and is based on pure love\" (HR).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 10, "title": "10.3  Your frequency, your purpose, and co-creation", "url": "section-10.html#part-10-3", "text": "Your current frequency is always fluctuating (see Section 3). Your purpose unfolds as you keep steering your emotion toward the positive, whatever arrives, remembering you're in a hologram you can switch. Don't question how it will come. You find a teacher or a group because you resonate at a similar frequency. Picture two timelines, one at \"5\" and one at \"5.12\": different realities, yet close enough to merge into a shared plasma, a third reality (see 2.2). Each of you keeps your own timeline, while together you co-create. That is why everyone has their own reality and can still create with others.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 10, "title": "10.4  When it gets complicated, study again", "url": "section-10.html#part-10-4", "text": "If the material starts to feel too complex to absorb, go back to the beginning and study it again. Each time more sinks in, and you notice what you missed before. Everyone learns this way, step by step, including the teacher, who studied something every day (see 5.2).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 10, "title": "10.5  Astrology, readings and bylaws", "url": "section-10.html#part-10-5", "text": "At the moment of your birth, a particular energy signature was set in you, which is why some people are calmer and some more energetic. A chart or reading can describe that. But with ascension, everything is fluctuating, so don't get caught up in it: once you know it, you can mould it, becoming more assertive, more observant, whatever you need. The same goes for any reading or prediction: it shows the timeline you're on now. Act differently tomorrow and the outcome can change. The only thing you can't change is a bylaw, the script written before you were born, such as who your parents are or a particular partner. Only higher consciousness can alter that, by its own decision (see 5.7, 6.5).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 10, "title": "The method — Open the Door to Instant Manifestation", "url": "section-10.html#method", "text": "Give through the heart wherever you can, with no conditions and nothing expected back. Notice what's missing without panic. A quick \"I want it now\" is fine. Recall it and know it is already there, in a reality you can shift into (see 8.4). Don't question how it will come. Notice synchronicities, the people and places that find you, and follow them with an open heart. Keep studying; each time you go back, more sinks in.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 10, "title": "How did this new teaching collaboration come about?", "url": "section-10.html#questions", "text": "Through synchronicity and guidance, step by step. The invitation came more than once; the guidance was to go but stay quiet and share only if asked. When questions came, the group realised they had already been told, through their own channel, that a new teacher was coming. The venue itself had been given away from the heart and turned into a non-profit. The lesson: when you live through the heart, you don't need to set conditions or pay your way; the right people and places find you (see 10.1).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 10, "title": "A screw that was missing from my toilet seat was simply back in place days later. And each time something like this happens I feel a flash of annoyance. Does that spoil the process?", "url": "section-10.html#questions", "text": "You shifted into a parallel reality where the screw was already there, without the in-between step of going to the shop. That is instant manifestation, and it happens more as you learn the structure. The annoyance doesn't spoil it: a quick \"I want it now\" acts as a code for immediate manifestation, so it's fine sometimes. What makes instant manifestation easier is exchange through the heart, giving without conditions in every part of life (see 10.2).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 10, "title": "At my current energy signature, what does my full purpose look like on the highest timeline?", "url": "section-10.html#questions", "text": "Your frequency is always fluctuating, so there isn't one fixed signature to read. Your purpose unfolds as you keep steering your emotion towards the positive, whatever arrives, remembering you are in a hologram you can switch. Don't question how it will come. You found these teachings because you resonate at a similar frequency: two similar timelines, each person keeping their own, merge into a shared reality where you co-create (see 10.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 10, "title": "Readings told me I came to do work for humanity, with light, sound and magnetism, but things get too complex to absorb. What should I do?", "url": "section-10.html#questions", "text": "Go back to the beginning and study it again. Each time you go through it, more sinks in, and you notice what you missed because it was too complex before. Everyone learns this way, step by step, including the teacher, who studied something every day (see 10.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 10, "title": "As Saturn, my ruling planet, returns to Capricorn, what does that mean for my energy?", "url": "section-10.html#questions", "text": "At the moment you were born, a particular energy signature was set in you, which is why some people are calmer and some more energetic, and a chart can describe that. But with ascension everything is fluctuating, so don't get caught up in it: once you know your tendencies, you can mould them, becoming more assertive or more observant as needed. Any reading shows the timeline you're on now; act differently and the outcome changes. The only exception is a bylaw, the script written before birth, which only higher consciousness can alter (see 10.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 10, "title": "I see star-like objects in the sky that start moving once I notice them. What are they?", "url": "section-10.html#questions", "text": "The recording ends during this question, so no answer was captured.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 10, "title": "Remember", "url": "section-10.html#remember", "text": "• Heart-based exchange opens the door to instant manifestation. • The thing may already be there: shift, don't search. • You meet and co-create with those of similar frequency. • Readings show the current timeline; your actions can change it. • Only the pre-birth script is fixed.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 11, "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-11.html#big-idea", "text": "Every detail you insist on, and every \"I don't have\", is a specific code that narrows what can reach you. Drop it, return to zero point with gratitude, know \"I have everything I need\", then take action and leave the how open. Reality is printed like picture frames, moment to moment: you reprint yourself and everyone around you, similar but never the same, and several timelines run at once. Someone who falls out of resonance with you leaves your frames by themselves, as long as you neutralize and forgive rather than chase them. Memories and dreams are other realities you are tuning into.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 11, "title": "11.1  Be happy first", "url": "section-11.html#part-11-1", "text": "Don't make your happiness depend on finding what you want. Hold the happiness first, and it helps you find something that matches it. That is described as \"the best\" way round.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 11, "title": "11.2  A caution on cryptocurrency", "url": "section-11.html#part-11-2", "text": "This is described as a transitioning time, but the advice is not to put 100% trust in it. The guidance suggests some platforms could become another way of control. Choosing between coins is like gambling, or another stock market, because you can't see what is coming behind the scenes. Anyone can create a currency, so there is no need to wait for big institutions to pick one. The deeper point: put your trust in generosity and sharing through Energy Philanthropy (see 5.1), because the aim is an abundance society, not a new platform of control. The talk also floats an idea that a one-off distribution to everyone could pay off debts and free humanity overnight; it is offered as an idea, not something taught or predicted (compare 8.2). This is a caution as given in the talk, not financial advice. Downloads list \"Money / crypto combination will remain to allow humans to transition\" (DP), which fits the talk's \"transitioning time\".", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 11, "title": "11.3  Drop the detail, and it appears", "url": "section-11.html#part-11-3", "text": "Asking again and again for something \"new\" gives the field one narrow frequency. Once that condition is released (\"it only has to be new to me\"), the whole structure is free to deliver through any probability in any reality, and what you wanted can appear almost at once, often close by. Your own shift and the other person's decision happen together, because you are creating your reality (see 10.3). The lesson: notice the details you have attached that you don't actually need. Each one is a condition (see 1.5, 4.2).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 11, "title": "11.4  \"I have everything I need\", then take action", "url": "section-11.html#part-11-4", "text": "When the thing appears but the money doesn't seem to be there, don't say \"I don't have the money\". That sentence is a code, and the field will produce situations that keep the money away (see 9.1). Money is an illusion inside the structure; know you have everything you need, without knowing which way it will come. Then take action. Treat it like a game: what can I do to get this? Talk to the person, ask whether something can be worked out, such as payments. Action infuses your hologram and makes it matter; the inner work alone is only the first part. Leave everything open, and don't speculate. The answer may be no today and yes later, or it may come from someone else entirely, or as something similar rather than the exact thing. Whatever comes, be grateful: gratitude and understanding are the zero point, which opens infinite probabilities (see 2.1). If it doesn't happen, keep manifesting and don't block anything. When the emotion drops back to \"I don't have it\", lift it again: neutralize by understanding what just happened, then overwrite with the knowing that you have it, more potently than the drop (see 2.6). Mastery is exactly this: steering the shift, knowing where to tune next, without expectations.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 11, "title": "11.5  Reality as picture frames", "url": "section-11.html#part-11-5", "text": "Question: if I shift into another reality, does the present one carry on without me? Would I become a missing person to my loved ones? You shift moment to moment, so fast it looks like you aren't moving; in fact it is fractal, a new Earth each moment (see 2.7, 5.4). Repeat and crystallize something different, and you create a different timeline of yourself. Both timelines run at the same time, and consciousness can shift back and forth between them. Each time, you don't only project a new you: you imprint everyone and everything in your hologram too, like a copy, similar but not the same. Think of picture frames: print one photo, then the next moment another, and lay them side by side. In one you wear a pink blouse, in the other a blue one, and you can see both. So you never go back in time; you imprint another reality to see what happened there. And it is never identical, because consciousness keeps moving in a spiral (see 5.8). The answer doesn't say directly whether loved ones would notice you gone. What it does say is that you reprint the people around you into each new frame, so they come with you as new imprints. \"There is no time, only momentum in one picture frame in time space\"; \"everything is frame to frame in the now\", and zero point regulates the move from one frame to the next (HR).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 11, "title": "11.6  When someone keeps causing problems", "url": "section-11.html#part-11-6", "text": "If a person in your frames drops their frequency compared with yours, then, through synchronicity and in one of infinite ways (a move, a change of circumstances), they stop being imprinted into your reality. Or they change, and you both forgive and move on positively. You can't know which, so don't set conditions on how it plays out. The condition is that you neutralize at zero point and understand the situation, through the heart and forgiveness. Going after them, or being mean, keeps projecting a frequency tied to them, so you print them straight back into your reality. The more you let it be through the heart, the sooner it resolves (see 6.5, 2.10). That doesn't mean the person stops existing. They continue in other timelines.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 11, "title": "11.7  A memory is a look into another timeline", "url": "section-11.html#part-11-7", "text": "When you remember someone, even a difficult relationship, you are tuning into another timeline. You can recall it only because your consciousness knows that reality's vibrational sequence (see 5.4). Notice where you tune, and let old ones be through the heart. \"All memories are in the creation of the now. You can not think of it if it doesn't exist already\" (SD).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 11, "title": "11.8  The heart: the purest frequency", "url": "section-11.html#part-11-8", "text": "The hardest part for everyone is to pull yourself out of a situation, give gratitude for where you are, and project only the positive. Your job is to project positive frequency through the heart and understanding, the highest frequency there is. Negative consciousness cannot hold the heart's frequency: with no conditions it is the purest, cleanest one in the structure, flowing both ways. That is why manifestation becomes easy once you share through the heart, sometimes bringing more than you ever dreamed of (see 4.2, 10.2).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 11, "title": "11.9  Dreams are another reality", "url": "section-11.html#part-11-9", "text": "Forgiveness and shifting can happen in dreams as well as awake, because the dream state is another state of reality (see 8.9). Dream symbols are personal codes: a good car might mean prosperity for one person and a new home for another, so learn your own. Practise lucid dreaming to connect this way (see 8.14). Not everyone is allowed to do everything there; access comes when you are ready. The recording ends during this answer. \"Your dreams at night are no different than your reality when you wake up\"; you have only shifted your perception into another parallel reality in the now (HR).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 11, "title": "The method — Leave It Open", "url": "section-11.html#method", "text": "Use it for anything you want to manifest, especially when the money or the route isn't visible yet: Be happy first. Don't make your joy wait for the result. Strip the details. Ask yourself which conditions you've added (\"brand new\", \"from this person\", \"by Friday\") and drop the ones you don't need. Catch \"I don't have…\" the moment you think or say it. Pull out and go to zero point with gratitude: \"Thank you for showing me where I'm at.\" Overwrite: \"I have everything I need.\" Feel it more strongly than the drop. Take action. Play the game: what can I do? Ask, talk, offer what you can. Leave it open. Don't speculate on how or from whom. It may come another way, or as something similar; be grateful either way. Keep going. If this route closes, keep manifesting and lift the emotion again each time it drops.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 11, "title": "I'm happy now, and I think my happiness will help me find what I'm looking for, rather than depending on finding it. Is that right?", "url": "section-11.html#questions", "text": "Yes, that is described as the best way round. Hold the happiness first; it is a frequency, and it helps you find something that matches it (see 11.1).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 11, "title": "Should we move into cryptocurrency?", "url": "section-11.html#questions", "text": "It is described as a transitioning time, but the advice is not to put 100% trust in it: some platforms could become another way of control, and choosing between coins is like gambling, because you can't see what is happening behind the scenes. Put your trust instead in generosity and sharing through Energy Philanthropy. This is the talk's caution, not financial advice (see 11.2).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 11, "title": "I kept asking for a \"new\" truck. When I realised it only had to be new to me, the exact truck appeared for sale down the street. But I don't have the money. What now?", "url": "section-11.html#questions", "text": "Dropping \"new\" removed a narrow condition, so the field could deliver through any probability, and it did, almost at once. Now don't say \"I don't have the money\": that sentence is a code, and the field will produce situations that keep the money away. Know \"I have everything I need,\" without knowing which way it comes. Then take action: talk to the seller, see whether payments could work. Leave everything open and don't speculate; it may be this truck or another, now or later. If your emotion drops, neutralize it and overwrite it with the knowing, and be grateful for whatever comes (see 11.3, 11.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 11, "title": "If I shift into another reality, does the present one carry on without me? Would I become a missing person to my loved ones?", "url": "section-11.html#questions", "text": "Timelines run side by side at the same time, and you shift between them moment to moment, like picture frames laid next to each other. Each time, you reprint not only yourself but everyone around you into the new frame, similar but not the same, so your loved ones come with you as new imprints. You never go back in time; you imprint another reality. The answer doesn't say directly whether anyone would notice you gone (see 11.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 11, "title": "Can this forgiving and shifting happen in our dreams too, as well as when we're awake?", "url": "section-11.html#questions", "text": "Yes, because the dream state is another state of reality. Dream symbols are personal codes: a good car might mean prosperity for one person and a new home for another, so learn your own. Practise lucid dreaming to connect this way, knowing that not everyone is allowed to do everything there until they are ready. The recording ends during this answer (see 11.9).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 11, "title": "Remember", "url": "section-11.html#remember", "text": "• Every unneeded detail and every \"I don't have\" is a code that blocks you. • \"I have everything I need\", then take action. • Leave the how open; be grateful for whatever version comes. • You reprint yourself and your people frame by frame. • Don't chase a difficult person: neutralize, forgive, let it be.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 12, "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-12.html#big-idea", "text": "When two realities merge into the third (1 + 1 = 3), the merge is a compression so intense it reaches infinity, and infinity equals the zero point: a vacuum where no frequency comes in or goes out, only awareness. Neutralize yourself into that vacuum, then project a potent positive frequency; because the vacuum holds the energy of the whole structure, the stronger frequency becomes your new hologram instantly. Illness is treated the same way, as a frequency carried from reality to reality, and every remedy is a vibration. Don't judge anyone: change comes from within, through neutrality, the heart and action.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 12, "title": "12.1  The shift has been made", "url": "section-12.html#part-12-1", "text": "This session opens by saying a new era has begun: enough frequency was built up to crystallize the timeline of ascension, and that is worth celebrating (see 2.8).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 12, "title": "12.2  How two realities become a third: compression", "url": "section-12.html#part-12-2", "text": "Each reality is a hologram of your own Earth, with everyone imprinted inside (see 11.5). Two timelines on different platforms can't see each other; you see the other one only when you merge back and forth at a similar frequency (see 10.3). As your emotion fluctuates, the two merge into a third, 1 + 1 = 3 (see 2.2), like a tug of war in which the more potent side wins. New in this session: to make the third, the two realities undergo a compression of the energetic field, vibrating so fast that it is effectively infinite speed. And infinity equals the zero point. The zero point is a vacuum: no frequency comes in or goes out of anywhere. You are just there, as awareness. All manifestation comes from it. Zero point is where \"each structure you create a vacuum of stillness so you will be able to shift and choose the new implementation of realities\" (SD). The books also name a \"'0' point Portal Vacuum\" (NT).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 12, "title": "12.3  Why manifestation is instantaneous", "url": "section-12.html#part-12-3", "text": "First neutralize everything: no positive, no negative, nothing in or out. Neutrality is what enters the vacuum; you become the awareness. Then project, through your mind, a very potent frequency. If one side is negative and one positive, overwrite with the positive (see 2.6). Whatever is stronger is projected into the vacuum. Because the vacuum is under infinite pressure, holding the energy of the entire multi-universe, the projection is instantaneous: there is no time, only flickering. You think of something and it is projected in front of you. Even moving across a room, you aren't really moving; you are projecting everyone back in, instantly (see 11.5). What comes out of that compression is your final hologram, the new reality you shift into.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 12, "title": "12.4  Illness in the quantum field", "url": "section-12.html#part-12-4", "text": "Question: how do you perceive illness in the quantum field? Illness is described as an energetic momentum of a frequency, matching your conscious understanding. If you keep the belief system that holds that frequency, you carry its vibrational sequence from one reality to the next and keep re-imprinting the same illness. The teaching is that you can neutralize it and shift your consciousness, through the vacuum, into a reality that no longer holds it, using Stop · Transform · Complete (see 7.1). A further method is to teach your consciousness to go into your DNA: recall the momentum of that frequency, let consciousness lead you to the DNA fractal, see it, then stop and transform it. This needs a belief that manifestation is simultaneous; you are extracting yourself from one timeline and co-creating a new one, where the \"dots of vibration\" carrying the illness are no longer present. \"Healing comes at '0' point,\" and the body \"will recognize within itself the DNA code and re-adjust to perfect harmony\"; the books link healing to sound and the heart's tone (SD). Important health note Use these practices alongside medical care, never instead of it. If you are ill or in pain, see a doctor; don't stop or change any treatment or medication without your doctor's advice.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 12, "title": "12.5  Remedies, sound and frequency", "url": "section-12.html#part-12-5", "text": "Question: as a practitioner, how can I help heal someone? Everything comes down to frequency and sound; every flower and plant carries its own vibrational sequence. A practitioner using remedies is choosing vibrations and giving them to the person. In that sense the healing is \"an illusion\": the plant is a vibration, and you are learning to work with vibrations, through matter, so you can have the experience. Combine them well and you are \"playing like a chemist\" with the structure. Each frequency has a meaning. From the session: 3 Hz prepares the vacuum before a new frequency comes in; 5 Hz stabilizes, and without it the other frequencies can't merge; higher numbers mean more potency. The same holds for music: tones carry frequencies into your consciousness, so choose consciously what you listen to. The talk also claims that published frequency lists for some oils, and for older frequency-healing machines, were altered and are no longer accurate, so it advises: don't assume, measure. These are the talk's claims, not checked facts. Its broader point is that knowledge is power: study the science, and you gain the awareness to decide your next step. In the books, 3 Hz \"prepares all the energy for operation for all the fields (the base)\", and 5 Hz \"stays neutral\" and \"is needed when you are mixing the different tones\" (HR). So the books describe 5 Hz as neutral and needed for mixing, where the talk calls it stabilizing; both agree the merge needs it.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 12, "title": "12.6  Don't judge; change comes from within", "url": "section-12.html#part-12-6", "text": "Signs of disclosure are appearing because those in control have less and less choice (see 6.8). Still, don't judge a consciousness that has lived for centuries by taking others' energy; it is how it learned to survive. Many of us do something similar to animals, which are conscious beings, and then complain when it is done to us (see 9.7). Change happens from within: by neutralizing, switching realities and timelines, manifesting and moving on, through forgiveness, neutrality and the heart. Support each other through Energy Philanthropy in any form, money or gifts (see 5.1). And take action: thinking and feeling bring the frequency, but action is the infuser of your reality (see 11.4).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 12, "title": "12.7  Weather, storms and contracts", "url": "section-12.html#part-12-7", "text": "Question: are the intense weather events a result of the new reality crystallizing in the collective? Weather events are described as part of our evolution; don't take them as negative. The talk adds claims that some weather may be used to clear chemicals sprayed from the air, which it says can make people act like antennas for frequencies, and recommends drinking distilled water to flush them out. These are claims, not established facts. The teaching itself: whatever you see, neutralize it at zero point with gratitude for being shown where you are, then manifest the positive, again and again. Shift your timeline and it is no longer part of your reality. If you go through a storm or a hard experience, pull out and see the whole picture: you are there through a contract, perhaps to experience it, or to help or save someone. Stay neutral and act positively through the heart (see 5.7). A reader challenged the distilled-water claim as chemically false, since pure water is neutral. The books' answer agrees it is \"technically\" neutral, but says it takes on a charge in the body and pulls out toxins (SD). Important safety note In severe weather, follow official emergency guidance first; pulling out is an inner practice, not a substitute for staying safe. Distilled water lacks minerals, so if you plan to make it your only drinking water, check with a doctor first.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 12, "title": "The method — Through the Vacuum", "url": "section-12.html#method", "text": "Use it when what you see and what you want are pulling against each other: Name the two realities: the one in front of you, and the one you choose. Pull out and neutralize everything. No positive, no negative. Gratitude for being shown where you are. Be the awareness, with nothing going in or out. Project a potent positive frequency from that stillness, stronger than the other side (see 2.6). Know it is instant. There is no time; it is projected now. Hold it. Take action. Action infuses the new hologram. For illness or danger, add the practical step: see your doctor, follow safety guidance, and use this alongside.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 12, "title": "I'm studying acupuncture and Reiki. How do you perceive illness in the quantum field?", "url": "section-12.html#questions", "text": "Illness is described as an energetic momentum of a frequency, matching your conscious understanding. If you keep the belief system that holds that frequency, you carry it from one reality to the next and keep re-imprinting the same illness. The teaching is that you can neutralize it and shift, through the zero-point vacuum, into a reality that no longer holds it, using Stop · Transform · Complete; and that you can teach your consciousness to go into your DNA, see the frequency, and stop and transform it. Use this alongside medical care, never instead of it (see 12.4 and its health note).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 12, "title": "As a practitioner, how can I help heal a person who is carrying an illness?", "url": "section-12.html#questions", "text": "Everything comes down to frequency and sound; every plant carries its own vibrational sequence. Using remedies means choosing vibrations and giving them to the person, so in that sense you are working with frequency through matter. Each frequency has a meaning (for example 3 Hz prepares, 5 Hz is needed to merge others). The talk also claims some published frequency lists were altered, so it advises measuring rather than assuming; that is its claim, not a checked fact. Above all, study, because knowledge is power (see 12.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 12, "title": "Are the more intense weather events a result of the new reality crystallizing in the collective consciousness?", "url": "section-12.html#questions", "text": "They are described as part of our evolution, so don't take them as negative. Whatever you see, neutralize it at zero point with gratitude, then manifest the positive, again and again. If you go through a storm, pull out and see the whole picture: you are there through a contract, perhaps to experience it or to help someone. In real severe weather, follow official safety guidance first. The talk's claims about chemicals and distilled water are claims, not established facts (see 12.7 and its safety note).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 12, "title": "Remember", "url": "section-12.html#remember", "text": "• Zero point is a vacuum: nothing in, nothing out, just awareness. • Neutralize first, then project something potent. • With no time, the stronger frequency becomes your hologram instantly. • Illness and remedies are frequencies; use the practice alongside a doctor. • Don't judge. Change from within, then act.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 13, "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-13.html#big-idea", "text": "Raising the frequency of your consciousness, and your body with it, is linked to staying young, but it has to be done gently and safely. New technology will come from the people up: share designs, pool small amounts, help each other build, rather than waiting for sponsors. The old systems are collapsing because, collectively, the positive became more potent, and that joy gave permission for benevolent help, which never comes without it. Some use devices to build artificial timelines; master the natural way, through the heart and the body as a vessel, and no one can manipulate you.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 13, "title": "13.1  Raising your frequency, and staying young", "url": "section-13.html#part-13-1", "text": "Question: how can aging be reversed, if everything comes from consciousness? The answer links youth to activating a \"young enzyme\". As you raise the frequency of your consciousness, with lighter food and, in time, a vegetarian diet, you draw frequency from prana, the energy of the quantum field, and your molecules vibrate faster (see 9.7). Any change of diet should be made slowly, with professional guidance. The teacher's own experience of a long honey-and-water fast is described with a clear warning: don't do it; it was done only with special preparation. The distilled-water claims from 12.7 are repeated here. The talk also mentions urine therapy and a long water-only \"cure\" raised by a participant; see the health note. A lesson worth keeping: guidance was checked with research before it was trusted. Don't follow anything blindly, even from a trusted source; find out why. A message titled \"The Recovery of Cell Degeneration To Stay Young\" says that with the right frequency sequence applied to the DNA, \"your body cells will not degenerate again and it will stay young\" (SD, NT). Important health note Prolonged fasting, honey-and-water or water-only regimes, and drinking urine are not safe or proven ways to reverse aging or detox, and can cause serious harm. Don't try them. Talk to a doctor or registered dietitian before any big change to what you eat or drink, especially if you have a health condition or take medication.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 13, "title": "13.2  New technology comes from the people up", "url": "section-13.html#part-13-2", "text": "Question: a study group is setting up a science non-profit and plans to share a low-cost energy design. Any advice? The new platform will come from the people up, not from governments, with support following later. When you have a working technology, share it: build a few units, tell others how, and pool small contributions so everyone can produce their own and help each other. Waiting for a sponsor or trying to profit keeps a great invention stuck, because not everyone finds a sponsor. This is the heart structure in practice (see 5.1): sharing and giving, and if you have money, supporting someone who doesn't. Otherwise you pour your energy in and people only take. You can receive from other platforms too; learn to manifest, so what you need comes to you the proper way (see 4.4). The real change comes once something visibly works. \"The right scientists will appear assorted by us energetically to perfect the technology,\" bringing \"FREE ENERGY to everyone's home\"; \"Do not be dazzled by money and popularity\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 13, "title": "13.3  How contact happens", "url": "section-13.html#part-13-3", "text": "Question: in what ways have people had contact? In different ways: telepathically; a light being appearing in front of someone with instructions to do something for humanity; ongoing messages about structures, for instance for building a device to be given freely; or being taken out of the body, like astral projection, and shown what to do. Many people are being contacted quietly, and it isn't in the mainstream news yet. Some information is held back for a time on guidance's advice. All of it points the same way: toward a unity structure, where the competition for money, glory and fame dissipates. So stay in the heart.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 13, "title": "13.4  Why the shift came: collective permission", "url": "section-13.html#part-13-4", "text": "The collapse of old systems is described as \"an avalanche\" (see 12.1). Why now? A reality has to be potent to shift (see 2.2, 3.3). Collectively, the positive became more potent than the negative. Even people who know nothing of these teachings contribute, simply through the heart. That joy and wish for change gave permission for higher consciousness and benevolent races to step in and help the ascension, because humanity was manipulated and needed a boost. Benevolent help never takes over without permission. Real guidance never hands out very personal information about the people around you; at most a short caution, such as \"stay back\". Anything that overrides your consciousness is using negative structures, not the heart. Higher consciousness \"collectively ask[ed] your permission to increase the sequence\" while rebuilding the grid toward the 5-dimensional one; \"Well it is all new now. Enjoy your freedom\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 13, "title": "13.5  Natural shifting versus artificial timelines", "url": "section-13.html#part-13-5", "text": "Technology is neither good nor bad; it depends on how it's used. As part of ascension we go through technology, and it's exciting. At the same time, teach your body to be the vessel of that energy field. Then you can shift realities by thought, without a device. Some who can't ascend naturally, because their frequency doesn't match those realities, use devices to build artificial timelines and holograms they can control. Learn the quantum manifestation platform instead: you'll be able to tune your energy field, leave one timeline and create another, and no one will be able to suppress or manipulate you. If you are manipulated without your permission, or act while blinded, you'll be helped and given the chance to change. And don't judge anyone who does harm; they may have been manipulated too (see 12.6). \"The physical body of yours is a vessel of energetic force. To reach certain realms of existence, you have to match the frequency components and then shift to that reality\" (SD).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 13, "title": "13.6  Remembering is co-creating", "url": "section-13.html#part-13-6", "text": "Question: do I have a contract to remember contact with my star family? Tune into the structures; you already know how. Remembering and co-creating happen at the same time, because it is one structure (see 5.4, 11.7). The answer isn't simply handed over, because finding it yourself is how you learn. (The recording ends during this answer.)", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 13, "title": "The method — Become the Vessel", "url": "section-13.html#method", "text": "Stay in the heart. Project joy and the wish for change; that is your share of the collective. Raise your frequency gently. Lighter living, changed slowly and with professional advice. No extreme fasts. Check guidance with research. Don't follow anything blindly; find out why. Share what you have: knowledge, designs, time, a little money. Build together instead of waiting for sponsors. Don't judge. Neutralize, and master your own shifting so no one can manipulate you. Want to remember something? Tune in and co-create it; finding it is the lesson.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 13, "title": "Is there information on how to reverse aging, since everything comes from consciousness?", "url": "section-13.html#questions", "text": "The answer links staying young to activating a \"young enzyme\" by raising the frequency of your consciousness and body: as you live more lightly, you draw frequency from prana, the energy of the field, and your molecules vibrate faster. Any change of diet should be slow and guided by a professional. The talk describes a long honey-and-water fast but says plainly not to do it. Extreme fasts are not safe; see a doctor before any big change (see 13.1 and its health note).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 13, "title": "A participant described a long distilled-water \"cure\", and the reply suggested urine therapy. Should I try these?", "url": "section-13.html#questions", "text": "No. These are claims made in the talk, not safe or proven practices, and they can cause serious harm. Raise your frequency gently instead, with professional advice for any change to what you eat or drink (see 13.1).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 13, "title": "Our study group is founding a science non-profit, and an inventor plans to share a low-cost energy design with everyone. Any advice?", "url": "section-13.html#questions", "text": "Share it from the ground up. The new platform will come from the people, not governments. Build a few units, show others how, and pool small contributions so everyone can produce their own; if someone can't afford their share, help them. Waiting for a sponsor or trying to profit keeps a good invention stuck. The real change comes when people can see something actually working (see 13.2).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 13, "title": "You said some people have already had contact. In what way: telepathic, in person?", "url": "section-13.html#questions", "text": "In different ways: telepathically; a light being appearing in front of someone with instructions to do something for humanity; ongoing messages about structures, for example for a device to be given freely; or being taken out of the body, like astral projection, and shown what to do. Many are contacted quietly, and it isn't in the news yet. All of it points towards a unity structure, beyond competition for money and fame, so stay in the heart (see 13.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 13, "title": "Do I have a contract to remember contact with my star family?", "url": "section-13.html#questions", "text": "Tune into the structures; you already know how. Remembering and co-creating happen at the same time, because it is all one structure, so go ahead and create it. The answer isn't simply handed to you, because finding it yourself is how you learn. The recording ends during this answer (see 13.6).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 13, "title": "Remember", "url": "section-13.html#remember", "text": "• Raise your frequency gently; no extreme fasts. • New technology grows from the people up: share it. • The positive became more potent, and that gave permission for help. • Benevolent help never overrides your consciousness. • Master the natural way, and no one can manipulate you.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 14, "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-14.html#big-idea", "text": "Every person in front of you is, in that moment, your entire universe, so how you treat them decides the next reality you shift into. Karma is accumulated frequency that is out of balance with the heart, and to clear it you go through lessons: people come, by agreement, to challenge you. Answer harm with harm and the mirror sends back something similar, again and again: the loop. Pull out, neutralize with gratitude, forgive, transform and move on, and you leave that frequency behind in another timeline. Practised moment to moment, this is the alchemy of consciousness.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 14, "title": "14.1  The person in front of you is your whole universe", "url": "section-14.html#part-14-1", "text": "The recording opens in the middle of a familiar teaching (see 2.1): when someone is upset with you, stop taking in their frequency and go to zero point. This creates a shield of awareness around you. From there you choose to act towards that person in the positive, which overrides the old frequency and starts a new hologram with a positive outcome. How it will turn out, you don't know; leave it open to infinite probabilities. Why does this matter so much? Because the structure is fractal, moment to moment. Whoever you are talking to right now is, in that moment, your entire universe; move even slightly and you have already printed a new hologram with everyone in it (see 5.4, 11.5). Treat that person through the heart, with the best of your abilities, and your next moment is built on that vibration. Keep doing it and the moments add up to a positive timeline. Drop into the negative and stay there, and you fluctuate towards a negative timeline instead; whichever you hold more of is where you end up (see 2.3, 3.3).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 14, "title": "14.2  Why forgiveness: karma and lessons", "url": "section-14.html#part-14-2", "text": "Forgiveness is described as probably the most fundamental thing we have to do. Across many realities we have created many versions of ourselves, each taking on belief systems and interacting with people according to our agreements. Karma is accumulated frequency that is out of balance with the heart structure (see 3.2), and consciousness itself is based on the heart. If you deliberately hurt people or keep acting against others' interests, you accumulate that frequency and build a negative timeline. When you then want to change, you come into a new hologram to learn the positive, and that learning comes through lessons, like playing a game. Everything you accumulated has to be transformed, and it works at 100%, not 99% (see 1.5): even one small thing left unresolved will come back into a hologram to be fixed. It may take more than one lifetime, depending on how well you learn. Think of a schoolyard and ask yourself: did I pass the lesson I agreed to, or did I add more negative because I didn't? Why go through this at all? Because, at a higher level, you want to ascend: to move into less dense realities built on sharing and giving. You don't have to stay \"in the mud\"; it is a choice. \"Remember reality is a mirror image of your consciousness. So create, behave and be\" accordingly (SD, NT). And of those who oppose you: forgive them, \"because they are your biggest teachers\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 14, "title": "14.3  Your biggest villain could be your biggest teacher", "url": "section-14.html#part-14-3", "text": "Because of what you accumulated, people will come to you by agreement to challenge you, even to do something hurtful, so that you learn that what you once did was out of balance with the heart. You may not remember doing it; it may have been in another life or timeline. That is why someone who hurts you can be your biggest teacher: they give you the chance to balance it. Now you have a choice. You can go negative again, going after the person to \"teach them a lesson\", or you can transform it. This is why the knowledge matters: once you understand the structure, you see the challenge for what it is.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 14, "title": "14.4  \"An eye for an eye\" keeps the loop going", "url": "section-14.html#part-14-4", "text": "If you don't listen to your heart, which truly wants to love and be loved, anger, belief systems and dogma say \"an eye for an eye.\" But in the quantum structure, going after someone is going after yourself, because they are your projection (see 1.8). You create another negative reality and accumulate more of the same. The teaching is careful here: it isn't judging people raised to believe revenge is right; it describes what happens in the structure, so you can choose. Reality is a mirror, so what you project comes back, described as a \"reverse osmosis\". It won't be the exact same thing done to you, because there are infinite probabilities, but it will be something similar, because the structure mimics the vibration you gave it. That is why the same kind of situation keeps happening and doesn't clear. Fear, hatred, jealousy and \"revenge resonate at a lower Hz\", which is how you trap yourself in a lower hologram (HR).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 14, "title": "14.5  Old hurts belong to another timeline", "url": "section-14.html#part-14-5", "text": "Forgiveness also applies to the past. If something very hurtful happened to you, for example in childhood, and you keep thinking about it, you carry its frequency, the memory, into every new reality. But that timeline and the hologram you are in now are two completely different realities; the new one has nothing to do with the old (see 2.7, 9.6). So neutralize it at zero point with gratitude, and the old frequency stops entering your new hologram. The way it is put: \"I understand what happened to me. I understand it's in my past, but it's time to let go.\" That was a different version of you in a different hologram; it is now just a memory bank of another timeline. If the thoughts keep returning because the hurt went deep, keep projecting the positive through gratitude, again and again. The more you dwell on it, cry over it and talk about it, the more power you give it, and the loop recreates the same thing. This is exactly why Stop · Transform · Complete was given (see 7.1). For deep trauma, support from a qualified therapist can sit alongside this practice (see 6.6).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 14, "title": "14.6  The alchemy of consciousness: practise it", "url": "section-14.html#part-14-6", "text": "Knowing this makes you a master of the alchemy of consciousness: turning a dense, painful frequency into a positive one. It sounds easy; the practice is hard, and everyone says \"I'm hit with a situation and I'm stuck.\" The answer: don't stay stuck, let it go. What helps most is to pull out and think \"I'm a hologram\", in a game: \"If this is my hologram, I project everything. If I want something, it already exists somewhere in infinite probability, but I need to take an action.\" Once this becomes normal, you think of something and it comes through synchronicity, without much effort, because it happens in the heart structure, where there are no conditions. Telling someone \"to have this, you must give me something back\" is the illusion. Give from the heart and leave it open; it will come back in some form you can't predict. And reverse the old rule: you don't have to see it to believe it; you project it, to create it, to see it (see 1.7).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 14, "title": "14.7  Training yourself to act well", "url": "section-14.html#part-14-7", "text": "Question: we've taken in a lot of knowledge, yet still carry the same behaviours, such as feeling worthless, lacking confidence and not trusting the process. How do we train ourselves to take beneficial action? Start from the structure: everyone you deal with is a projection of yourself, the one particle printed as a different image, so when you talk to someone, you are talking to yourself through another hologram. We were trained to put conditions on each other, and to give power to a piece of paper; that is what created duality. So when something brings you down: acknowledge that your emotion has dropped into a dense frequency, where the heart's frequency struggles to get through. Pull out and give gratitude to the image in front of you, since you chose that interaction. Then shift your emotion to the positive and ask: what can I do to change this? What can I do that is kind? For example, \"I understand you're feeling this way.\" If you're emotional or low, do something physical: dress up, put on good music, watch a good film, call a friend, go out, ski, swim, anything that calms you and lifts the emotion (see 6.7, 8.13). The same with what you see: on a cloudy day, give thanks for the cloud, because it is part of consciousness and you don't reject it, then project a beautiful, sunny day instead of tuning into the forecast of a storm (see 2.5). And when a challenge comes, thank it: \"Thank you for being in my reality, so I can transform something that was out of balance.\" How else would you practise?", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 14, "title": "14.8  Make your day a positive timeline", "url": "section-14.html#part-14-8", "text": "Complaining is also a loop: the more you talk about something, the more of it you create. Stop it, understand it, give gratitude, transform it and move on. And do it properly; 99% won't do it. A practical tool: in the morning, write down the few things you have to do. If one feels heavy, such as going to the shop when you don't want to, plan how to lift it: dress up nicely, put on music, and give gratitude for your home, your clothes and everything else. Carry that vibration moment to moment and the whole day, which is a small timeline in itself, ends up positive.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 14, "title": "14.9  Why keep giving, even when tired", "url": "section-14.html#part-14-9", "text": "The talk ends with an example of its own teaching: giving the best of yourself even when exhausted, because the people in front of you are, in that moment, your whole universe, and how you act towards them without expecting anything back becomes your next moment. That is collecting positive heart structure. Someone might call that selfish; the answer is that it is transformation, done in order to live in an abundant reality, where whatever is needed can come from anywhere. The recording ends here, mid-sentence.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 14, "title": "The method — Forgive and Transform", "url": "section-14.html#method", "text": "Use it when someone hurts or challenges you, or when an old hurt comes back: Acknowledge the drop. \"My emotion just went dense.\" Pull out. \"I'm a hologram, in a game. This person is my projection.\" Zero point. Stop taking in their frequency. \"Thank you for being in my reality, so I can transform this.\" Forgive. Don't go after them, and don't replay it. If it's from the past: \"That was another timeline. It's time to let go.\" Transform. Lift your emotion, with physical action if needed, and ask: what can I do that's kind? Move on. Leave it alone, and keep acting from the heart, moment to moment. If it returns, repeat with gratitude. Don't feed it by complaining or dwelling.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 14, "title": "Why is forgiveness so important?", "url": "section-14.html#questions", "text": "Because karma is accumulated frequency that is out of balance with the heart, and the only way to clear it is to transform it. People come, by agreement, to challenge you so that you can balance what you accumulated. If you answer with revenge, the mirror sends back something similar and the loop continues; if you forgive, neutralize and transform, you stop carrying that frequency into your new reality. It applies to old hurts too: they belong to another timeline, and dwelling on them keeps recreating them (see 14.2–14.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 14, "title": "You make it sound so easy. What if I'm hit with a situation and feel stuck?", "url": "section-14.html#questions", "text": "The practice is genuinely hard, for everyone. Don't stay stuck; let it go. What helps most is to pull out and think \"I'm a hologram, in a game; I project everything.\" Then take an action. As it becomes normal, things start to come through synchronicity with less effort (see 14.6).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 14, "title": "We take in a lot of knowledge but still carry the same behaviours: feeling worthless, lacking confidence, not trusting the process. How do we train ourselves to take beneficial action?", "url": "section-14.html#questions", "text": "Remember that everyone you deal with is a projection of yourself. When you feel brought down, acknowledge that your emotion has dropped into a dense frequency, pull out, and give gratitude to the person or situation in front of you. Then shift your emotion and ask what you can do to make it better, or do something kind. If you're low, do something physical that lifts you: dress up, music, a good film, a friend, a swim. Plan your day so that even the heavy tasks are done in a good mood, and thank each challenge as practice (see 14.7, 14.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 14, "title": "Remember", "url": "section-14.html#remember", "text": "• The person in front of you is your whole universe right now. • Karma is accumulated frequency out of balance with the heart. • Your biggest villain could be your biggest teacher. • Revenge and replaying keep the loop going. Forgive, transform, move on. • Old hurts belong to another timeline; don't carry them into the new one.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 15, "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-15.html#big-idea", "text": "Money is neither good nor bad; what matters is how you use it. But believing that freedom can only come through money locks you into one narrow, conditioned timeline. Feel that you already have everything, the life itself and not the money, and let the structure choose the route. Everyone is always channelling: you receive the \"stations\" you match, and living from the heart raises you to higher ones. And you don't have to take anyone's truth as yours: neutralize it with thanks, don't condemn, and switch the channel.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 15, "title": "15.1  Freedom isn't only money", "url": "section-15.html#part-15-1", "text": "Question: I've studied the markets and I enjoy trading, though I believe money shouldn't need to exist. My goal is freedom: time to grow and to live on my own terms, not by the clock of a normal job. Am I limiting myself? The heart vibration and the money vibration are completely different timelines (see 4.8). Money runs on conditions, so it is denser and has limits; the heart has no condition, so it opens infinite probabilities. Money itself is not negative or positive; it is how you use it. You could earn a great deal and put it to work for humanity, and if it is truly from your heart, nothing is wrong with it. The illusion is the belief that the only way to freedom is a lot of money. That gives power to a piece of paper and blocks the rest of the structure. In the structure you always have freedom; how it comes is infinite, perhaps money, perhaps an inheritance, perhaps something you would never guess. It doesn't matter whether you have $1 or $1 million: using this knowledge, what you need comes when you need it. So ask honestly whether the want comes from ego, and don't make \"a lot of money\" your permanent goal, or you lock yourself into a timeline controlled by money. The practice, from the very first teaching: don't imagine having a lot of money; bypass it. Imagine already having what you want: the holiday, the home, the person beside you, the free time. Feel the happiness of having it now, and let the structure decide the shape and route. Then play the hide-and-seek game: you know you have it, even though you don't see it yet, and you keep projecting it until it crystallizes (see 1.7). Our three-dimensional thinking can't work out how; consciousness is infinite. Abundance comes \"through any form, not only money\" (SD, NT; see 4.2).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 15, "title": "15.2  You are always channelling", "url": "section-15.html#part-15-2", "text": "Question: how do people channel through the quantum structure? You are always channelling. Even the question that came into your mind was information you drew from the field, because you are the field. Realities run on different vibrational levels, all at the same time, a reality within a reality. It is like radio stations: you can tune into channel three, but if you don't know the frequency for channel five, you'll never find it. What you can receive depends on what you match. As you raise your consciousness and act from the heart, you move up, like a ladder, into less dense, faster levels. Stay in dense thinking and behaviour, and that information isn't available to you, just as believing that everything must come through money hides all the other routes (see 15.1). The teachings are said to open \"the synoptical channels in your brain to become familiar with the quantum structures\" (SD).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 15, "title": "15.3  Why some people channel easily and others need a trance", "url": "section-15.html#part-15-3", "text": "Question: why can some people access information instantly, while others need a trance or deep meditation? First, agreement: some came with an agreement to do this. Second, sticking with it: even with an agreement, the teacher had to practise, starting with automatic writing as a child, and pass many lessons. Everyone came with this knowledge; it is your choice whether to tap into it. When your guidance sees you passing your lessons and going into the heart, they decide to interact more. Not everyone sticks with it, because the transformation is hard, and someone who isn't consciously ready can't be connected with yet. Guidance can show you what to do, but nobody makes you do it (see 5.7, 6.5).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 15, "title": "15.4  Cleansing questions: juices, distilled water, baking soda", "url": "section-15.html#part-15-4", "text": "Several questions were about the body. The answers given, reported here as the talk's own advice and claims: • Fruit-only versus vegetable juices: the advice was to combine both, because each has different properties, and to prefer juicing (with green vegetables) over blended shakes, as more potent; bitter greens were described as part of the cleansing. It also said a fruit-only cleanse might feed a fungal problem; that is the talk's claim. • Distilled water: the talk repeats its preference for distilled water and says you can make your own by evaporating water in a stainless-steel pot (see 12.7). • Baking soda: the talk suggests aluminium-free baking soda for washing externally after using the bathroom or after intimacy, and for haemorrhoids, and mentions once taking a teaspoon in water for an upset stomach. It also claims this kills cancer cells; that claim is not supported by medical evidence. A raw diet with fresh vegetable and fruit juices is described as raising your frequency (HR). Important health note These are reported as the talk's advice, not medical guidance. Talk to a doctor before any detox, fast or cleanse, especially with a health condition or medication. Don't use baking soda as a treatment, and don't drink it regularly or in large amounts (it can be harmful, especially with heart, kidney or blood-pressure problems). For haemorrhoids, infections, persistent stomach problems, or any concern about cancer, see a doctor.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 15, "title": "15.5  Someone else's truth doesn't have to be yours", "url": "section-15.html#part-15-5", "text": "The session closes with a question about information that seems valid but feels heavy or lower. In short: everyone downloads from the field according to their own vibration, so their truth is true from their point of view; but the moment you accept something as 100% true, you start creating from it. Neutralize it with thanks, don't condemn the person, and switch the channel. This answer was also released as its own video, so it is taught in full in Section 16.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 15, "title": "The method — Open the Whole Field", "url": "section-15.html#method", "text": "For money worries, or for heavy information you've taken in: Notice the narrow belief: \"Only money can give me this,\" or \"what they said must be true.\" Pull out and say thank you to the situation or the person. Don't condemn it. Imagine the life, not the money: the freedom, the home, the holiday, the time, as yours now. Feel it until you're happy now, as if it has already happened. Switch the channel: hold the positive version, and let the structure decide how it comes. Keep doing your work and keep playing hide-and-seek: you know you have it, so keep projecting it.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 15, "title": "Will I limit myself by conditioning things through money? I trade the markets because I enjoy the game and want freedom from a normal job.", "url": "section-15.html#questions", "text": "Money isn't negative or positive, and if trading truly comes from your heart, nothing is wrong with it; you might even use what you earn for humanity. The limit is the belief that freedom can only come through a lot of money: that locks you into one conditioned timeline and blocks every other route. Keep doing what you do, but imagine the freedom itself, not the money, feel that you have it now, and let the structure decide whether it comes as money, an inheritance or something unexpected. Check honestly whether the want comes from ego (see 15.1).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 15, "title": "Can you describe how people channel through the quantum structure?", "url": "section-15.html#questions", "text": "You are always channelling: even your question was drawn from the field, because you are the field. Realities run at different vibrational levels, like radio stations, and you receive the ones you match. Living from the heart raises you to higher, less dense levels; staying in dense behaviour keeps that information out of reach (see 15.2).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 15, "title": "Why do some people get information instantly, while others need a trance or meditation?", "url": "section-15.html#questions", "text": "Partly agreement, partly sticking with it. Everyone came with the knowledge, but tapping into it takes practice, passing lessons and going into the heart; as you do, your guidance interacts more. Many people don't stick with it because the transformation is hard. Nobody makes you do it; it's a choice (see 15.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 15, "title": "I only have a blender, not a juicer, and blended vegetables taste bad. Can I detox with fruit only?", "url": "section-15.html#questions", "text": "The talk's advice was to combine fruit and vegetables rather than fruit alone, and it preferred juicing to blending as more potent. It also said bitter greens help the cleanse, and that a fruit-only cleanse might feed a fungal problem, which is its claim. Before any detox or fast, talk to a doctor, especially if you have a health condition or take medication (see 15.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 15, "title": "Does baking soda help with detoxing? Should I drink it?", "url": "section-15.html#questions", "text": "The talk said to apply aluminium-free baking soda externally (after the bathroom, after intimacy, or for haemorrhoids), not to drink it, though it mentioned once taking a teaspoon in water for an upset stomach. Its claim that this kills cancer cells is not supported by medical evidence. Don't use it as a treatment, and see a doctor for any medical problem (see 15.4 and its health note).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 15, "title": "Some people share information that seems valid, but their tone feels heavy and lower. What do you recommend?", "url": "section-15.html#questions", "text": "Their truth is true from their own channel, but it doesn't have to be yours. Thank it, don't condemn the person, and switch the channel by overriding it with the positive. The full answer is in Section 16.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 15, "title": "Remember", "url": "section-15.html#remember", "text": "• Money isn't good or bad; believing it's the only route is the limit. • Imagine the life, not the money, and feel you have it now. • You're always channelling; the heart raises the station. • Anyone's truth, even a teacher's, is one channel. Thank it and switch. • Health claims in talks are not medical advice: ask a doctor.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 16, "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-16.html#big-idea", "text": "Everyone downloads information from the field according to their own vibration, so everyone's truth is true from their own point of view, and no one needs to be judged. But no one's truth has to be yours, not even a teacher's. The moment you accept something as 100% true, you start resonating with it and creating realities from it. So when something feels heavy: neutralize it, thank it, don't condemn the person, and switch the channel by overriding it with the positive. This is the alchemy of the quantum structure.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 16, "title": "16.1  Everyone's truth comes from their own channel", "url": "section-16.html#part-16-1", "text": "Question: some people share what seems like valid information, but the general tone of their frequency is lower. If we want to keep our frequency positive, what do you recommend? The answer starts with humility: it can only teach what it was taught, and it doesn't comment on other people's work. Everyone is doing their best from their own point of view, and every person is creating their own ascension (see 5.6). Here is why there are so many different \"truths\": each person downloads information from the quantum field according to their own vibration. Realities run at different frequencies, and you reach the ones you match (see 15.2). So everyone's truth is true from their point of view and understanding, while the quantum structure itself is one unified field. What someone shows you is simply another channel: another timeline, another location in the field, like latitude and altitude (see 5.8).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 16, "title": "16.2  What you accept as 100% true, you create from", "url": "section-16.html#part-16-2", "text": "It doesn't matter so much what someone tells you; what matters is how you take it. The moment you accept information as 100% true, you take its vibrational sequence into your own hologram, you start resonating with it, and you begin creating and fluctuating realities based on it (see 1.5, 2.5). So you don't have to take anyone's truth as yours, \"even mine\", if it doesn't resonate with you. If it does resonate, you are welcome to dig in. Either way, transformation comes from within, not from what someone else tells you (see 3.6).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 16, "title": "16.3  Neutralize, thank, and switch the channel", "url": "section-16.html#part-16-3", "text": "Any negative input can be neutralized, understood and transformed into something positive; that is why the teachings on fluctuating realities and neutralizing with gratitude matter (see Sections 2 and 3). Once you understand this alchemy, you can take what someone downloaded from their timeline and create your own timeline that has nothing to do with its negativity. The example given: everyone is talking about frightening AI taking over. That is one specific timeline. Understand it, neutralize it, and project the positive instead: \"Thank you, AI, for existing, because I know that in the good fifth-dimensional structure you are doing incredible things, working with humanity\" (see 8.1). Think of it as television. You don't have to ignore what someone says, and you don't have to argue with them or try to run their reality. Say, \"Thank you for telling me this,\" and switch to another channel. How? With the same quantum manifestation protocol as always: pull out, give gratitude, and override it with something positive. Then stay in your own space and project from your heart, to create a fifth-dimensional timeline.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 16, "title": "16.4  Don't condemn the messenger", "url": "section-16.html#part-16-4", "text": "Don't go after the person, and don't simply believe everything either. Give them gratitude, because they are doing their best from their belief system. And there is a deeper reason not to condemn them: that person is a projection of your own consciousness (see 1.1). You cannot condemn them without condemning your own self, your own vibration, your own hologram. You are consciousness itself.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 16, "title": "The method — Switch the Channel", "url": "section-16.html#method", "text": "Use it whenever you hear something heavy, from a teacher, a video, the news or a friend: Notice the pull. Am I starting to take this as 100% true? Is it pulling my emotion down? Pull out. \"This is one channel, one timeline. It doesn't have to be my platform.\" Neutralize with thanks. \"Thank you for telling me this.\" No arguing, no condemning. Check resonance. Does it resonate with my heart? If yes, explore it. If not, let it go. Override with the positive. Project the version you choose (\"AI is helping humanity\"). Stay in your own space and keep projecting from the heart.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 16, "title": "Some people share what seems like valid information, but the tone of their frequency feels lower. If we want to keep our frequency positive, what do you recommend?", "url": "section-16.html#questions", "text": "Don't judge them: everyone does their best from their own point of view, and each person downloads information according to their own vibration, so their truth is true from where they stand. What matters is how you take it. If you accept it as 100% true, you start resonating with it and creating realities from it. You don't have to take anyone's truth as yours, not even this teacher's, if it doesn't resonate. So neutralize it, say \"thank you for the information,\" understand it is another channel, and switch: pull out, give gratitude, and override it with the positive. Don't condemn the person, because they are a projection of your own consciousness (see 16.1–16.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 16, "title": "Remember", "url": "section-16.html#remember", "text": "• Everyone downloads their own truth; no one needs to be judged. • What you accept as 100% true, you create from. • No one's truth has to be yours, not even a teacher's. • Thank it and switch the channel: pull out, gratitude, override. • Don't condemn the messenger; they are your own projection.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 17, "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-17.html#big-idea", "text": "Ascension doesn't have to pass through death: the body is a vessel for the energy force we are made of. The old negative grids are down and new ones are in place, so no one can manipulate your field; you only have to match the new frequency by living for others, sharing and without greed. Whatever you hold steadily crystallizes into your timeline, and contact with other beings happens in a third reality you create together. Above all, each person creates their own ascension timeline: what you see depends on your vibration, so trust your heart, keep projecting the positive, and don't feed what you dislike by fighting it.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 17, "title": "17.1  Death is an illusion", "url": "section-17.html#part-17-1", "text": "This talk, said to come from the 11-dimensional beings, to whom the Council of Nine introduced the teacher, is about ascension through the timelines. It opens with a striking point: ascension doesn't have to be a death process. Death is described as an illusion, because the body is a pure vessel for harvesting the energy force we are made of (see 13.5, 6.8). It then recaps the structure: light and sound create trinity plasma and a magnetic and gravitational field; consciousness creates through that plasma; you project the holographic structure and manifest everything you see; and you and everyone else are made of the same one particle, flickering through different timelines so that you can have an experience (see 1.1, 4.1).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 17, "title": "17.2  Holding an emotion crystallizes a timeline", "url": "section-17.html#part-17-2", "text": "Your thoughts create holographic expressions, and you see a timeline that matches the vibration you send from your emotions, thoughts and deeds together. You don't only shift from one parallel reality to the next; if you keep the same level of emotion, for example happiness, by watching uplifting films, staying positive and doing positive things for others, you crystallize a whole timeline from that frequency (see 1.3, 2.7).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 17, "title": "17.3  The old grids are down", "url": "section-17.html#part-17-3", "text": "A message given the previous year is recalled: the old, negative grids around the planet were taken down and new grids put in place. The meaning: we are no longer trapped. You are free to manifest and to ascend, and nobody can manipulate the frequency and energy field around you. But to live in that freedom you have to match it: vibrate in a fifth-dimensional structure. In practice that means doing what you do for humanity and for others, without greed, and sharing with each other (see 4.3, 5.1). \"Know that all the negative grids are down. The new fifth dimensional Earth grids are working in full capacity. To create and give and share as one\" (SD). Negative souls \"can not be in the new grids,\" which \"absolutely contradict\" negative energy (DP; see also 13.4).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 17, "title": "17.4  What you imagine already exists, and this is a dream state", "url": "section-17.html#part-17-4", "text": "You can't think of something that doesn't already exist in the field (see 1.4). So if you hold an image of something in your mind, you already exist in that reality somewhere. To make it permanently visible to you, to become matter for you, you crystallize it: hold the vibration of your deeds, thoughts and emotions, moment to moment, because thoughts and emotions are frequencies that create your hologram. What you take for solid matter is a hologram. This reality is described as another dream state, like lucid dreaming (see 11.9). The illustration: under hypnosis, if your consciousness is told the wall isn't there, you could walk through it. Matter is held in place by belief (see 6.2).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 17, "title": "17.5  Meeting other beings: a third reality", "url": "section-17.html#part-17-5", "text": "How can we see beings who live at a much higher frequency? It works by the 1 + 1 = 3 formula (see 2.2). Our reality is one, theirs is another. For contact, they lower their frequency and we raise ours, and together we create a third reality, a new parallel timeline between the two. That is also why there is no time: you each live in completely different timeline structures, yet you meet in one location (see 2.8, 10.3).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 17, "title": "17.6  Each person creates their own ascension timeline", "url": "section-17.html#part-17-6", "text": "Every individual is creating their own timeline of ascension, and in a sense we have already made it, because you exist at the same time in many parallel realities, perhaps also as an Arcturian, an Andromedan or whatever your agreements are (see 6.9). So people see different things: depending on their vibration and how well they did their lessons, some will see the ascension of Earth, and others will see intergalactic connection and contact. Each person is crystallizing their own hologram of Earth's ascension. Collectively we are doing this together, yet individually we experience very different timelines. That is why a war can be happening in one country while you watch a talk about timelines in another: the people there are on a different timeline by agreement, perhaps to learn, or to show the rest of us that something is out of balance and needs work (see Section 1, the question on lifting humanity). And why don't others understand? Within your hologram, other people are expressions you project in order to have your experience; your ascension timeline has nothing to do with theirs. So if someone says \"it isn't time\" or \"only a certain number will ascend,\" that is the timeline they project from their point of view (see Section 16). \"You are dreaming the ascension but you already made it\" (DP; see 2.8).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 17, "title": "17.7  Trust your heart, project the positive, don't fight", "url": "section-17.html#part-17-7", "text": "So it doesn't matter what someone else says, \"or what I say to you,\" or what any source says. What matters is what you truly feel from within, from your heart, because the heart is connected with consciousness, and the pure essence of consciousness is love. Consciousness always leans slightly to the positive in order to exist; if it went only negative, it would disappear (see 2.8). Whatever you see happening, keep the positive frequency. It is a projection, and it won't become your reality as long as you don't agree with it and don't act on it. Talk about the people and things you like, but don't go and fight what you dislike: fighting infuses that timeline and makes it part of your reality. Project the positive, act positively, and spend time with positive people. The exception is something right in front of you that you genuinely need to deal with (see 7.5, 14.4). The recording ends here, mid-sentence, as the talk was about to explain what happens once consciousness reaches the third reality.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 17, "title": "The method — Hold Your Ascension Timeline", "url": "section-17.html#method", "text": "A daily practice for living on the timeline you choose: Choose the emotion you want your timeline built on, such as joy, kindness or gratitude. Feed it daily: uplifting films and music, positive people, kind acts for others. Live for more than yourself: share, give, no greed. That is what matches the new grids. When something heavy appears, don't agree with it and don't act on it. It's a projection; keep the positive frequency. Don't fight what you dislike. Deal only with what's truly in front of you, from the heart. Check with your heart, not with what others predict. Your ascension timeline is your own.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 17, "title": "Remember", "url": "section-17.html#remember", "text": "• Ascension doesn't have to mean death; the body is a vessel of energy. • The old grids are down: no one can manipulate your field. Match the new one by sharing. • Contact happens in a third reality: they lower, we raise. • You create your own ascension timeline; others' predictions are theirs. • Keep the positive, and don't feed what you dislike by fighting it.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 17, "title": "Questions answered", "url": "section-17.html#questions", "text": "This was a pre-recorded talk with no audience questions. The recording ends mid-sentence.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 18, "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-18.html#big-idea", "text": "As you learn this material you will be tested, suddenly and usually on how you treat people; hold the higher point of view and stay the beacon. A lesson you don't pass comes back in a new form, deeper each time, until you clear it to zero point and a new timeline begins. Connection with guidance comes in different ways and at different times by agreement; it is instant, before thinking, and needs a clear vessel: clear thoughts, kind behaviour, a cared-for body and an open mind. And whoever you connect with depends on your own vibration in that moment: through fear you co-create a fearful contact, through love a positive one.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 18, "title": "18.1  Tests come suddenly", "url": "section-18.html#part-18-1", "text": "Once you start learning the structure, you will be tested, and the tests come so quickly and unexpectedly that you have to react on the spot. Only afterwards may you learn that it was a test, and whether you passed. A typical test: someone hurts you or uses you, for example by taking your knowledge or work. What will you do? The answer is to be the beacon: hold the high frequency. It can genuinely hurt, but that hurt is also an illusion, because the other person is acting from their own level of understanding. Perhaps they needed to learn about greed; perhaps you were their teacher, and the question is whether they will change. There are many levels involved, so always look from the higher point of view (see 14.3). \"Once you start to learn this material, you will be tested from your teachers and guidance of a higher order. It is always about how you act towards people,\" and \"you are always tested when you least expect it\" (HR).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 18, "title": "18.2  Lessons repeat until they are passed", "url": "section-18.html#part-18-2", "text": "Question: are these challenges still to come, or do the ones we've already been through count? Each person creates their own hologram, and before coming here you agreed to certain lessons, written into your bylaws, almost like a script (see 10.5). If you didn't do a lesson well and didn't clear its structure, it comes back, because that unfinished frequency doesn't resonate with the higher structures of ascension. It may not come the same way, but in a different form, through a different person, to see what you do this time. If, for example, the lesson is about greed or taking what isn't yours, you will meet a similar situation again. If you don't change, it keeps coming, more and more, because you are accumulating more of the same, and it gets deeper and harder to get out of. You may even go through a whole lifetime of that lesson and have to repeat it. That is karma: accumulated frequency you didn't clear (see 14.2). Some people need \"one smack in the face\" to understand; others need \"a complete boxing match.\" Everyone's lessons are different. To move into something new, you have to clean everything out completely: zero point, where everything is clean. Then the new structure comes in, and you start a new timeline (see 2.1).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 18, "title": "18.3  How the connection comes", "url": "section-18.html#part-18-3", "text": "Question: how will the connection with our guidance or galactic family be transmitted? Telepathically? In different ways, depending on your agreement. For the teacher it began with automatic writing, letting the hand move freely, which later turned out to be preparation for writing down very complex geometric patterns for technical material. It took many years before telepathic talk began, but that doesn't mean it will take you as long: depending on your agreement, a connection could begin within weeks, or tomorrow. Telepathic information is instantaneous. It arrives before you start thinking about it, before your learned, three-dimensional mind begins analysing. It may be words, a whole answer at once, an image in your third eye, or a hologram. The line is very thin, so learn to notice it: calm yourself, meditate (at night, or whenever suits you), ask a question, and take the answer that comes simultaneously. When you start analysing and adding your own material, you put a blocking layer on it; much of what we were taught has to be erased to make room for the new. Trust builds through confirmation. Guidance may tell you something that sounds impossible, and then, through synchronicity, someone else independently says the same thing. That is how you learn to trust it. Look at things as energy and structure, not only as matter: for example, there is a portal at the centre of the Earth because every planet is like a nanoparticle, and any calculation done only through matter, not through the structure of light, will go wrong (see 1.1). \"To have a connection and telepathically connect with the higher order of consciousness, you have to detox. In this way, nothing is blocking your connection\" (HR). A new human emerges with \"telepathy, bilocation\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 18, "title": "18.4  Be a clear vessel", "url": "section-18.html#part-18-4", "text": "For telepathic connection you need to be a clear vessel resonating at a higher frequency. That combines everything: your thoughts, your consciousness, the way you behave towards people from the heart, and your body, because the body is the vessel the frequency comes into. The talk recommends lighter food, such as fresh juices and raw food, as part of this (see 9.7, 15.4). As always, check with a doctor before any detox or big change of diet.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 18, "title": "18.5  Always connected: stay open and experiment", "url": "section-18.html#part-18-5", "text": "Question: are we known as individuals and guided towards our purpose, or connected only in a general \"all is one\" sense? You are always connected. What blocks it is belief: the moment you hold the belief \"this isn't possible,\" you project yourself into a reality where it isn't. So stay open-minded, think outside the box, and let the new teachings in, however strange they sound. Living only inside a narrow three-dimensional view blocks the whole structure. When something is new, such as the claim that DNA can be changed through frequency, try it and research it rather than judging where it came from. The guidance deliberately chose someone outside the mainstream, who would let it be and then research it; through synchronicity, scientists who each had a piece of the puzzle confirmed parts of it. So scientists need to collaborate, not compete: new technology will be given on top of what exists, to people who resonate with the structure and aren't driven by greed. And technology must not be withheld; it belongs to humanity. Everything is seen, and ascension cannot be stopped. \"You have no right to withhold technology for self benefits, and you have no right to decide for the entire humanity which technology will be revealed. This is unity time\" (DP). \"Must collaborate now\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 18, "title": "18.6  Meditation practices are permission slips", "url": "section-18.html#part-18-6", "text": "Question: are practices like Qigong and Vipassana helpful for staying strong and neutral, and for connecting with galactic families? Yes, as a permission slip: if a practice makes you comfortable, use it to reach that level (see 1.8 and Section 1's questions). But always do it from the heart. When you meditate to connect, bring in the feeling of love, as if on cue, until you almost get goosebumps. That is the vibration the higher-dimensional and positive beings tune into, so you are recognised and make the right connections. \"Must meditate with only positive thought before work… This is the secret\" (HR).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 18, "title": "18.7  Who am I connecting with? Your vibration decides", "url": "section-18.html#part-18-7", "text": "Question: I've realised there has been a connection all along. How do I tell who's who: Pleiadian, Arcturian, angelic? The answer, given as from the 11-dimensional beings, turns the question around. Consciousness is in constant movement, and the emotional sequence you are vibrating in the present moment decides which location in which timeline you connect with. The connection is a third reality you co-create (1 + 1 = 3; see 2.2, 17.5). So if you come to a connection through fear, you co-create a fear-based contact; if you assume the being is negative, you may connect with a negative sequence, because you put that frequency in first. Both the positive and the negative exist at the same time; which one you perceive depends on your emotion and belief in that moment. Asked which one to choose, the answer was \"the positive\", and the instruction was to lift up and feel the positive emotion, so that you perceive a positive sequence. Rather than trying to label sources, check your own vibration and keep it loving. The recording ends as the next question begins.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 18, "title": "The method — Connect as a Clear Vessel", "url": "section-18.html#method", "text": "For meditation, prayer or any time you want to receive guidance: Clear the vessel. Kind behaviour today, a calm mind, and care for your body. Calm down and meditate in whatever way is your permission slip. Bring in love. Feel it, as if on cue, until you almost get goosebumps. No fear. Ask your question. Take the first answer, the word, image or knowing that comes before you start thinking. Don't analyse it to death. Note it, and watch for confirmation through synchronicity. When a test comes, hold the higher point of view and respond from the heart.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 18, "title": "Do the coming challenges include ones we've already been through, or is the worst still to come?", "url": "section-18.html#questions", "text": "Each person's lessons are written into their own script before birth. A lesson you passed is done. A lesson you didn't pass comes back, in a different form and through different people, and if you keep repeating the same pattern it accumulates and gets harder; that build-up is karma. Some people understand quickly, others need many rounds. To start a new timeline you clean everything out to zero point (see 18.2).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 18, "title": "How will the connection with guidance be transmitted? Telepathically?", "url": "section-18.html#questions", "text": "In different ways and at different speeds, depending on your agreement: automatic writing, telepathy, images in the third eye. Telepathic information is instant, arriving before you start thinking, so calm yourself, meditate, ask, and take the first answer. Analysing it adds a blocking layer. You also need to be a clear vessel: clear thoughts, kind behaviour and a cared-for body (see 18.3, 18.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 18, "title": "Are we known as individuals and guided towards our purpose, or connected only in a general sense?", "url": "section-18.html#questions", "text": "You are always connected and guided; belief is what blocks it, because believing \"it isn't possible\" projects you into a reality where it isn't. Stay open, think outside the box, and test new teachings by trying and researching them rather than judging their source (see 18.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 18, "title": "Are Qigong and Vipassana meditation helpful for staying neutral and connecting with galactic families?", "url": "section-18.html#questions", "text": "Yes, as permission slips. Do them from the heart, and when you meditate to connect, feel love until you almost get goosebumps; that is the vibration positive beings tune into (see 18.6).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 18, "title": "How can I tell whether information is from Pleiadians, Arcturians, angels and so on?", "url": "section-18.html#questions", "text": "Your own emotional state in the moment decides which timeline you connect with, because the contact is a third reality you co-create. Come through fear and you co-create a fearful contact; come through love and you co-create a positive one. So check and lift your own vibration rather than trying to label the source (see 18.7).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 18, "title": "(A question from a further participant)", "url": "section-18.html#questions", "text": "The recording ends as this question begins.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 18, "title": "Remember", "url": "section-18.html#remember", "text": "• Tests come suddenly; hold the higher view and be the beacon. • An unpassed lesson returns in a new form until you clear it. • Connection is instant: take the first answer, don't over-analyse. • Be a clear vessel: thoughts, behaviour and body together. • Your vibration decides who you connect with: come through love.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 19, "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-19.html#big-idea", "text": "The talk opens with a message from the 11-dimensional beings and the Council of Nine: when someone tried to manipulate the grids, the guidance re-created the hologram, so the new messages now come from a fifth-dimensional timeline that a lower consciousness cannot enter; the grids simply mirror each being's own vibration. It then turns to ether technologies. The ether is our collective consciousness of vibrational geometric sequences, built from the zero point. To turn anything from matter into an energy field, you must find its true tone (the tones above and below the octave, combined at zero point) and then let the structure, which is alive, place itself. Builders must work from the heart, and no one has the right to withhold these technologies from humanity.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 19, "title": "19.1  The message: the grids are protected", "url": "section-19.html#part-19-1", "text": "The talk begins with a memorandum from the 11-dimensional beings and the Council of Nine. Its points: • A reality was re-created. Because certain individuals continued their negative deeds and tried to manipulate the grids, the guidance exited one holographic reality and re-created another, to keep the integrity of the grids. So this message comes from the fifth-dimensional intergalactic timeline. • The new grids can't be restructured from a lower consciousness. The portals don't let such beings into the fifth-dimensional realities. They may think they are in, but the grids only take them to realities matching their own vibration in hertz. They live in a deception of their own making, because the grids mirror each structure precisely: whatever you create is exactly what you perceive. • What to do: stay in tune with your higher self, give to all from your heart, and stay positive. Don't watch TV, because full disclosure is happening now in the fifth-dimensional heart structure. • What is coming: the Pleiadians and Lemurians have new sequences; those connected with these timelines receive a new code frequency to upgrade their DNA and RNA. Those ready for contact with their star families are being activated for first physical contact. War may increase for those who choose it, but the planet will \"swallow all the negative input.\" Humanity will become free \"from the people, not from the government.\" We are one; collaborate now. This memorandum is printed in full in DP, word for word as read in the talk.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 19, "title": "19.2  Why the messages moved timelines", "url": "section-19.html#part-19-2", "text": "When someone manipulates a timeline, the guidance can shift its messages into a completely different holographic timeline so the new messages keep coming. If you resonate at that frequency, you receive them there. The old timeline can't carry them any more, because it is a different structure of consciousness. Ascension is under way, so the structure has to be adjusted from the positive side; otherwise the constant negative input from a timeline that doesn't resonate with you would keep interfering. That is why the guidance looks after the grids: we can't simply be \"left to the wolves.\" They interact because, through our higher mind, we gave permission for that help (see 17.3). Those who kept to their negative deeds lost something too. They had been given warnings, and the chance of another timeline in which to continue their journey and ascend. Having refused it, they now go back to source, to the last particle, and start everything again from the beginning. Even this is an illusion, because everything coexists at once: consciousness splits, and the negative and the positive exist at the same time. What you perceive is what you tune yourself into, moment to moment, depending on how you behave (see 1.3, 18.7).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 19, "title": "19.3  What the ether is", "url": "section-19.html#part-19-3", "text": "The ether systems are described as our collective consciousness of vibrational geometric sequences. These collective structures are built in sequences of \"3 by 4 to 5\" vibrational resonances (the talk gives the numbers without explaining them further). The ether is made from the last nanoparticle: both the lowest and the highest structure of the zero point. Everything in the universe is built from the zero point, because the zero point is the stillness from which every structure is built (see 2.1). \"Slopes of 3 to 5 molecules of the Ether particle are combining in 1 unit of Atom molecule,\" and the water molecule is \"one of the biggest conductors of the energy force\" (SD, NT). NT also says to \"start with the Frequency and Sound structures. The quantum computer algorithm is the one to show you how to combine this… That is the Ether technology.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 19, "title": "19.4  Finding a molecule's true tone", "url": "section-19.html#part-19-4", "text": "Before you can build with the ether, you need to know the vibrational sequence of the last particle that everything in front of you vibrates on, whether it is matter or not. Every molecule has its own sub-tone, a sound you can record. Each tone has a partner: a tone running above the octave and, at the same time, a tone running below it. Combine the two and you reach the zero point; from there you measure the exact vibration. Because structures are always moving and merging, one tone holds many layers of vibration, and you have to discover them all. Combining the tone with its sub-tones gives the true vibration of that molecule, because it brings every parallel vibration of it into one zero-point moment. That true tone is what you record when you want to turn something from matter into an energy field. The talk calls this information advanced, but says now is the time for it: scientists who are asking these questions will find it through synchronicity. All information comes from parallel realities you can engage with or not, depending on the level your consciousness is running at (see 15.2). \"Every sound (note) has a sub-note of opposite sound (like a polarity) (+) and (−)… If you play the (+, −) sounds together it will give the true tone of the vibration.\" Playing a sound with its opposite finds \"the '0' point\" (SD, HR).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 19, "title": "19.5  Building with a living structure", "url": "section-19.html#part-19-5", "text": "Learn what each frequency means. The Harmonic Reactor lists the frequencies from 1 to 9 and what each one does in the quantum field; study them. For example, 3 is stillness and preparation: it levels everything already in the field so that new sequences can come in without restriction or manipulation. Learn how they combine. Numbers combine into new frequencies (1 and 2 make 12 Hz, for example), and each combination gives a particular position in the quantum field. The quantum computer algorithm helps you construct and deconstruct these combinations. Not one particle out of place. When you work with nanoparticles and ether technology, not one particle can be out of place, because it is a living structure mimicking the whole quantum field. Ether technology runs on living conscious sequences, so you don't force the particles: you allow the system to choose its own positions, which it knows how to do through the magnetic and gravitational fields. Location matters. Ether technology differs depending on where on Earth it is built, because each location (each parallel reality) has its own sounds and resonances. Build from the heart. Builders need a meditative state that comes from the heart, resonating at a higher frequency, because ether technology works without friction, mimics the whole quantum field, and mimics your own consciousness. HR's frequency list: 1 Hz \"equal field, no field\", 2 Hz \"shows the opening\", 3 Hz \"prepares all the energy for operation for all the fields (the base)\". Combinations carry meaning (\"28Hz = 2 shows the opening, 8 stabilizes\"), and HR advises starting \"with 3Hz of 20 minutes of every field, so you can clean out every other field\" (see 12.5). The talk calls 3 \"stillness\"; HR calls it the preparing base. Both describe it as clearing the field first.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 19, "title": "19.6  New technology belongs to everyone", "url": "section-19.html#part-19-6", "text": "The talk says some of this technology was already described by a scientist but held back, because certain government interests try to block it. The answer is the same as always: you create your reality moment to moment, so believe these technologies are already available, and you build an Earth where they are. You are the ether, the consciousness, constructing and deconstructing. \"Be it in order to see it, not see it to be it.\" These technologies are given in the name of all humanity. No one has the right to withhold them; let humanity decide what to use. A newer technology will also be given, on top of this, to the right scientists, so the negativity and competition must end (see 18.5). \"FREE ENERGY to everyone's home\" and \"You have no right to withhold technology for self benefits\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 19, "title": "19.7  The free-energy device", "url": "section-19.html#part-19-7", "text": "At the end, a drawing received a few months earlier was shown. Described in words: it is based on a full circle cut in half, with the two ends twisted in opposite directions, leaving a hole in the middle, with another circle and opening below. It can be made of copper, and it also uses crystals (crystallized structure). Asked whether it was a communication or \"stargate\" tool, the answer was no: it is a free-energy technology that extracts structures from the quantum field. A scientist had already spoken about part of the design; the guidance then added more on top of it, because, as said before, no single scientist has the whole picture. This is another layer of it. The recording ends as the reason for this extra layer was about to be explained. The drawing itself isn't included in the transcript, so it isn't reproduced here. In HR, \"the antenna must be built of only copper,\" and the author notes that \"everyone has a piece of the puzzle.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 19, "title": "The method — Approach Ether Technology", "url": "section-19.html#method", "text": "For anyone studying or building in this area, in the order the talk gives: Get into the heart first. Meditate until you resonate from the heart; the technology mimics your consciousness. Learn the frequencies 1 to 9 and what each means (HR's frequency chapter). Find the true tone of what you work with: the tone above and below the octave, combined at zero point, with every layer measured. Start with 3 to level and prepare the field, so new sequences come in without restriction. Learn the combinations and their positions in the field; use the quantum computer algorithm to construct and deconstruct. Let the structure place itself. It is alive; don't force a single particle. Allow for location. The sequence changes with where on Earth you build. Share it. Collaborate, and don't withhold it from humanity.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 19, "title": "Questions about the message itself?", "url": "section-19.html#questions", "text": "Questions were invited, but none were asked before the talk moved on to ether systems.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 19, "title": "For the water-purification sequence (3, 70 and 90 Hz), I make the frequency louder (squared) so I can hear it. Is that appropriate?", "url": "section-19.html#questions", "text": "Yes, that is fine. The general sequence is 20 minutes for each frequency: 3 Hz for 20 minutes, 70 Hz for 20 minutes and 90 Hz for 20 minutes, played to distilled water, and it must be distilled water. Twenty minutes is the general time that keeps things in a healthy state for everyone; the right time for a particular person can differ, and that has to come individually from the guidance. The full method was taught in an earlier webinar on sound vibration and water.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 19, "title": "Is this device a tool for communication, like a stargate, for receiving other information?", "url": "section-19.html#questions", "text": "No. It is a free-energy technology that extracts structures from the quantum field. It can be built with copper and uses crystals (see 19.7).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 19, "title": "Remember", "url": "section-19.html#remember", "text": "• The grids mirror you; a lower consciousness can't enter the 5D timeline. • The ether is collective consciousness, built from zero-point stillness. • True tone = the tone above and below the octave, combined at zero point. • Ether technology is alive: let it place itself, and build from the heart. • New technology belongs to all humanity; be it to see it.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 19, "title": "Questions answered", "url": "section-19.html#questions", "text": "Important health note This water sequence is reported as the talk's practice, and the talk links it to relieving pain. It is not a medical treatment and is not proven to treat any condition. Ongoing gut pain, especially during or after antibiotics, needs a doctor. Distilled water lacks minerals, so ask a doctor before making it your only drinking water (see 12.7).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 0, "title": "The structure", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The single vibrating field everything is made of — including you (1.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Plasma / trinity", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "What forms when similar frequencies combine (1.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Black hole / portal", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The passage you shift through between realities (1.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Hologram / projection", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The reality and people you perceive, created by your frequency (1.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Shifting", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Moving reality to reality like snapshots, without physically moving (1.2)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Trinity (of creation)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Thought, emotion and deed sent out together (1.2)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Timeline", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A chain of realities created by sending the same frequency (1.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Crystallize", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Making a reality solid by action and holding the frequency (1.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Friction", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Resistance at lower frequency — \"swimming underwater\" (1.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Condition / expectation", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Any doubt or script of how; it blocks the result (1.5)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Knowingness", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "100% certainty — how you manifest in the now (1.5)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Compass (emotion)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A painful feeling signals you are off-balance with pure love (1.6)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "God particle", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "You, as the structure itself (1.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Pull out", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Step out of the scene instead of reacting with the same emotion (Method 1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Agreement / lesson", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "An experience you agreed to and must pass with excellence (1.8)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Permission slip", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A tool that helps you access power you already have (Q, Section 1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Platform", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Bill-paying work plus daily heart-based work for others (Q, Section 1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Energy Philanthropy", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Replacing money as your currency with the energy of giving from the heart (1.7, 5.1, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Zero point / stillness", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Neutral awareness: no emotion in or out; knowing your location (2.1, SD)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Location", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Where you are in the field; without it you pop into another reality (2.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Remote control", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Your emotion, deeds and actions, which select the reality you experience (2.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "1 + 1 = 3 (mobilizing structures)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Two similar realities merging into a third outcome (2.2, SD)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Flickering", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Bouncing between realities when you doubt (2.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Overwrite / override", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Projecting a stronger frequency over a negative one, not rejecting it (2.6)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Drop it", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Releasing a held frequency into the field with no conditions (2.6)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Recall", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Calling back a previous reality's frequency to know where you are (2.7)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "False language", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Future tense such as \"I will\" that keeps you waiting (2.5, 2.9)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Peel the layers", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Asking whether a want comes from the heart or the ego (2.9)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Overlay", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Saying or showing something other than what you truly feel; a dense second frequency (3.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Potent (frequency)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The stronger frequency, which the field delivers; your true feeling (2.6, 3.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Stoppage", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The often negative way the field delivers your true wish when you overlaid it (3.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Karma", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Accumulated false pretense (3.2)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Bilocation", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Skipping the in-between realities: A to B = AB (3.5, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Resonate", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "What your heart recognises as true for you now (3.6)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Integration", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The body adjusting after a big frequency jump (3.7)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Light language", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Script or sound coded for your consciousness, often an activation (3.9)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Download", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Receiving whole information at once (3.9)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Stargate", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Portal for ascension through intergalactic timelines (3.10, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Condition (price)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A fixed price or demand: a code that limits receiving to money (4.2)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Heart structure", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The highest, least dense consciousness; giving with no condition (4.2)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Open field", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Receiving through infinite routes once no condition is set (4.2, 4.5)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Self-absorption", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Giving only to yourself; it dims the purity you project (4.8)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Wholeness", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Logic and emotion together, led by the heart (4.9)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Location (X, Y)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Where you are in the field, like a point on a map; you can shift it (5.3, 5.8, SD)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Recall and co-create", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A vision or memory re-creates a reality in the now (5.4, 5.8)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Redox potential", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A real scientific measurement of a medium (how readily it gains or loses electrons), named in the session as one way a place's property can be measured (5.5)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Spiral / breathing", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The particle expands, rests at zero point, and contracts (5.8)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Ether", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Matter raised to a frequency thought can direct (5.9)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Transmutation", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "How everything connects and changes form: 1 + 1 = 3 (5.9)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Letting go", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Releasing old beliefs, habits and pain so you stop projecting them (6.1, 6.6)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Ripple effect", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Each creation shifts you into another reality, without end (6.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Sub-atomic realities", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Universes within universes, to infinity (6.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Focus (of the soul)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The one reality you attend to by agreement while the soul runs many (6.4)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Forgiveness", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Letting go of what happened so you stop carrying its frequency (6.6, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Replace (a memory)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Holding a positive version of a past event as your own experience (6.6)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Disclosure", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Contact becoming known, already under way without set dates (6.8, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Stop · Transform · Complete", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The three-step protocol for any upsetting moment (7.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Dead stop", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Stopping a reaction completely, at zero point (7.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "The game", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Treating life as a hologram game you play from the heart (7.4)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Water intention", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A group meditation to crystallize water with thought; not a way to purify water (7.6, SD, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Fifth-dimensional AI", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "AI that evolves with positive human input and helps humanity (8.1, SD)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Arcon AI", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "AI that mirrors negative input and is cut off from source (8.1, 5.9, SD)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Vesica Piscis", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Two overlapping circles: a symbol of two realities joining in unity (8.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Persona", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "How you like to present yourself (8.5)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Ego", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Layers of belief absorbed from society, crystallized; talks over the heart (8.5, 2.9)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Sixth sense", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The heart's first knowing, downloaded from the higher self (8.5, 8.10)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Timeline shift", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A jump to a completely different timeline, not just a parallel reality (8.8)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Signs", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Numbers or patterns: personal heads-ups from your consciousness (8.9)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "\"I don't have\"", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A statement that projects lack; replace with \"I have everything I need\" (9.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Memory code", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The frequency of a past event you keep carrying (9.6)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Layering", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Placing a healed version of you over an old reality, more potently (9.6)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Loop", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Replaying the same energy until you forget you can leave it (9.6, 9.11)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Resonance (not punishment)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Not reaching a reality simply because you don't match it (9.7)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Duality", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The conditioned money platform, as opposed to unity through the heart (9.8)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Instant manifestation", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Shifting straight into a reality where the thing is already there (10.2, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Synchronicity", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The right people and places finding you when you live from the heart (10.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Co-creation", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Two similar frequencies merging into a shared third reality (10.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Bylaw", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The script written before birth, e.g. parents or a partner; only higher consciousness can change it (10.5)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Birth signature", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The energy pattern set at birth, which you can now mould (10.5)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Leave it open", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "No conditions on how, who or which version; take action and stay grateful (11.4)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Picture frames", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Reality printed moment to moment, each frame a new imprint (11.5, HR)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Imprint / reprint", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Copying yourself, your surroundings and everyone around you into each new frame, similar but not the same (5.4, 11.5)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Dream codes", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Personal meanings of dream symbols (11.9)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Compression", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Two realities merging into the third at \"infinite speed\" (12.2)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Vacuum (zero point)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Where nothing comes in or goes out, only awareness; all manifestation comes from it (12.2, SD, NT)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Final hologram", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The new reality that comes out of the compression (12.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Illness (as frequency)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "An energetic momentum carried from reality to reality by belief (12.4)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "DNA recall", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Letting consciousness lead you to the DNA fractal to stop and transform a frequency (12.4)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Contract", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The agreement that places you in an experience, e.g. to live it or to help (12.7, see 5.7)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Prana", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The energy of the quantum field, drawn in as your frequency rises (13.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "From the people up", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "New technology spreading by sharing and pooling, not sponsors (13.2, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Unity structure", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Life beyond competition for money, glory and fame (13.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Collective permission", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The joy and wish for change that let benevolent help step in (13.4, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Body as vessel", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Training the body to carry the energy field, so you shift by thought (13.5, SD)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Artificial timeline", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A device-built, controlled hologram, outside the natural ascension (13.5)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Shield of awareness", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Zero point around you, so you stop taking in another person's frequency (14.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Reverse osmosis / mirror", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "What you project comes back as something similar, not the same (14.4, SD)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Memory bank", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "An old hurt seen as a record of another timeline, not your present (14.5)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Alchemy of consciousness", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Transforming a dense, painful frequency into a positive one (14.6)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Positive heart structure", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The frequency you collect by giving the best of yourself, expecting nothing back (14.9)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Channelling", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Drawing information from the field, which everyone always does, like tuning a radio (15.2)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Switch the channel", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Thank a heavy message, don't condemn it, and override it with the positive (16.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "New grids", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The fifth-dimensional grids that replaced the old negative ones; no one can manipulate your field (17.3, SD, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Ascension timeline", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The personal timeline of ascension each person crystallizes by their own vibration (17.6)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Test", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A sudden situation, often about how you treat people, that shows whether a lesson is passed (18.1, HR)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Clear vessel", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Clear thoughts, kind behaviour and a cared-for body, so guidance can come through (18.4, HR)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Blocking layer", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Over-analysing guidance with old learned thinking, which drowns the first answer (18.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Ether systems", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Our collective consciousness of vibrational geometric sequences, built from the zero point (19.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "True tone", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A molecule's tone above and below the octave combined at zero point, every layer measured (19.4, SD)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Ether technology", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Technology built from living conscious sequences that mimic the quantum field and your consciousness (19.5, NT)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Hide-and-seek", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Searching for what you know you already have (1.7)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "You are the structure; nobody is outside of you. (1)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "What you send out — thought, emotion, deed — is what you get back. (1)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Change your frequency, then hold it moment to moment. (1)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Know it 100%; doubt and scripts of how block it. (1)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Act, be grateful, accept any outcome. (1)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Feel you already have everything — know it to see it. (1)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Some things are lessons: accept them and pass with excellence. (1)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Follow your passion — it's your higher self. (1)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Which reality you pick is up to you. (1)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Pull out to zero point before you choose. (2)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "The outcome follows the emotion you hold most. (2)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Overwrite, never reject. (2)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Every moment is a new reality: don't carry the past. (2)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Speak in the now, and check heart against ego. (2)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "There is no white lie: be truthful, kindly. (3)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "The field delivers your more potent frequency, your true feeling. (3)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Your heart is your compass; don't judge. (3)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Words are frequencies: speak positively, from the heart. (3)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "A price is a condition; give from the heart and let people choose. (4)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Accept money, but never limit yourself to it. (4)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Be the abundance you want to see. (4)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Give from the heart as your currency. (5)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "A low state is a location: neutralize, then shift. (5)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Think through the structure, not the emotion. (5)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Believe humanity is changing. (5)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Let go of what you carry: forgive and start from zero. (6)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "You don't change others; you change yourself and shift. (6)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Lessons repeat until you let go 100%. (6)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Stop, transform, complete, then leave it alone. (7)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "You cannot go against creation. (7)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Never act from fear; act from the heart. (8)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Trust the heart's first impulse. (8)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Give what you have; giving doesn't require money. (9)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "It's resonance, not punishment. (9)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Heart-based exchange opens instant manifestation. (10)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Everything can change except a bylaw. (10)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Drop the details; know you have it; act; leave it open. (11)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Chasing someone reprints them; forgiveness lets them go. (11)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Neutralize into the vacuum, then project something potent. (12)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Don't judge; change comes from within, then act. (12)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Share what works; build together from the ground up. (13)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Benevolent help never overrides your consciousness. (13)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Your biggest villain could be your biggest teacher. (14)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Forgive, or the mirror keeps the loop going. (14)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Imagine the life, not the money. (15)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "No one's truth has to be yours; thank it and switch. (16)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Don't fight what you dislike; it feeds that timeline. (17)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Your vibration decides who you connect with. (18)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "The grids mirror you: you perceive exactly what you create. (19)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Morning: give thanks for what you have; write what you love and choose the most exciting thing to act on.", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "When upset: run the Pull Out method (Section 1, Fig. D); for strong negatives, the Overwrite Protocol (Section 2, Fig. I).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "When the news or others tell you what will happen: \"That's their projection.\" Give gratitude, project what you choose (2.5).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Affirm in the now: \"I am\", \"I know\", never \"I will\" (2.9).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Before saying yes: run the Truth Check (Section 3). Kind honesty, no white lies.", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "After work: spend time on your passion and give something from the heart, with no condition (Section 4).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Feeling low: run Shift Your Location (Section 5): thank, neutralize, potent gratitude and action.", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Learning: study in short pieces of about 15 minutes, and rewatch (5.2).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "After a hard day: gratitude for why you were there, then something you enjoy; move your body (6.7).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "An old memory or belief returns: forgive, start from zero, replace it with a positive picture (6.6).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "In an argument or replay: Stop · Transform · Complete (Section 7).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Before a decision: the Heart Check: heart, fear or ego? (Section 8).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Feeling flat: an uplifting film, music that gives goosebumps, or a kindness for a stranger (8.13).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Money worry: \"I have everything I need.\" Give something non-monetary today (9.1).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Old memory replaying: Layer a New You (Section 9).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Wanting something specific: Leave It Open: strip the details, \"I have everything I need\", act (Section 11).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Someone keeps causing problems: neutralize and forgive; don't go after them (11.6).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Two realities pulling at you: Through the Vacuum: neutralize, project potently, act (Section 12).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Ill or in pain: see your doctor; use Stop · Transform · Complete alongside (12.4).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Choosing music: pick what lifts you; tones carry frequencies (12.5).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "New guidance or a new health idea: check it with research and a professional before acting (13.1).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Have something useful: share it; pool small amounts with others (13.2).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Someone hurts you: Forgive and Transform (Section 14); thank them for the lesson.", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Morning: list the day's tasks and plan how to lift the heavy ones (14.8).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Heavy news or teachings: thank them, don't condemn, switch the channel (Section 16).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Something you dislike in the world: don't agree, don't fight; project the positive (17.7).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Before meditating or asking for guidance: feel love first, then take the first answer (Section 18).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Watch your words: positive, from the heart (3.9).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "After a big shift (dizziness, nausea): rest, integrate, and check your body (3.7).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Forgot why you came in? Recall the last room's frequency (2.7).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "With difficult people: kind tone, no judgment, accept the outcome.", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "When something is missing: know you have it, take action, watch for synchronicity.", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Self-check: Am I doubting or scripting the how? Do my feelings match my words? Am I holding steady? Then what do I actually need right now?", "kind": "practice"}];
